<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">MAT-MAT-NGƆMBƐ-BONDJALE</book>
  <para style="h">MATAYO</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mat</para>
  <para style="toc2">MATAYO</para>
  <para style="toc1">Bwɛndi Bopele elenge ekoma Matayo</para>
  <para style="mt1">Bwɛndi Bopele elenge ekoma Matayo</para>
  <para style="mt2">Bwɛndi Bopele elenge ekoma Matayo</para>
  <para style="imt">Eingeli e buku</para>
  <para style="ip">Ta bokɔkɔ bo Ekelesa, bakabale boo Matayo odaka moputedji o puti ko yona oimeaka mopɔsɔlu o Yesu, akomaka Bwɛndi Bopele elenge Matayo. Mokomi, ta Bwɛndi Bopele bu, akaenɛ meako minɛnɛ ko bohali. Yesu aenɛmi ta Bwɛndi Bopele bu elenge molehi monɛnɛ, okalehe bonɔ balehi basusu. Inango i bileho bi nde idi Bokumu bo busa kaoko Bokumu bo Ndjakomba, tine boo Matayo talangake kombe e Ndjakomba bilangalanga elenge balehi bakina.</para>
  <para style="is">Modjɔ motina</para>
  <para style="ip">Isolo inɛnɛ i mokanda mu ibangi na masolo mabae ma eingeli: isolo i mbangi ko bobwɛngɛ bo Yesu 1, 1-2, 23; ko isolo i Yesu na Yoane Mobatisi 3, 1-4, 16. Ngɔngɔ imina, bikenge bitano bi masolo bisakimanaka ko bisukeaka ta ekenge e suka e isolo. Engi ekenge ebɔngedjamaka diko i eleho enɛnɛ emɔti ko esukeaka na mibalo mi «Ehole esidjaka Yesu bopa bileho bi nde» Endja pongono ta 7, 28; 11, 1; 13, 53; 19, 1; 26, 1.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ekenge e boso 4, 17-8, 17: ta Galilea, Yesu abangedji ta ngondo Bokumu bo busa na ndjea e mibalo ko misala mi nde. «Bileho ta diko i ikoli» bidi molema mo ekenge ye. Ekenge e babae 8, 18-12, 21: Yesu abei batingami bɛngi basale engbanga na nde ta elomu e nde. Eenɛmi ta eleho e midjɔ miboani na bu bokɔ ta elomu. Ekenge e basato 12, 22-16, 20: ebalamaka boo Yesu adi nda. Nongokobea bapalusai ko balehi ba mobeko baimodimeaka, Yesu adimedjaka boo ibota i nde i soti idi: bato, bali kaoko bami, bia bakɔkɔ bolulea bo «Sango yona odi o diko» 12, 50. Abakwedjaka ta djebeli e mbombi e Bokumu bo diko na ndjea e bileho bi masɛ sambo. Ekenge e banɛi 16, 21-20, 34 einedjaka bobakama bo nde ta ekulusu: Ekelesea edi inango i yu, bileho bi epeali bidi ta tei ekenge e eleho enɛnɛ e banɛi. Ekenge e batano 21, 1-25, 46 einedjaka boimea bo nde ta Yelusalɛmɛ ko bohɛedjama bo mokita mo Yesu na bakondji ba bayuda. Eleho enɛnɛ e suka ebalaka ta tina e suka e bihole.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ekenge e suka e masolo 26, 1-28, 20 edi na masolo ma saya endolo pongono masolo ma ndingo. Mabalamaka ta tine saya, bogwa ko bopusoa bo Yesu. Na ndjea emina, ngondo eyenie ebotami ko batingami babeami botɔndɔ Bwɛndi Bopele ta bikomi bisusu bi ngondo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Bwɛndi Bopele elenge ekoma Matayo bodihi gala enɛnɛ mbala emɔti. Bato ba bowɛi ibadaka bakiloto ta mbangi e Ekelesa badaka bomolanga ko bomosalea bobuke ta biunga bi bobo. Ta misala mikina, babwɛndji badaka elenge embete e Bwɛndi Bopele elenge ekoma Matayo. Na bea ta mbangi, edaka isolo i moto, tengasa molɔngɔ monɛnɛ mo boso mo mbilimedjaka diko i Yesu elenge moto mɛnɛ, Mwana mɛnɛ o Isalɛlɛ. Ngɔngɔ i bianga 1.800 moembi Yoane Seba Basu aangɔdjɔkɔ Yesu elenge moto mɛnɛ ko Ndjakomba mɛnɛ na ndjembo imɔti ipele: enɔngi e Yesu elenge mosɛnɔke Matayo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ta eleho e nde tine Bokumu bo diko, Yesu ambilimedjaka tine moda mo moto na moto ko bosambedjama bo suka. Na ndjea emina akokedjaka eleho e Mose, ta mokanda mu mobeakabo «Mobeko mo Mose» kaoko oto «Mobeko». Mobeko ko Bwɛndi Bopele tebosanedjake, inango idi oko imɔti Iputo: sepi edi boo opalame na Ndjakomba. Modjɔ mobokamoa modi boo bopele bodoi adiso na ndjea e Yesu obakamaka ta ekulusu ko apusoaka. Busa bu naikina, bakilito baenɛkɛ na Bwɛndi Bopele elenge Matayo ndjea e bohela ta Ekelasa, idi iputo i batingami ba Yesu, ibakalimea na isolo i bana ba Isalɛlɛ ko idi tina e bato basusu.</para>
  <para style="is">Tine bokɛ mɛnɛ bohali</para>
  <para style="ip">Bato banɛnɛ bakalɛdje boo Bwɛndi Bopele bu bokomamaka tine bayuda ibaimeaka batingami ba Yesu Kilito. Bayuda bamina badaka bakɛkɛ mɛnɛ ta boso bo bapalusai, ibadaka banɛnɛ mɛnɛ. Bapalusai badaka bato basapaka mɛnɛ, tine bopingedja ko boemea ilako i bayuda ilidaka na etumba epipo, ta ehole eduaka basoda ba Loma botumba tepelo e Yelusalɛmɛ ta yanga e 70, ta ehole e biso bakilito, ko bosɔmbɔtɔnɔ bokimanaka ngɔngɔ i botumbama bo tepelo. Na tina emina motubano modaka ta pakaso e bayuda ibaimeaka bakilito ko bapalusai na bayuda bakina. Ihɔdjɔ ipipo inɔkɔ ta Bwɛndi Bopele bu: bato ba Isalɛlɛ ko basuku ba bobo balonaka Yesu ko bo basusu basambedjamaka (23). Enakobea, Matayo atainedjaka boo adi moloni o iputo i bayuda, tengasa mibalo mi Yesu midaka mipipo boso mɛnɛ adi batingami ba nde. Abambilimedjaka ta bhuda: ta Bokumu bo Ndjakomba, losusu loipama ko losusu lotungiti, na bea etungi «bobota mbuma!» 21, 43 Ekadabo basuku ba Isalɛlɛ baidjebaka bokɔ, etungiti boo basuku ba Ekelesa badae pɛ bosɔmbɔ bokɔ ibunga imina. Bohomba bodjeba ta mbɛngɛ Mobeko mo Mose na ndjea e Bwɛndi Bopele bo Yesu Kilito, edi na tina enɛnɛ mɛnɛ.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAT 1" />
  <para style="s1">Bobotama bo Yesu ko bobwɛngɛ bo nde</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="LUK 3:23-38">Luk 3, 23-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 1:1" />Endja molɔngɔ mo bakɔkɔ ba Yesu Kilito, motitani o Dapiti mwana o Abalayama.<verse eid="MAT 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 1:2" />Abalayama abotaka Isaka, Isaka abotaka Djakobo, Djakobo abotaka Yuda ko bange i nde; <verse eid="MAT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 1:3" />Yuda abotaka Pɛlɛse ko Djela, na ndjea e mwali o nde Tamala; Pɛlɛsi abotaka Esɛlɔne, Elɛsɔne abotaka Alama; <verse eid="MAT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 1:4" />Alama abotaka Aminadabe; Aminadabe abotaka Nasɔni, Nasɔni abotaka Salimane; <verse eid="MAT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 1:5" />Salimane abotaka Boadji, na ndjea e Laaba; Boadji abotaka Obedi, na ndjea e Luta nange e nde; Obedi abotaka Yese; <verse eid="MAT 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 1:6" />Yese abotaka mokondji Dapiti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 1:6">Dapiti abotaka Salomo, na ndjea e mwali o Ulia; <verse eid="MAT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 1:7" />Salomo abotaka Loboame; Loboame abotaka Abia, Abia abotaka Asape; <verse eid="MAT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 1:8" />Asape abotaka Yodjapate, Yodjapate abotaka Yolame, Yolame abotaka Odjiase; <verse eid="MAT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 1:9" />Odjiase abotaka Yotame, Yotame abotaka Akadjia, Akadjia abotaka Edjekiasi; <verse eid="MAT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 1:10" />Edjekiasi abotaka Manasi, Manasi abotaka Amona, Amona abotaka Djodjiase; <verse eid="MAT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 1:11" />Djodjiase abotaka Djekonia yo na bange i nde bami, ta ehole e botomba bana ba Isalɛlɛ ta ngondo e Babilɔne<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta 2 Mik 24, 12-16.</char></note>.<verse eid="MAT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 1:12" />Ngɔngɔ i botomba bana ba Isalɛlɛ ta ngondo e Babilɔne, Djekonia abotaka Salatiela ko Saletiela abotaka Djolobabɛlɛ; <verse eid="MAT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 1:13" />Djolobabɛlɛ abotaka Abihudi, Abihudi abotaka Eliakimi; Eliakimi abotaka Adjole; <verse eid="MAT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 1:14" />Adjole abotaka Sadoka, Sadoka abotaka Akimi, Akimi abotaka Eliwudi; <verse eid="MAT 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 1:15" />Eliwudi abotaka Eliedjale, Eliedjale abotaka Matane, Matane abotaka Djakobo; <verse eid="MAT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 1:16" />Djakobo abotaka Esepu, momi o Malia; ko Malia adaka nange e Yesu, obeakabo Kilito.<verse eid="MAT 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 1:17" />Donga Abalayama mbunoko Dapiti, enɔkɔ mbota domi na inɛi, donga Dapiti mbunoko ehole yena etombama bana ba Isalɛlɛ ta ngondo e Babilɔne, enɔkɔ naikina mbota domi na inɛi mbunoko bobotama bo Kilito.<verse eid="MAT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bobotama bo Yesu kilito</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="LUK 2:1-7">Luk 2, 1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 1:18" />Endja moda mobotama Yesu Kilito: Malia, nange e nde, ahɔmɔkɔ moki na Esepu. Endolo boso boo badae ndako emɔti, Malia aimeaka na demi na ngulu e Mwembo Mosɛnɔke. <verse eid="MAT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 1:19" />Esepu mohɔmi o nde adaka moto o bodjo. Elenge aidaka na posa e bomokedja Malia sɔni ta miso ma bato, atombaka meko e bogbɔtɔ na nde ta mbombi. <verse eid="MAT 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 1:20" />Yana adaka Esepu bolɛdjɛ moda mobokokedja meako mimina, obwɛndji o Kumu asenɛmedjaka na ndjɔti ko abalaka na nde: «Esepu motitani o Dapiti, pɛ bobanga botomba Malia mwali o wɛ, tengasa mwana yona odi ta sɔpɔ i nde, amolwai na ngulu e Mwembo Mosɛnɔke. <verse eid="MAT 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 1:21" />Abotake mwana momi ko wamopake kombe Yesu, tengasa edi yo moto aheledjake bato ba ekomi e nde ta mabe ma bobo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yesu </char><char style="fp" closed="false">ebaeli e Gɛlɛki </char><char style="fp" closed="false">etingodji: Kumu adi mohelo.</char></note>»<verse eid="MAT 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 1:22" />Midjɔ mimina misusu makɔmɔke tine bokokedja mibalo imibalaka Kumu na ndjea e mbaeli o Ndjakomba:<verse eid="MAT 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 1:23" />«Moseka oda pɛ bodjeba bami,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:23">yo alwake demi, abotake mwana momi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:23">bamobeake Emanuelɛ!»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="MAT 1:23">Atingodjaka: «Ndjakomba engbanga na su».<verse eid="MAT 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 1:24" />Ehole esisoaka Esepu, asumaka mibalo mibalaka obwɛndji o Kumu na nde ko atombaka Malia elenge mwali o nde. <verse eid="MAT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 1:25" />Endolo Esepu aiputoana na Malia mbunoko ehole ebotaka Malia mwana momi ko amobeaka kombe Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAT 2" />
  <para style="s1">Banganga ba mawɛi badoi aendja Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 2:1" />Yesu abotamaka ta Bɛtɛlɛmɛ ta mokpɔtɔ mo Yuda, ta ehole edaka Elode mokondji. Ta ehole emina, banganga ba mawɛi badongaka ta pamba ekime modakabusa baduaka ta Yelusalɛmɛ <verse eid="MAT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 2:2" />ko bahɔdjɔkɔ: «Mwana odi mokondji o Bayuda abotami yo djɔ? Loeni mondjɔtɔ o nde boima ta pamba ekime modakabusa ko lodoi amokumedja.» <verse eid="MAT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 2:3" />Ehole eokaka mokondji Elode gala emina, molema mo nde motungeamaka mɛnɛ engbanga emɔti na bato ba Yelusalɛmɛ. <verse eid="MAT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 2:4" />Aputoanedjaka bakondji ba banganga ba Ndjakomba ko na balehi ba mobeko, abahɔdjɔkɔ: Aboani Kilito bobotama djɔ? <verse eid="MAT 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 2:5" />Bamosɔmbedjaka: «Ta Bɛtɛlɛmɛ e mokpɔtɔ mo Yuda. Tengasa endja mibalo mikomaka mbaeli o Ndjakomba:<verse eid="MAT 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 2:6" />“Wɛ, Bɛtɛlɛmɛ, ta tei e mokpɔtɔ mo Yudea,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:6">pɛ bosenɛ ngasa ta tei e mokpɔtɔ mo Yudea,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:6">tengasa edake na wɛ mokondji aimake,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:6">yona adaledjake bato ba mbi, Isalɛlɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mik 5, 1.</char></note>.” »<verse eid="MAT 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 2:7" />Na bea, Elode abeaka banganga ba mawɛi na mbombi ko ahombaka bodjeba adi bo ehole ndani eimaka mondjɔtɔ. <verse eid="MAT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 2:8" />Na bea abalomaka ta Bɛtɛlɛmɛ, abalaka: «Kɛni ahomba soti e meako ta tina e mwana; ko ehole amotaneakeno, djebedjanini, bɛngi mbi pongono, nakɛ amokumedja.»<verse eid="MAT 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 2:9" />Ngɔngɔ iboka mibalo mi mokondji, bakɛkɛ. Baenɛkɛ naikina mondjɔtɔ yona oimaka ta dɔngɔ ikime modakabusa: bodala boso bo bobo ko aimeaka bo ta polo yena edaka mwana, moemaka. <verse eid="MAT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 2:10" />Ehole enɛkɛbo mondjɔtɔ omina, balumaka na mongandi. <verse eid="MAT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 2:11" />Bakwɛaka ta ndako ko baenɛkɛ mwana na nange e nde, Malia. Bakwaka magbundɔ tine bokumedja mwana; ngɔngɔ badipoaka bingbongolo bi bobo ko bamobondjeaka makabo: wolo, paka malasi, ko na malasi imakɔbo na mole mo mile. <verse eid="MAT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 2:12" />Ngɔngɔ imina, Ndjakomba abatɔndeaka na ndjea e ndjɔti badae pɛ bosɔmbɔ adi Elode; na bea bayanaka ta ngando e bobo na ndjea ekina.<verse eid="MAT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Botili ta Edjipito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 2:13" />Ehole eyanaka banganga ba mawɛi, obwɛndji o Kumu ainɛmɛkɛ na Esepu na ndjɔti ko abalaka na nde: «Angɔ, tomba Mwana engbanga na nange e nde ko tiani ta Edjipito; dikamani oho mbunoko ehole eodjebedjake mbi ohuleni. Tengasa Elode ahombaka bowa mwana.» <verse eid="MAT 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 2:14" />Esepu aangɔkɔ, atombaka mwana engbanga na nange e nde, ta ndanda e bulu ko atiaka ta Edjipito. <verse eid="MAT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 2:15" />Bayeyoaka oho mbunoko bogwa bo Elode. Midjɔ mimina miimeaka tine bokokedja meako mibalaka Kumu na ndjea e mbaeli o Ndjakomba: «Nabei mwana o mbi boima ta Edjipito<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Osea 11, 1.</char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mangbai ma bogwakaka bo bana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 2:16" />Ehole esipoaka Elode boo banganga ba mawɛi bamokosei, aimeaka na kɛlɛ enɛnɛ mɛnɛ. Apaka ndjea ebowakaka, ta Bɛtɛlɛmɛ ko ta ngando i mbuti, bobanga bana ba bianga bibae botita; bokimana midjɔ mimotɔndeaka banganga ba mawɛi, ta tina e ehole eimaka mondjɔtɔ. <verse eid="MAT 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 2:17" />Na bea meako misusu mikokedjamaka elenge abalaka mbaeli o Ndjakomba Yilimeya:<verse eid="MAT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 2:18" />«Moholi mokamaka ta Lama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">biyo ko na bosayeana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">Edi Laele ayeaka bana ba nde,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">aloni bamopingedje malɛi, tengasa bana ba nde bagwi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yil 31, 15.</char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ihule i Edjipito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 2:19" />Ngɔngɔ i bogwa bo Elode, obwɛndji o Kumu asenɛmedjaka na ndjɔti adi Esepu, ta Edjipito. <verse eid="MAT 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 2:20" />Abalaka na nde: «Angɔ, tomba Mwana engbanga na nange e nde ko yana ta ngondo e Isalɛlɛ, tengasa bato bahombaki bowa Mwana, basi bogwa.» <verse eid="MAT 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 2:21" />Na bea Esepu aangɔkɔ, atombaka Mwana engbanga na nange e nde ko basɔmbɔkɔ ta ngondo e Isalɛlɛ. <verse eid="MAT 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 2:22" />Endolo aokayo boo Alikelawusi atitanaka ta polo e sange e nde Elode elenge kumu ta mokpɔtɔ mo Yuda, abangaka boyana. Ndjakomba akebedjaka naikina Esepu na ndjɔti ko akɛkɛ ta mokpɔtɔ mo Galilea. <verse eid="MAT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 2:23" />Akɛkɛ bodikama ta ngando e Nasaleta. Ekɔmɔ bea tine bokokedjama bo mobalo mo ba mbaeli ba Ndjakomba: «Abeamake mo Nasaleta.»<verse eid="MAT 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAT 3" />
  <para style="s1">Eleho e Yoane Mobatisi</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAL 1:1-8">Mal 1, 1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luk 3, 1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yoa 1, 19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 3:1" />Oko ta ehole emina, Yoane Mobatisi adaka bodumbea ta etengelenge e Yuda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Etengelenge e Yudea </char><char style="fp" closed="false">mokpɔtɔ moluma na bato modaka ta pakaso e molɔngɔ mo Kɛlɛte e Yelusalɛmɛ na Ebɔ ko na duwa e Bogo kaoko Yolodani e tei.</char></note> ko abangaka boleha. <verse eid="MAT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 3:2" />Abalaka: «Hombedjani milema mi bino<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hombedjani milema </char><char style="fp" closed="false">makoma makina </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Hombedjani malɛi </char><char style="fp" closed="false">kaoko hombedjani mida mi bino.</char></note>, tengasa Bokumu bo diko bobatami!» <verse eid="MAT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 3:3" />Yoane adi yona obalaka buku e mbaeli o Ndjakomba Isaya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">«Edi moholi mo moto yona adumbeaka ta etengelenge:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">Bɔngedjani ndjea e Kumu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">Ninodjani ndjea e nde bodjɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isa 40, 3, elangama ta makoma mayou.</char></note>!»<verse eid="MAT 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 3:4" />Yoane adaka bolwa bisendja bikɔbo na ngungi i tito okabeebo kamela ko mosenge mokɔbo na iposo i tito ta bongo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta 2 bak 1, 8. </char></note>; ayaaka ndoko ko pɔki i esika. <verse eid="MAT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 3:5" />Bato badaka bokɛ adi yo bodonga ta Yelusalɛmɛ, Yuda esusu ko na mabonga mambuti na Yolodane. <verse eid="MAT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 3:6" />Badaka bohuodja pekato i bobo ko Yoane abainaka ta duwa e Yolodane.<verse eid="MAT 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 3:7" />Elenge adaka Yoane aenɛ bapalusai ko na basadokai banɛnɛ bodua tine bodia inelo, na bea abalaka na bu: «Ibota i ndjɔ! Otɔndeini otieni kɛlɛ e Ndjakomba yena aduake nda? <verse eid="MAT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 3:8" />Botani mbuma i boinedja boo osɔmbɔtɔnini milema <verse eid="MAT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 3:9" />ko pɛ bolɛdjɛni bosabalea ta milema boo: “Abalayama adi kɔkɔ e biso<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kokanedja ta Yoa 8, 33, 37,39.</char></note>.” Tengasa nabalaka na nu soti boo Ndjakomba aboani boimedja bodonga ta mabanga mi, batitani ba Abalayama! <verse eid="MAT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 3:10" />Soka eyɛli mele tine bolena bitape na nginga: mole mosusu mopɛ bobota mbuma ipele mokwɛlɛmɛbi ko modumbamabi ta mosa. <verse eid="MAT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 3:11" />Mbi noinakani na madiba tine boinedja boo osɔmbɔtɔnini milema; endolo yona aduake ngɔngɔ i mbi, aonabini na Mwembo Mosɛnɔke ko na mosa. Anɔini na suweya: naboaniti nongo bosunama tine bolodja ngɔli i sapato i nde. <verse eid="MAT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 3:12" />Apeli ta ebɔ e nde ehɛhɛli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ehɛheli e bohɛhɛ: edi eka eboani na ehɛheli kaoko etanda ko ekakamoe ta bopukusa mbuma i bule tine bogbɔtodja mbuma na poso.</char></note> tine bogbɔtodja mbuma na poso. Aboleabi mbuma ta ekenge e ndako, endolo atumbabi poso ta mosa mokadae pɛ bodimea.»<verse eid="MAT 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Batisimo ba Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAL 1:9-11">Mal 1, 9-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luk 3, 21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 3:13" />Ta ehole emina, Yesu adongaka ta mokpɔtɔ mo Galilea ko akɛkɛ ta Yolodane; aimeaka adi Yoane bɛngi ainame na nde. <verse eid="MAT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 3:14" />Endolo Yoane alonaka ko abalaka: «Edi mbi moto oboani boinama na wɛ ko wɛ odoi adi mbi!» <verse eid="MAT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 3:15" />Endolo Yesu amosɔmbedjaka: «Kina boo ekɔme bea edɛdi! Tengasa endja mondumba moboanisu bokokedja meako mi bosoti mahɔdjɔkɔ Ndjakomba.» Na bea Yoane adimaka. <verse eid="MAT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 3:16" />Oko ta ehole einamaka Yesu, aimaka ta madiba. Ta ehole emina busa bodipoamaka tina e nde: aenɛkɛ Mwembo mo Ndjakomba botita diko i nde elenge embenga. <verse eid="MAT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 3:17" />Ko kɔpi eokamaka donga ta busa bobala: «Iyo adi Mwana o mbi oepaeli; nasepi na nde mɛnɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kokanedja ta Ndj 2, 7; Isa 42, 1.</char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAT 4" />
  <para style="s1">Bomekama bo Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAL 1:12-13">Mal 1, 12-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">Luk 4, 1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 4:1" />Ngɔngimina, Mwembo mo Ndjakomba modaledjaka Yesu ta e etengelenge bɛngi amekame na djabulu. <verse eid="MAT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 4:2" />Ngɔngɔ ibokia boyaka masu tuku inɛi ko mulu tuku inɛi, Yesu aokaka ndja. <verse eid="MAT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 4:3" />Djabulu, mokosi, abatamaka mbuti na nde ko abalaka: «Soti okada Mwana o Ndjakomba, bala na mabanga mi mahombane miya.» <verse eid="MAT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 4:4" />Yesu asɔmbedjaka: «Ekomama: “Moto atahela oto na miya, endolo na mobalo mosusu mokime ta monɔkɔ mo Ndjakomba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dit 8, 3.</char></note>.”»<verse eid="MAT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 4:5" />Na bea, djabulu amodaledjaka mbunoko Yelusalɛmɛ, ibonga isɛnɔke, amobakeaka ta sɔngɔ e Tepelo. <verse eid="MAT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 4:6" />Abalaka na nde: «Soti okada Mwana o Ndjakomba, sadumba na se; tengasa ekomama:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:6">“Ndjakomba apabi ndjea adi babwɛndji tina e wɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:6">ko bokabi na mɔmɔ ma bobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:6">tine boo eko e wɛ, esakataa ibanga.”»<verse eid="MAT 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 4:7" />Yesu amosɔmbedjaka: «Ekomama pongono: “Oboaniti bomeka Kumu, Ndjakomba o wɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dit 4, 16.</char></note>.”»<verse eid="MAT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 4:8" />Djabulu amotombaka naikina ta sɔngɔ e ikoli, amoinedjaka makumu masusu ma ngondo ko na ekumu e yu. <verse eid="MAT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 4:9" />Ko abalaka na nde: «Nopake losusu, ekadabo okwi magbundɔ tine bokumeani.» <verse eid="MAT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 4:10" />Na bea Yesu abalaka na nde: «Donga ena, djabulu! Tengasa ekomama: “Odi bokwa magbundɔ oko adi Kumu Ndjakomba o wɛ ko ongɔnɔ oko yo pɛ.”» <verse eid="MAT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 4:11" />Djabulu amokinaka. Ko babwɛndji baduaka mbuti na nde, tine bomokɔmedja.<verse eid="MAT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbangi e mosala Yesu ta Galilea</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Mlk 1, 14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luk 4, 14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 4:12" />Ehole eokaka Yesu boo baisi Yoane Mobatisi ta bɔlɔkɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yoane bamoisi ta bɔlɔkɔ </char><char style="fp" closed="false">edaka Yoane Mobatisi. Endja pongono ta 14, 3.</char></note>, asɔmbɔkɔ ta Galilea. <verse eid="MAT 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 4:13" />Endolo akinaka Nasaleta, akɛkɛ boda ta Kapalanauma, ibonga idaka mbuti na ibeke inɛnɛ i Galilea, ta mokpɔtɔ mo Djabilɔ ko na Nepetali<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Djabilɔ ko Nepetali: mabota mabae mayou ma pamba e sadiko i Isalɛlɛ.</char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 4:14" />Ekɔmɔkɔ bea tine bokokedja mibalo mi mbaeli o Ndjakomba Isaya:<verse eid="MAT 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 4:15" />«Mokpɔtɔ mo Djabilɔ, mokpɔtɔ mo Nepetali,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:15">ngando i mbuti na ibeke inɛnɛ, ngando i pamba e Yolodane:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:15">ngando i Galilea i bakɛndɛli!<verse eid="MAT 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 4:16" />Bato ibahelamaka ta modidi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:16">Baeni bohu bonɛnɛ!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:16">Tina e bia ibahelamaka ta modidi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:16">Soti baeni bohu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:16">Tina e bia bahelamaka ta ngondo e bago,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:16">He, bohu bonɛnɛ boenɛmi! <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isa 8, 23. 9, 1.</char></note>»<verse eid="MAT 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 4:17" />Donga ta ehole emina, Yesu abangaka bodumbea ko abalaka: «Hombedjani milema mi bino, tengasa Bokumu bo diko boimei mbuti!»<verse eid="MAT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu abei batingami ba boso</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mlk 1, 16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">Luk 5, 1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 4:18" />Yana adalaka Yesu ta yɔngɔ e mokula mo ibeke i Galilea, aenɛkɛ bange i bato babae ibia badaka baoweli ba swi: Simo obakeabo Piɛlɛ ko Andele mwange e nde. Ibo badaka badumba modjanga ta ibeke. <verse eid="MAT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 4:19" />Yesu abalaka na bu: «Kimananini ko noimedjeni bahombi ba bato.» <verse eid="MAT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 4:20" />Oko ta ehole emina, bakinaka midjanga mi bobo ko bamokimanaka. <verse eid="MAT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 4:21" />Ehole edalakayo moohali na bu, aenɛkɛ bakina menga bami babae, Djake ko Yoane, bana ba Djebede. Badaka ta bwato bo bobo na Djebede, sange e bobo, bobɔngedja midjanga mi bobo. Yesu ababeaka <verse eid="MAT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 4:22" />oko ta ehole emina, bakinaka bwato bo bobo, sange e bobo ko bakimanaka Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu alehi ko aheledji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 4:23" />Yesu adaka bodala ta mokpɔtɔ mo Galilea mosusu; boleha ta ba sinagoga i bobo, botɔndɔ Bwɛndi Bopele bo Bokumu bo diko ko boheledja bato na biego ko na bitumbɛ basusu. <verse eid="MAT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 4:24" />Na bea gala e nde enanganaka ta ngondo e Sulia esusu ko bamolwɛkɛ bato ba bipeko bi tungu isusu ko bego i tungu isusu: bato ba miembo mibe, bato bamasiesie ko na bato ibabukeanaka mako. Na bea Yesu adaka bobaheledja. <verse eid="MAT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 4:25" />Emumu e bato emokimanaka; bodonga ta mokpɔtɔ mo Galilea, donga ibonga i Dekapole, i Yelusalɛmɛ, na mokpɔtɔ mo Yuda ko mo pamba e Yolodane.<verse eid="MAT 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MAT 5" />
  <para style="s1">Bileho ta diko i ikoli</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="LUK 6:20-23">Luk 6, 20-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 5:1" />Ehole enɛkɛ Yesu emumu e bato, apeteaka ta ikoli ko adaa. Batingami ba nde babatamaka mbuti na nde <verse eid="MAT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 5:2" />ko abangaka bobaleha:<verse eid="MAT 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 5:3" />«Sepi adi batakeli ta mwembo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:3">tengasa Bokumu bo diko bodi tine bobo!<verse eid="MAT 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 5:4" />Sepi adi bia bayeaka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:4">tengasa bapingedjamake!<verse eid="MAT 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 5:5" />Sepi adi bato ba bomwii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:5">tengasa basangoake ngondo!<verse eid="MAT 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 5:6" />Sepi adi bia badi na ndja ko posa e bodjo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:6">tengasa bagolake!<verse eid="MAT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 5:7" />Sepi adi bia bakoke ba bina bu ndjokwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:7">tengasa babokeabi pongono ndjokwa!<verse eid="MAT 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 5:8" />Sepi adi bia badi na milema misɛnɔke,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:8">tengasa baenɛbi Ndjakomba!<verse eid="MAT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 5:9" />Sepi adi bato bakaduedje bogo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:9">tengasa babeamake bana ba Ndjakomba!<verse eid="MAT 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 5:10" />Sepi adi bato banɔngɔmɔkɔ tine bodjo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:10">tengasa Bokumu bo diko bodi tina e bobo!<verse eid="MAT 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 5:11" />Sepi ehole eosingakanibo, eonɔngedjinibo ko eokɔmeakani bo mabe masusu ta tina e mbi. <verse eid="MAT 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 5:12" />Sepani ko daani na mongandi, tengasa iputi i bino idi inɛnɛ oho o diko. Tengasa edaka okobea, elenge anɔngedjakabo ba mbaeli ba Ndjakomba ibadaka boso bo bino<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kokanedja 2 Tan 36, 16; Bik 7, 52.</char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Odini mongba ko bohu bo ngondo</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mlk 9, 50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:34-35">Luk 14, 34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 5:13" />«Ino odini monana mo ngondo. Endolo monana mokataka ngɛngɛ, moda moboani na nu bomosɔmbedja naikina ngɛngɛ nda? Moditi na sɔngi naikina; bamodumbake sokolu ko bato bamodalakake.<verse eid="MAT 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 5:14" />«Ino odini bohu bo ngondo, odini pongono ibonga itongami diko i ikoli, ibɔngiti bobolama. <verse eid="MAT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 5:15" />Moto ta bawanedjake molinda tine bomokukea na katini. Enakobea, bakamosɛpɛe diko i esɛpɛi, tine boo mongɛsɛe bato basusu i badi ta ndako. <verse eid="MAT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 5:16" />Na tina emina kina boo bohu bo bino bongɛse adi bato, bɛngi baenɛ misala mi bino mipele ko bokumedja Sange e bino yona odi ta busa.»<verse eid="MAT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Yesu ko mobeko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 5:17" />«Pɛ bolɛdjɛni boo nadoi tine bodongedja mobeko mo Mose ko na eleho e ba mbaeli ba Ndjakomba. Naidua tine bomidongedja endolo nadua tine bomikokedja. <verse eid="MAT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 5:18" />Tengasa, edi soti, nabalaka na nu: boso bo busa na kpɔtɔ bodimoe, pɛ nongo ikomi imɔti inɔi ikɛkɛ kaoko itɔnɔ ikadae diko idongetebi ta mobeko, mbunoko ta suka e midjɔ misusu. <verse eid="MAT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 5:19" />Na tina emina, moto mosusu wadongedjaka mobeko momɔti ta tei e mu ko alehake bato bakina bokɔ bea, adake moto ngasa ta Bokumu bo diko. Endolo yona asumake mobeko ko alehake bakina bokɔ bea adabi moto monɛnɛ ta Bokumu bo diko. <verse eid="MAT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 5:20" />Tengasa, nabalaka na nu: ekadaa bodjo bo bino bomitinɔ bua bo balehi ba mobeko ko na Bapalusai, oboanitini bokwea ta Bokumu bo diko.»<verse eid="MAT 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Eleho ta tina e kɛlɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 5:21" />«Okakani babala tina e bakɔkɔ ba biso: “Pɛ bowa moto; moto mosusu owake mwange e nde aboani nabosambedjama ta boso bo badjudji.” <verse eid="MAT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 5:22" />Endolo mbi, nabali na nu: moto mosusu opeake mwange e nde kɛlɛ asambedjamake ta boso bo badjudji; moto asingake mwange e nde: “Egegele!” Asambedjamake ta boso bo ibolea inɛnɛ i basuku ba bayuda. Yona asingake mwange e nde: “Endanga!” Adumbamake ta ipelu. <verse eid="MAT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 5:23" />Ekadabo okɛi ta polo ekatumbebo mbeka adi Ndjakomba ko wadjebaka boo odi na modjɔ na mwange e wɛ, <verse eid="MAT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 5:24" />kina ikabo i wɛ, ta boso bo polo ekatumbebo mbeka ko kɛɛ asɔmbedje bwela na mwange e wɛ; ngɔngɔ oboani bosɔmbɔ apa ikabo i wɛ adi Ndjakomba.<verse eid="MAT 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 5:25" />«Ekadabo moto aodihi na modjɔ, homba bosɔmbedja bwela na nde pɛpɛlɛ ehole edi no na ndjea. Esakadabo moloni o wɛ asakopunda adi badjudji, na bea djudji aopɛ ta mɔmɔ ma bapulusu ko baisake ta bɔlɔkɔ. <verse eid="MAT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 5:26" />Nabalaka na wɛ, okobea: otimake ta bɔlɔkɔ oko opute motuya mokɛkɛ mo nyongo e wɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Eleho tine bɔɔli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 5:27" />«Okani bobala boo: “Pɛ bokɔ bɔɔli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boi 20, 14; Dit 5, 18.</char></note>.” <verse eid="MAT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 5:28" />Endolo mbi, nabalaka na nu: momi mosusu oendji mwali okina na malɛno ma bomopala, akɔi na nde bɔɔli ta molema mo nde. <verse eid="MAT 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 5:29" />Na tina emina, ekada diso i wɛ i ebɔ e bami iotaedjaka ibaku, idongedja ko idumba bohali na wɛ. Tengasa, enɔi na bopele tina e wɛ bobungedja ekenge emɔti e wɛ e mokuku ta polo e bodumba mokuku mosusu ta ipelu. <verse eid="MAT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 5:30" />Na tina emina, ekada boo ebɔ e wɛ e bami iotaedjaka ibaku, elena ko edumba bohali na wɛ. Tengasa enɔi na bopele tina e wɛ, bobungedja ekenge emɔti e wɛ e mokuku ta polo e mokuku mosusu modumbame ta ipelu.»<verse eid="MAT 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Eleho ta tina e moki</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 19:9">Mat 19, 9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Mlk 10, 11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luk 16, 18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 5:31" />«Ebalama pongono: “Momi odongedji mwali o nde, atungi amopɛ mokanda mo bowa moki<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dit 24, 1.</char></note>.” <verse eid="MAT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 5:32" />Endolo mbi, nabalaka na nu: Momi mosusu odongedji mwali o nde ta moki, dongedja oko akɔi bɔɔli, amodipoi ndjea e bokɔ ndukeli. Ekadabo akwei moki mokina ko momi oasɔi mwali omina yo pongono akɔi bɔɔli.»<verse eid="MAT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Eleho ta tina e bhɛli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 5:33" />«Okakani pongono bobala na bakɔkɔ ba biso: “Pɛ bobhɛlɛ bhɛli e bolowa, endolo kokedja bobhɛlɛ bua bo bhɛli wɛ ta boso bo Kumu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Lew 19, 12; Mit 30, 3; Dit 23, 22-24.</char></note>.” <verse eid="MAT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 5:34" />Na bea nabalaka na nu, pɛ bobhɛlɛni nongo bhɛli emɔti: pɛ bobhɛlɛni nongo na kombe e diko, tengasa edi ngbɛndɛ e Ndjakomba; <verse eid="MAT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 5:35" />edae ta kpɔtɔ, tengasa edi edaeli e mako ma nde; edae ta Yelusalɛmɛ, tengasa edi ibonga inɛnɛ i mokondji. <verse eid="MAT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 5:36" />Pɛ bobhɛlɛ bhɛli na molo, tengasa oboaniti botɔedja nongo mombwi momɔti kaoko botɔedja moswe mohindo. <verse eid="MAT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 5:37" />Kina boo kɔpi e wɛ ekada “Eɛ, edike Eɛ”, ekada “Ngasa, edike ngasa”; ko mobalo mosusu modi bobakeama modongi adi Mokosi.»<verse eid="MAT 5:37" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Eleho ta tina e bobukanedja</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="LUK 6:29-30">Luk 6, 29-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 5:38" />«Okakani bobala boo: “Diso tine diso ko dino tine dino<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boi 21.24; Lew 24, 20; Dit 19, 21.</char></note>.” <verse eid="MAT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 5:39" />Endolo mbi, nabalaka na nu: pɛ bobukanedjani bobe na bobe. Ekada moto aobomi epapata ta mobanga modɔngɔ i ebɔ e bami, mopa pongono mobanga mo ebɔ e bali. <verse eid="MAT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 5:40" />Ekada boo moto atombi meko e bopunda ta sambi tine botomba esendja e wɛ, mopa pongono kasaka e wɛ. <verse eid="MAT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 5:41" />Ekadabo moto aolomi elomu na ngulu boo odale kilomɛtɛlɛ emɔti, wɛdala kilomɛtɛlɛ ibae engbanga na nde. <verse eid="MAT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 5:42" />Pa adi yona osɛngi moeka; endolo pɛ bolona bobekedja adi moto yona apalaka bobeka.»<verse eid="MAT 5:42" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Eleho ta tina e epaeli</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="LUK 6:27-28">Luk 6, 27-28</ref>.<ref loc="LUK 6:32-36">32-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 5:43" />«Okani bobala: “Otungi bopala mwange e wɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lew 19, 18.</char></note> ko lona moloni o wɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 5:44" />Endolo mbi, nabalaka na nu: palani baloni ba bino ko ongɔnɔkɔni tina e bato bia bokonɔngedjeni. <verse eid="MAT 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 5:45" />Na bea wadakeni bana ba Sange e bino, yona odi o diko. Tengasa akimedje modakabusa tina e bato bapele ko na bato babe, akadumbe mbuwa tina e bato ba bodjo ko na bato badi na taka e bodjo. <verse eid="MAT 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 5:46" />Ekadabo okapale oko bia bakopale, iputi idiabino adi Ndjakomba nda? Tengasa nongo baputedji ba puti bakakɔe pongono bea! <verse eid="MAT 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 5:47" />Ekadabo okaiseni oko ndese adi bange i bino, modjɔ mo bokamoa mokɔi no nda? Tengasa nongo bato ba bikomi bi bakɛndɛli bakakɔe pongono bea! <verse eid="MAT 5:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 5:48" />Na bea daani bato basɛnɔke elenge Sange e bino yona odi o diko adi Mosɛnɔke.»<verse eid="MAT 5:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MAT 6" />
  <para style="s2">Bileho ta tina e bipeli adi batakeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 6:1" />«Daani na edinga boo odaeni pɛ bokɔni misala mipele ta miso ma bato, tine boo bato boenɛni. Esakadaa boo otakeni iputi lobombeini Sange e bino yona odi o diko. <verse eid="MAT 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 6:2" />Ehole epi wɛ moeka adi motakeli, pɛ bokɛ abalakake tina e wɛ elenge akakɔe ndjɔ ba melo mibae ta basinagoga ko ta ndjea. Bakakɔe bea bɛngi bakumedjame na bato. Soti, nabalaka na nu: badia iputi i bobo ehele. <verse eid="MAT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 6:3" />Endolo ehole epi ebɔ e bami moeka adi motakeli, ebɔ e bali edae pɛ bodjeba. <verse eid="MAT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 6:4" />Na bea, etungi ikabo imina idikame ta mbombi. Ko Ndjakomba, Sange e wɛ, okenɛ meako mikakɔe wɛ ta mbombi, aoputabi.»<verse eid="MAT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Eleho ta tina e miongɔnɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="LUK 11:2-4">Luk 11, 2-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 6:5" />«Ehole eongɔnɔkɔno, pɛ bodani elenge ndjɔ ba melo mibae: bakapale bongɔnɔ baemi diko ta ba sinagoga ko ta masaka ma ndjea bɛngi bato basusu babenɛke. Soti nabalaka na nu: badia iputi i bobo ehele. <verse eid="MAT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 6:6" />Endolo wɛ, ehole apalaka wɛ bongɔnɔ, kwea ta ekenge e ndako e wɛ, dipa ekukɛ ko ongɔnɔ Sange e wɛ odi ta esika yena e mbombi. Na bea Sange e wɛ, yona okaenɛ meako makakɔme ta mbombi aoputabi.»<verse eid="MAT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 6:7" />«Ehole eongɔnɔkɔ no, pɛ bobalabalani elenge bato ba bikomi bi bakɛndɛli. Bakalɛdje boo Ndjakomba aboani bobapa misɔmbedja tine babali bobuke. <verse eid="MAT 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 6:8" />Pɛ bobakwanani, tengasa Ndjakomba, Sange e bino, adjebi posa e bino boso boo omosɛngeni. <verse eid="MAT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 6:9" />Endjani moda moboani na nu bongɔnɔ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:9">“Sangwa su yona odi o diko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:9">kina boo kombe e wɛ edjebame boo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:9">odi Ndjakomba Mosɛnɔke,<verse eid="MAT 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 6:10" />Kina boo Bokumu bo wɛ bodoe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:10">kina boo bopala bo wɛ bokɔme</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:10">iya ta kpɔtɔ elenge ta busa.<verse eid="MAT 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 6:11" />Lopa engi busa mwɛmbɛ moboani na su.<verse eid="MAT 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 6:12" />Loyɛ mabe ma biso elenge</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:12">akayɛso pongono bia bakalokɔe mabe.<verse eid="MAT 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 6:13" />Pɛ bololɔndɔso ta ndingea,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:13">endolo tingoaso ta bobe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:13">[Tengasa bokumu bodi bo wɛ, ngulu edi e wɛ ko ekumu edi e wɛ, kɔbili na kɔbili. Okobea<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ekenge ye edi ta ndanda e bikondji bi tedaake ta buki ikina iyou. Endja pongono ta 1 Tan 29, 11-13.</char></note>.]”»<verse eid="MAT 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 6:14" />«Na bea, ekada boo oyɛini bato mabe i maokɔni bo, Sange e bino yona odi o diko aoyɛbini pongono. <verse eid="MAT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 6:15" />Endolo omiti yɛni bakina bato, Sange e bino atoyɛbini mabe makakɔe no pongono.»<verse eid="MAT 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Eleho ta tina e bokia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 6:16" />«Ehole edi no bokia boyaka, pɛ bodani na ndjokwa elenge akakɔe bato bapokotoi. Boinedjaka mbanda i bobo ndjokwa ndjokwa bɛngi bato baenɛ boo bakii boyaka. Soti nabalaka na nu: badia iputi i bobo ehele. <verse eid="MAT 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 6:17" />Endolo wɛ, ehole ekii wɛ, sosa boso bo wɛ bopele ko suwowa malasi ta molo mo wɛ, <verse eid="MAT 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 6:18" />tine boo bato basadjeba boo okiaka, dongedja oko Sange e wɛ okadae ta mbombi. Ko Sange e wɛ okaenɛ ta mbombi, aoputabi.»<verse eid="MAT 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Eleho ta tina e bodieli bo ngondo</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="LUK 12:33-34">Luk 12, 33-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 6:19" />«Pɛ bosalumedjani na bodieli ta ngondo ye, tengasa timo ko bogada boboani bobedja, kaoko baubi baboani bobuka ndako tine boo baibe. <verse eid="MAT 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 6:20" />Endolo salumedjani na madieli ta busa, oho sɛ na bogada te bobedje, nongo baubi batabukake ndako tine boiba. <verse eid="MAT 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 6:21" />Tengasa polo edi madieli ma wɛ, molema mo wɛ modi pongono oho.»<verse eid="MAT 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Molinda mo mokuku</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="LUK 11:34-36">Luk 11, 34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 6:22" />«Miso madi molinda mo mokuku: ekada miso ma wɛ mamitidaa na epeko, mokuku mo wɛ mosusu modi ta bohu. <verse eid="MAT 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 6:23" />Endolo ekada boo miso ma wɛ madi na epeko, mokuku mo wɛ mosusu modi ta modidi. Ekada bea bohu bua bodi adi wɛ bodi oko elenge modidi ko modidi momina modabi mohindo!»<verse eid="MAT 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Ndjakomba kaoko palanga</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="LUK 16:13">Luk 16, 13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 6:24" />«Moto omɔti aboaniti bosalea bakumu babae: alone omɔti ko apale okina; kaoko asapɛ na omɔti ko alone okina. Oboaniti bosalea Ndjakomba na palanga mbala emɔti.»<verse eid="MAT 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Boda na bwela adi Ndjakomba</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="LUK 12:22-31">Luk 12, 22-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 6:25" />«Na tina emina, nabali na nu: pɛ bosatungeani tina e mihelo mi bino, na bosahɔdjɔ: “Ayake so nde kaoko amwake so nde?” Kaoko tine e mikuku mi bino, na bosahɔdjɔ: “Alwake so nde?” Modjɔ nda, mohelo monɔiti mia na tɛtɔ ko mokuku monɔiti bisendja na tɛtɔ? <verse eid="MAT 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 6:26" />Endjani mbulu o diko: teonake, tebukake mbuma, tebombake miya ta polo i mbombi, endolo Sange e bino yona odi o diko akaeyakedje! <verse eid="MAT 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 6:27" />Moto ndani ta tei e bino, oboani bobakea mooehole ta mohelo mo nde na ndjea e meako makɔkɔ yo?»<verse eid="MAT 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 6:28" />«Ko tina ndani wasatungeakani tine bisendja? Endjani moda mokakandoe pulɛlɛ i gbie: teisale, teisatonge bisendja. <verse eid="MAT 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 6:29" />Enakobea, nabalaka na nu, nongo Salomo, na bodieli bo nde bosusu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta 1Mik 10. </char></note>, aidiaka bisendja binɔi na bopele elenge pulɛlɛ. <verse eid="MAT 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 6:30" />Ekadabo Ndjakomba akalwadje ndjani i gbie idi oho busa bu ko puma idumbamake ta mosa: na bea atolwadjakeni bonɔ mɛnɛ moda malɛdjɛkɛ no? Bato ba edimeli ekɛkɛ! <verse eid="MAT 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 6:31" />Na bea, pɛ bosatungeani na bobala: “Ayakeso nde? Amwake so nde? Alwake so nde?” <verse eid="MAT 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 6:32" />Edi bapangano bato bakakɛ bohomba homba bea. Endolo ta tina e bino, Sange e bino odi o diko akadjebe posa e bino. <verse eid="MAT 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 6:33" />Hombani boso Bokumu bo Ndjakomba ko na bodjo bo nde ko meako misusu mipamabi na nu ngɔngɔ. <verse eid="MAT 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 6:34" />Na bea, pɛ bosatungeani tine puma: puma esatungeake tine yu mɛnɛ. Engi busa edi na saya e yu.»<verse eid="MAT 6:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MAT 7" />
  <para style="s2">Pɛ bosambedja ba kina</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="LUK 6:37-38">Luk 6, 37-38</ref>.<ref loc="LUK 6:41-42">41-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 7:1" />«Pɛ bosambedjani, tine basakosambedja. <verse eid="MAT 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 7:2" />Tengasa baosambedjabini moda mokasambedjeno bakina. Oko na mwɛngi mokaengɛe na nu bato, boengɛbini oko na mu. <verse eid="MAT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 7:3" />Tina ndani waendjaka ebumbu edi ta diso i mwange e wɛ, na bea otaenɛkɛ ibaya idi ta diso i wɛ? <verse eid="MAT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 7:4" />Moda ndani oboani bobala na mwange e wɛ: “Mwange e mbi, kina nodongedje ebumbu yena edi ta diso i wɛ”, na bea odi na ibaya ta i wɛ diso? <verse eid="MAT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 7:5" />Bato bapokotoi, dongedja boso ibaya idi ta diso i wɛ ko waenɛke bohu tine bodongedja ebumbu edi ta diso i mwange e wɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 7:6" />«Pɛ bopani miya masɛnɔke adi mbwa, esakasɔmbɔ tine botswani. Pɛ bodumbani leka lo motuya adi ngulu, tine esakɔmbɔ bodalakaka.»<verse eid="MAT 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Sɛngɛ, homba ko boma</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="LUK 11:9-13">Luk 11, 9-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 7:7" />«Sɛngɛni ko bopakeni; hombani ko wadiakeni; bomani ko bodipoakeni. <verse eid="MAT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 7:8" />Tengasa moto okahɔdje, bodiaka; okahombe, boenɛkɛ ko okabome ta gbulu, bomodipoaka. <verse eid="MAT 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 7:9" />Moto ndani ta tei e bino oboani bopa mwana o nde ibanga, ekada boo mwana o nde amosɛngi mwɛmbɛ? <verse eid="MAT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 7:10" />Moto ndani oboani bopa mwana o nde ndjɔ ekada boo amosɛngi moswi? <verse eid="MAT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 7:11" />Ekadabo ino bato babe, odjebini bopani adi bana ba bino leka lopele, na bea moda ndani Sange e bino yona odi o diko, apɛtebi leka lopele adi bia bamosɛngɛkɛ?»<verse eid="MAT 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 7:12" />«Misusu mikapaleno boo bato bakina bokɔmeni, ino pongono kɔni bea adi bo, tengasa edi bileho bi mobeko ko na bi ba mbaeli ba Ndjakomba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Bal 13, 8-10.</char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Ndjea e embamba</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="LUK 13:24">Luk 13, 24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 7:13" />«Kweani ta ekukɛ e embamba, tengasa ndjea yena ebhuda ekalome bato ta ibunga; bato banɛnɛ edi bia bakanɔe na ndjea emina. <verse eid="MAT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 7:14" />Endolo ndjea yena e embamba ko e kpɔkɔsɔ ekalome bato ta mohelo; oko bato bakɛkɛ bakaenɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Ba mbaeli ba bolowa</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="LUK 6:43-44">Luk 6, 43-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 7:15" />«Daani na engɛlɛ na ba mbaeli ba boloa. Bakadue adi no elenge bhata, endolo ta tei e bobo badi elenge swa ba bobila. <verse eid="MAT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 7:16" />Obadjebabini na misala mi bobo. Tebabuke mbuma i vino ta mole mo ndjubɛ, nongo mbuma i pigi ta mole mo ndjubɛ. <verse eid="MAT 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 7:17" />Mole mopele bobotaka mbuma ipele ko mole mobe bobotaka mbuma ibe. <verse eid="MAT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 7:18" />Mole mopele motabota mbuma ibe nongo mole mobe motabota pongono mbuma ipele. <verse eid="MAT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 7:19" />Mole mosusu mokadae pɛ bobota mbuma ipele mokwɛlɛmɛbi ko modumbamabi ta mosa. <verse eid="MAT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 7:20" />Na bea, odjebabini ba mbaeli ba bolowa na misala mi bobo.»<verse eid="MAT 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Bobala ko bosala</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="LUK 13:25-27">Luk 13, 25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 7:21" />«Editi na bato basusu bakabale na mbi: “Kumu, Kumu”, ba ndani bakweabi ta bo Bokumu bo diko. Endolo edi oko yona akɔkɔ bolulea bo Sange e mbi yona odi o diko. <verse eid="MAT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 7:22" />Ta busa bo esambi, bato banɛnɛ babalakabi na mbi: “Kumu, Kumu, edi na kombe e wɛ lotɛlɛkɛ; edi na kombe e wɛ lobenganaka miembo mibe; edi na kombe e wɛ lokɔkɔ ngindola inɛnɛ. Otadjebaka”? <verse eid="MAT 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 7:23" />Na bea nabalakabi na bu: “Natodjebakani; kɛni bohali na mbi, ino bakɔmeli ba mabe!”»<verse eid="MAT 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Isɛ i ndako ibae</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="LUK 13:25-27">Luk 13, 25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 7:24" />«Na bea, moto mosusu oki mibalo misabala mbi ko amisi ta mosala aboani na moto obowɛi yona otonga ndako e nde ta diko i ibanga. <verse eid="MAT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 7:25" />Mbuwa ekwaka, pela eduaka, lungu epipo ekumbaka ta ndako, endolo eikwaka, tengasa moboko mo yu mopikamaka ta diko i ibanga. <verse eid="MAT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 7:26" />Endolo moto mosusu yona oki mibalo misahula mbi abala ko amiti misa ta mosala adabi elenge endanga yona etongaka ndako ta diko i mbume. <verse eid="MAT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 7:27" />Ehole ekwaka mbuwa, pela eduaka, lungu epipo ebomaka ndako ko ekwaka: ko ndako emina ebukeana esusu.»<verse eid="MAT 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bokondji bo Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 7:28" />Ehole esidjaka Yesu bobala mibalo mi nde, bato basusu bakamoaka na moda mo boleha bo nde. <verse eid="MAT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 7:29" />Tengasa ailehaka elenge balehi ba mobeko, endolo abalehaka na kpatsi.<verse eid="MAT 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MAT 8" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledji moto o mabha</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mlk 1, 40-45</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luk 5, 12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 8:1" />Ehole etitaka Yesu ta ikoli, emumu e bato emokimanaka. <verse eid="MAT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 8:2" />Na bea moto omɔti o mabha aduaka adi yo, akwaka magbundɔ ta boso bo nde ko abalaka: «Kumu, okapala, sɛnodjani!» <verse eid="MAT 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 8:3" />Yesu aninodjaka ebɔ, apeaka moto o mabha ko abalaka: «Napali, sɛnoa!» Oko ta ehole emina asɛnoaka na mabha ma nde. <verse eid="MAT 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 8:4" />Yesu abalaka na nde: «Oka bopele: pɛ botɔndea moto. Endolo kɛɛ asinedje adi nganga o Ndjakomba, pa ikabo elenge moda mokoma Mose, tine boo edae tati ta miso ma bato basusu boo oheli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8, 4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Lew 14, 2-32.</char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledji mosali o kapitɛne o basoda o Loma</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="LUK 7:1-10">Luk 7, 1-10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 4:43-54">Yoa 4, 43-54</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 8:5" />Ehole ekweaka Yesu ta ibonga i Kapalanauma, kapitɛne omɔti o basoda aduaka adi yo bosɛngɛ ekamoi. <verse eid="MAT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 8:6" />Aongɔnɔkɔ Yesu: «Kumu, mosali o mbi asambi ta ndako, atabɔngɔkɔ nongo bodala ko apekaka mɛnɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 8:7" />Yesu abalaka na nde: «Naduake, amoheledja.» <verse eid="MAT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 8:8" />Endolo kapitɛne omina o basoda abalaka na nde: «Kumu, eboaniti boo okwe ta ndako e mbi. Endolo bala oto kɔpi emɔti mosali o mbi ahelake. <verse eid="MAT 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 8:9" />Tengasa mbi mɛnɛ nadi na se e kpatsi adi bakondji i banɔini ko nadi na basoda ibadi na se i bokondji bo mbi. Nakabala na omɔti “Kɛɛ!” Akɛke; nakabala na okina: “Dua!” Aduake; ko nakabala na mosali o mbi: “Kɔɔ mosala mu!” Akɔke.» <verse eid="MAT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 8:10" />Ehole eokaka Yesu mibalo mia, akamoaka ko abalaka na bato ibamokimanaka: «Soti nabalaka na nu: napakini aenɛ moto o edimeli e moda mu ta Isalɛlɛ! <verse eid="MAT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 8:11" />Soti, nabalaka na nu boo bato banɛnɛ badongabi ta dɔngɔ ikaime modakabusa, na ikakɛɛ atita modakabusa ko badiabi ndjea e boyaka ta Bokumu bo diko engbanga na Abalayama, na Isaka ko na Djakobo. <verse eid="MAT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 8:12" />Endolo bato ibabɔngedjama bokwea ta Bokumu bo diko, badumbamabi sokolu ta modidi, oho bayeabi ko bakpɛkɛnɛbi mino.»<verse eid="MAT 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 8:13" />Yesu abalaka na kapitɛne o basoda o Loma: «Yana ta ndako e wɛ! Ekɔme adi wɛ boboana na bodima bo wɛ!» Ko mosali o kapitɛne o basoda o Loma ahelaka oko ta ehole yena.<verse eid="MAT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledji bato ba bego</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Mlk 1, 29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luk 4, 38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 8:14" />Ehole ekɛkɛ Yesu ta ndako e Piɛlɛ, ataneaka bokiyo bo Piɛlɛ asambi, tengasa apekaka na pɛpɛlɛ. <verse eid="MAT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 8:15" />Yesu amobakeaka ebɔ ko pɛpɛlɛ esiaka. Na bea angɔkɔ ko aimeaka bomokɔmedja.<verse eid="MAT 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 8:16" />Yana aimeaka mɔmɔkɔ, baduaka na bato banɛnɛ adi Yesu ibatungeamaka na miembo mibe. Oko na mobalo momɔti, abenganaka miembo mibe mimina ko aheledjaka bato basusu ba bipeko. <verse eid="MAT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 8:17" />Na bea ekokedjamaka mobalo mobalamaka na mbaeli o Ndjakomba Isaya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 8:17">«Atombi bwɛmbu bo biso</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 8:17">ko aloheledji na bipeko bi biso.»<verse eid="MAT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bokimana Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="LUK 9:57-62">Luk 9, 57-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 8:18" />Ehole enɛkɛ Yesu emumu e bato bomohika, apaka ndjea adi batingami ba nde bakatise dɔngɔ ikina i ibeke. <verse eid="MAT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 8:19" />Molehi o mobeko omɔti aduaka adi Yesu ko abalaka: «Kumu, mbi nokimanake ta polo isusu djakɛke wɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 8:20" />Yesu abalaka na nde: «Bibanga idi na mapose ko mbulu idi na mopo, endolo Mwana o Moto aditi na polo e bohwɛ ko e bosambea nongo molo.»<verse eid="MAT 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 8:21" />Okina ta tei e batingami ba Yesu abalaka na nde: «Kumu, pani ndjea napete kɛɛ apusea sange e mbi.» <verse eid="MAT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 8:22" />Endolo Yesu amosɔmbedjaka: «Kimanani ko kina bago na bago basapuseane.»<verse eid="MAT 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu asii lungu</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mlk 4, 35-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luk 8, 22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 8:23" />Ehole etiteaka Yesu ta bwato ko batingami ba nde bamokimanaka. <verse eid="MAT 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 8:24" />Gbundumo, lungu epipo ebangaka bokumba ta ibeke ko madiba maimeaka mbuti na bodindedja bwato. Endolo Yesu adaka ahwɛli. <verse eid="MAT 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 8:25" />Batingami babatamaka mbuti na Yesu ko bamosisodjaka na bogama: «Kumu, loheledja! Lodoi agwa!» <verse eid="MAT 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 8:26" />Yesu abasɔmbedjaka: «Odini na bɔɔ tina nda? Bato ba edimeli ekɛkɛ!» Na bea aemaka ko agameaka lungu, mbonge ko losusu lopɔpɔnɔkɔ. <verse eid="MAT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 8:27" />Bakamoaka ko babalaka: «Moto yo adi mɛnɛ nda, na lungu, na mbonge losusu bomosuma<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8, 27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Ndj 65, 8; 89, 10; 107, 23-32.</char></note>?»<verse eid="MAT 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledji bami ba miembo mibe</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Mlk 5, 1-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luk 8, 26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 8:28" />Ehole eimeaka Yesu ta dɔngɔ ikina i ibeke, ta ekenge e mokpɔtɔ mo Gadala<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8, 28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gadala edaka ibonga i bato ba bikomi bi bakɛndɛli, idaka mbuti na taka kilomɛtɛlɛ 10 ta pamba ekasame modaka akime mo ta duwa enɛnɛ e Gesemane kaoko Galilea. </char></note>, bami babae baimaka ta ndanda e makila ko baduaka bosakana na nde. Bami bamina batungeamaka na miembo mibe; badaka bato ba bobila ko bato badaka na bɔɔ e bonɔ ta ndjea emina. <verse eid="MAT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 8:29" />Bagamaka: «Tina ndani odoi akwea ta midjɔ mi biso, Mwana o Ndjakomba? Odoi iya tine boloyekea boso bo ehole ebɔngedjama?»<verse eid="MAT 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 8:30" />Enakobea oho bwela bo ngulu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8, 30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Mal 5, 11.</char></note> idaka boyaka. <verse eid="MAT 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 8:31" />Miembo mibe miongɔnɔkɔ Yesu: «Lobengana bohali adi bwela bo ngulu.» <verse eid="MAT 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 8:32" />Yesu abalaka na miembo mibe: «Imanani!» Miembo mibe mimanaka ko mikweaka ta bwela bo ngulu. Mbala emɔti, bwela bosusu bo ngulu botitaka bodonga ta ikoli mbunoko bodindaka ta duwa. <verse eid="MAT 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 8:33" />Babanei ba ngulu batiaka; bakɛkɛ ta ibonga bopa gala e meako misusu iminɔmɔkɔ ko moda ndani mohelaka na bato bia i batungeamaka na miembo mibe. <verse eid="MAT 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 8:34" />Na bea bato basusu ba ibonga baimaka ta bosongana na Yesu. Ehole eimeakabo mbuti na Yesu bamongɔnɔkɔ aimane ta mokpɔtɔ mo bobo.<verse eid="MAT 8:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MAT 9" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledji momi ondɔ mako</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAL 2:1-12">Mal 2, 1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luk 5, 17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 9:1" />Yesu atiteaka ta bwato, akatisaka ibeke tine bokɛ ta ngando e nde. <verse eid="MAT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 9:2" />Bamolwɛkɛ momi ondɔ mako asambi ta bokaki. Ehole enɛkɛ Yesu bodima bo bobo, abalaka na momi ondɔ mako: «Mwana o mbi, sapingedja! Pekato i wɛ iyɛmi!» <verse eid="MAT 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 9:3" />Na bea ekenge e balehi ba mobeko basabaleanaka: «Moto iyo asingaka Ndjakomba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9, 3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Lew 24, 16.</char></note>!» <verse eid="MAT 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 9:4" />Yesu asipoaka malɛno ma bobo ko abalaka na bu: «Tina ndani odini na malɛi mabe bea? <verse eid="MAT 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 9:5" />Modjɔ monɔi na bopɛpɛtɛ bobala: “Pekato i wɛ iyɛmi”, kaoko bobala “angɔ ko dala?” <verse eid="MAT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 9:6" />Napalaki odjebeni boo Mwana o Moto adi na bokondji bo boyɛ pekato ta ngondo.» Na bea abalaka na momi ondɔ mako: «Angɔ ko tomba bokaki bo wɛ ko yana ta ndako e wɛ!» <verse eid="MAT 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 9:7" />Momi omina angɔkɔ ko ayanaka ta ndako e nde. <verse eid="MAT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 9:8" />Ehole enɛkɛ emumu e bato bea, balumaka na bɔɔ ko baimeaka bokumedja Ndjakomba yona opi sueya e moda mu adi bato.<verse eid="MAT 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu abei Matayo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:13-22">Mlk 2, 13-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-39">Luk 5, 27-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 9:9" />Yesu adongaka ta polo emina ko ta bonɔ bo nde aenɛkɛ momi omɔti na kombe e Matayo adi ta bilo ekaputedje bo puti. Abalaka na nde: «Kimanani!» Matayo angɔkɔ ko amokimanaka. <verse eid="MAT 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 9:10" />Ehole edaka Yesu boyaka ta ndako e Matayo, baputedji ba puti banɛnɛ ko bato bakina ba gala ibe baduaka ayaka mesa emɔti na nde, engbanga na batingami ba nde. <verse eid="MAT 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 9:11" />Ehole enɛkɛ bapalusai bea, bahɔdjɔkɔ batingami ba Yesu: «Tina ndani molehi o bino ayaka na baputedji ba puti ko na bato ba gala ibe?» <verse eid="MAT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 9:12" />Yana aokaka Yesu bapalusai bobala, abalaka: «Bato bapɛ bipeko te bahombe monganga, edii bato ba bipeko bakahombe monganga. <verse eid="MAT 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 9:13" />Kɛni aikoeni tingo e mibalo mi: “Nakasepe na molema mua mokokee bato ndjokwa bonɔ mbeka i tito.” Tengasa naidua ahomba bato ba bodjo endolo bato babe.»<verse eid="MAT 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ko bokia miya</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mlk 2, 18-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luk 5, 33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 9:14" />Batingami ba Yoane Mobatisi baduaka adi Yesu ko bamohɔdjɔkɔ: «Tina ndani iso na bapalusai bokiaka, endolo batingami ba wɛ tebakie?» <verse eid="MAT 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 9:15" />Yesu abasɔmbedjaka: «Walɛdjɛkɛni bato babeami ta tɛkɛ e moki baboani boda na ndjokwa ta ehole edi momi o moki engbanga na bu? Ngasa! Edabi na ehole emɔti, momi o moki adaetebi na bu; na bea bakiakabi.<verse eid="MAT 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 9:16" />«Moto aboaniti atonge esendja eyou na epasa esendja eyanie; tengasa epasa esendja eyanie ealake esendja eyou ko ipose lanɛngɛke naikina. <verse eid="MAT 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 9:17" />Te baisake mana mayanie ta mbola iyou; esakada boo mbola ibatoe, mana masopee ko mbola igwɛ. Boisaka mana ma yanie ta mbola iyanie ko na bea mabaneamake bopele.»<verse eid="MAT 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu anɔi epeko ko yogo na ngulu</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mlk 5, 21-43</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luk 8, 40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 9:18" />Ehole ebalaka Yesu na bu bea, mokondji omɔti o bayuda aimeaka, akwaka magbundɔ ta boso bo Yesu ko abalaka: «Mwana o mbi mwali ahulake agwa edɛdi; endolo dua, omobake ebɔ ko ahelake!» <verse eid="MAT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 9:19" />Na bea Yesu angɔkɔ ko amokimanaka na emumu e batingami ba nde.<verse eid="MAT 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 9:20" />Oko ta ehole emina, mwali omɔti apekaka na yogo e botanga makia bianga domi na babae. Aduaka ta sangɔngɔ i Yesu ko apeaka molenda mo esendja e nde. <verse eid="MAT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 9:21" />Tengasa asabaleaka: «Nakapea nongo sɔngɔ e esendja e nde, nahelake.» <verse eid="MAT 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 9:22" />Yesu ahombanaka, amoenɛkɛ ko abalaka: «Mwana o mbi mwali, sapingedja! Bodima bo wɛ boheledji.» Oko ta ehole emina, mwali omina ahelaka.<verse eid="MAT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 9:23" />Ehole eimeaka Yesu ta ndako e mokondji o sinagoga, aenɛkɛ babomeli ba panda na emumu e bato badaka bosatungea. <verse eid="MAT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 9:24" />Abalaka na bu: «Imani iya, tengasa mwana agwiti, ahwɛli hiyɔ.» Endolo bato basɛkɛkɛ Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 9:25" />Ehole eimaka emumu e bato sokolu, Yesu akweaka ta ekenge e ndako, apeaka mwana ta ebɔ ko moseka mwali asisoaka. <verse eid="MAT 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 9:26" />Gala e modjɔ momina enanganaka ta ngondo emina esusu.<verse eid="MAT 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledji bato babae bagwa miso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 9:27" />Ehole edongaka Yesu ena, emumu e bato ibagwa miso bamokimanaka na bogama: «Mwana o Dapiti, lokea ndjokwa!»<verse eid="MAT 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 9:28" />Ehole eimeaka Yesu ta ndako, bato babae bagwa miso bamina babatamaka mbuti na nde. Abahɔdjɔkɔ: «Odimini boo nadi na kpatsi e bokɔ eka esɛngɛkɛno?» Bamosɔmbedjaka: «Okobea, Kumu.» <verse eid="MAT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 9:29" />Na bea Yesu apeaka miso ma bobo ko abalaka: «Kina boo ekɔme bokimana bodima bo bino!» <verse eid="MAT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 9:30" />Ko mbala emɔti, baimeaka boenɛ. Yesu abakebedjaka: «Okani bopele, moto adae pɛ bodjeba modjɔ mokɔmi na nu.» <verse eid="MAT 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 9:31" />Enakobea bo bakɛkɛ bonanganedja gala e Yesu ta ibonga isusu.<verse eid="MAT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledji emimi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 9:32" />Ehole ayanaka bato bia babae, baduaka adi Yesu na momi omɔti odaka emimi tine atungeamaka na mwembo mobe. <verse eid="MAT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 9:33" />Yesu abenganaka mwembo mobe momina ko emimi omina aimeaka bobala. Emumu e bato balumaka na bokamoa ko babalaka: «Loipakenɛ modjɔ moda mu ta Isalɛlɛ!» <verse eid="MAT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 9:34" />Enakobea bapalusai babalaka: «Edi mokondji o miembo mibe amopaka kpatsi e bobengana miembo mibe!»<verse eid="MAT 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aokei emumu e bato ndjokwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 9:35" />Yesu akɛkɛ ta ngando na ngando ko ibonga na ibonga, tine boleha ta basinagoga ko botɔndɔ Bwɛndi Bopele bo Bokumu bo diko. Aheledjaka bato basusu ba bipeko ko na biɛmɛ bi bobo. <verse eid="MAT 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 9:36" />Ehole enɛkɛ Yesu emumu e bato, abaokeaka ndjokwa, tengasa badi elenge bato bataka ndingo ko baluma na bokɛsɛdji elenge bhata bataka mobanei<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9, 36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Mit 27, 17; 1Mik 22, 17.</char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 9:37" />Na bea Yesu abalaka na batingami ba nde: «Gbie edi enɛnɛ ko basali badi bakɛkɛ! <verse eid="MAT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 9:38" />Na tina emina, ongɔnɔni adi moswa gbie boo alome basali ta gbie e nde.»<verse eid="MAT 9:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MAT 10" />
  <para style="s1">Bapɔsɔlu domi na babae</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAL 3:13-19">Mal 3, 13-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luk 6, 12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 10:1" />Ngɔngɔ Yesu abeaka batingami domi na babae ko abapaka kpatsi e bobengana miembo mibe ko boheledja bipeko bisusu ko na biɛmɛ bisusu. <verse eid="MAT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 10:2" />Endja kombe i bapɔsɔlu domi na babae: o mbangi Simo, yona obakeabo kombe e Piɛlɛ; ko na mwange e nde Andele, Djake ko na mwange e nde Yoane, basusu babae bana bami ba Djebede; <verse eid="MAT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 10:3" />Pilipo ko Batelemi, Toma ko Matayo moputedji o puti, Djake mwana momi o Alipe ko Tade; <verse eid="MAT 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 10:4" />Simo moto okaswe ngando ko Yudasi Isikaliota yona okabaka Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Elomu e ba domi na babae</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mlk 6, 7-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luk 9, 1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 10:5" />Edaka bami domi na babae i balomaka Yesu elomu na simbisi idji: «Pɛ bokɛni ta dɔngɔ i bato ba bikomi bi bakɛndɛli ko pɛ bokweani ta ibonga i Basamalia. <verse eid="MAT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 10:6" />Endolo kɛni adi bato ba Isalɛlɛ badi elenge bhata i babunga ndjea. <verse eid="MAT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 10:7" />Ehole akɛkɛno ndjea ndjea, dumbeakani gala ye boo: “Bokumu bo diko bobatami!” <verse eid="MAT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 10:8" />Heledjani bato ba bipeko, sisodjani bato bago, sɛnodjani bato ba mabha ko benganani miembo mibe. Odihini ngasa ko pani pongono ngasa. <verse eid="MAT 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 10:9" />Pɛ botombani nongo ta mosenge mo bino wolo, palata kaoko palanga e ebende. <verse eid="MAT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 10:10" />Pɛ botombani sɛki tine mɔndɔ, pɛ kasaka ibae, pɛ sapato ko pɛ pango. Tengasa, mosali atungi na iputi i nde<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta 1Bak 9, 14; 1Tim 5, 18.</char></note>.<verse eid="MAT 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 10:11" />«Ehole aimeakeno ta ibonga imɔti kaoko ta ngando emɔti, hombani moto oboani na boasɔni ko daani ta ndako e nde mbunoko ehole adongakeno. <verse eid="MAT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 10:12" />Ekadabo okweini ta ndako emɔti, balani: “Bogo bodae na nu!” <verse eid="MAT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 10:13" />Na bea ekada boo bato ba ndako emina basɔini, kinani boo bogo bo bino bo bodae na bu. Endolo bamitoasɔni, kinani boo bogo bo bino bosɔmbe adi no. <verse eid="MAT 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 10:14" />Ekadabo baloni boasɔni ta ndako i bobo kaoko ta ibonga kaoko baloni bokeani, dongani ena ko bhubholani dhutu i mako ma bino<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Mal 6, 11 ko ta molɔngɔ.</char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 10:15" />Soti nabalaka na nu: ta busa bo esambi, etumbo e mabonga ma Sɔdɔmɔ ko Gomola edabi ekɛkɛ bonɔ yena adiabibo.<verse eid="MAT 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Saya ta elomu</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 13:9-13">Mlk 13, 9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:12-17">Luk 21, 12-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 10:16" />«Okani! Nolomakani elenge bhata ta ndanda e swa. Na bea daani na engɛlɛ elenge ndjɔ ko bosatitedja elenge embenga. <verse eid="MAT 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 10:17" />Daani na engɛlɛ, tengasa bato bopundakabini ta ibolea inɛnɛ i basuku ba bayuda ko bokɛsɛkɛkɛbini mbalake ta basinagoga i bobo. <verse eid="MAT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 10:18" />Bosambedjakabini ta boso bo bagupɛnɛlɛ ko bakondji. Na ndjea emina, opabini tati ta tina e mbi ta boso bo bobo ko ta boso bo bato ba bikomi bi bakɛndɛli. <verse eid="MAT 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 10:19" />Endolo ehole eopundakabinibo, pɛ bosatungeani na mibalo mabalakeno kaoko mwɛngi mo bobala: miopamakabini oko ta ehole yena. <verse eid="MAT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 10:20" />Tengasa edaetebino bato babalabi, endolo Mwembo mo Sange e bino mo balakabi na ndjea e minɔkɔ mi bino. <verse eid="MAT 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 10:21" />Mwange e moto akababi mwange e nde ta bogwa, sange e moto akababi mwana o nde, bana baleloakabi na baboti ba bobo ko babakabakabi ta bogwa. <verse eid="MAT 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 10:22" />Bato basusu bolonakabini ta tina e kombe e mbi. Endolo moto yona osagbindeakabi mbunoko suka, ahelabi. <verse eid="MAT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 10:23" />Ekadabo bonɔngedjini ta ibonga imɔti, tiyani ta ibonga ikina. Soti nabali na nu: osidjetebini mabonga masusu ma Isalɛlɛ boso boo Mwana o Moto adue.»<verse eid="MAT 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 10:24" />«Motingami tanɔe molehi o nde; nongo mobuli tanɔe moswa nde. <verse eid="MAT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 10:25" />Enakobea motingami aboani boda elenge molehi o nde ko mobuli elenge moswa nde. Elenge amobeaka bo mokondji o Bɛlɛdjɛbulɛ, modakabibo moda mosingakabi bo bato i badi ta ndako e nde!»<verse eid="MAT 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pɛ bodani na bɔɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="LUK 12:2-7">Luk 12, 2-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 10:26" />«Na tina emina, pɛ bobabangani, tengasa misusu i mi bombama midjebamabi ko misusu mi mbombi mienɛmɛbi ta bhuda. <verse eid="MAT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 10:27" />Meako motɔndeakani mbi edɛdi ta modidi, mibalani ta moyi mopipo; ko imabalaka bo na nu na popoli ta matoi ma bino, migamakabi ta diko i ndako. <verse eid="MAT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 10:28" />Pɛ bobangani bia bowaka mokuku, endolo baboaniti bowa dongi; bangani yona odi na mwɛngi mo bowa mokuku na dongi ko bodumba ta ipelu. <verse eid="MAT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 10:29" />Modjɔ nda, tebatɛke bana ba iseketele babae na palanga ipɛ tina? Enakobea, pɛ omɔti eboaniti bokwa ta kpɔtɔ emiti daa boo Sange e bino amitipa ndjea. <verse eid="MAT 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 10:30" />Ta tina e bino, nongo motuya mo swe i bino modi molangamake. <verse eid="MAT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 10:31" />Na bea, pɛ bobangani: ino onɔini bana ba iseketele basusu na tina!»<verse eid="MAT 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bobala tina e Yesu kaoko bomoinganea</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="LUK 12:8-9">Luk 12, 8-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 10:32" />«Moto mosusu yona obalakabi ta boso bo bato boo adi motingami o mbi, mbi pongono nabalakabi tina e nde ta boso bo Sange e mbi yona odi o diko. <verse eid="MAT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 10:33" />Endolo ekada boo moto ainganeini ta miso ma bato boo aditi motingami o mbi, mbi pongono namoinganeabi ta boso bo Sange e mbi yona odi o diko.»<verse eid="MAT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ibaku i bobgɔtodja</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="LUK 12:51-53">Luk 12, 51-53</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:26-27">14, 26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 10:34" />«Olɛdjini boo nadoi tine boisa bogo ta ngondo? Ngasa, nadoiti tine boisa bogo, endolo bila. <verse eid="MAT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 10:35" />Tengasa, nadoi tine bogbɔtodja mwana momi na sange e nde, mwana mwali na nange e nde ko bokio mwali na nange e momi o nde. <verse eid="MAT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 10:36" />Baloni ba moto badabi oko bato ba ndako e nde. <verse eid="MAT 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 10:37" />Moto yona okapale sange e nde kaoko nange e nde bonɔ mbi, aboaniti na mbi. Moto yona okapale mwana o nde momi kaoko mwana o nde mwali bonɔ mbi aboaniti na mbi. <verse eid="MAT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 10:38" />Moto yona adake pɛ botomba ekulusu e nde bɛngi akimaneni, aboaniti na mbi. <verse eid="MAT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 10:39" />Yona apalaka bobanea mohelo mo nde, amobungedjake. Endolo yona abungedjake mohelo mo nde tina e mbi, amodiabi.»<verse eid="MAT 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Moto oasɔini asɔi pongono mbi</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 9:41">Mlk 9, 41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 10:40" />«Moto mosusu oasɔini, asɔi mbi pongono; ko moto yona oasɔini, asɔi pongono yona olomani. <verse eid="MAT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 10:41" />Moto yona oasɔi mbaeli o Ndjakomba tine adi mbaeli, adiabi iputi ipama tina e mbaeli. Yona oasɔi moto o bodjo tine boo adi moto o bodjo adi Ndjakomba, adiake iputi ipama tina e moto o bodjo. <verse eid="MAT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 10:42" />Soti nabalaka na nu: yona apaka nongo kɔbɔ e madiba ma botiti adi bana bakɛkɛkɛ bi, tine boo badi batingami ba mbi, moto omina adiabi iputi i nde.»<verse eid="MAT 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MAT 11" />
  <para style="s1">Yoane Mobatisi alomi batingami ba nde adi Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="LUK 7:18-35">Luk 7, 18-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 11:1" />Ehole esidjaka Yesu bopa simbisi adi batingami ba nde domi na babae, adongaka ena ko akɛkɛ boleha ko bonanganedja gala e Bwɛndi Bopele ta mabonga ma mokpɔtɔ mua.<verse eid="MAT 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 11:2" />Yoane Mobatisi, adaka ta bɔlɔkɔ, aokaka bobala gala e misala mi Kilito. Na bea alomaka ekenge e batingami ba nde <verse eid="MAT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 11:3" />bohɔdjɔ Yesu: «Boni odi Masiya yona aduake kaoko loambe okina?» <verse eid="MAT 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 11:4" />Yesu abasɔmbedjaka: «Kɛni botɔndea Yoane meako imisokano ko mienino: <verse eid="MAT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 11:5" />bato bagwa miso baimei boenɛ, bato baondɔ mako baimei bodala, bato ba mabha basɛnɔi, bato babohoka baimei booka, bato bago bapusoi ko Bwɛndi Bopele botɔndɔmi adi batakeli. <verse eid="MAT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 11:6" />Sepi adi moto yona odake pɛ bokina bodima bo nde tina e mbi!»<verse eid="MAT 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 11:7" />Ehole eyanaka batingami ba Yoane, Yesu abalaka na emumu e bato ta tina e Yoane: «Moto okɛkino aendja ta etengelenge nda? Mososongo mokumanaki na epoipoi? <verse eid="MAT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 11:8" />Emitida mososongo momina, okɛkino mɛnɛ aendja nda? Moto omɔti olwaki bisendja bi motuya? Endolo bato bia bakalwae bisendja bi motuya bodaka ta ndako i bakondji. <verse eid="MAT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 11:9" />Okɛkɛkini mɛnɛ aendja ndaa? Mbaeli o Ndjakomba? Soti, nabalaka na nu, lokɛkɛ boendja moto onɔi mɛnɛ mbaeli o Ndjakomba. <verse eid="MAT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 11:10" />Tengasa Yoane adi yona obalaka ikomi ta tina e nde: “Nalomabi moto o mbi o elomu boso bo wɛ, tine bobɔngedjea ndjea.” <verse eid="MAT 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 11:11" />Soti nabalaka na nu: ta tei e bato bia babotama na bali, pɛ nongo moto omɔti odi monɛnɛ bonɔ Yoane Mobatisi. Enakobea, iyona onɔi mokɛkɛ ta tei e Bokumu bo diko, adi monɛnɛ bonɔ Yoane Mobatisi. <verse eid="MAT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 11:12" />Donga ta ehole yena elehaka Yoane Mobatisi mbunoko edɛdi, bokwea ta Bokumu bo diko boimea boanedjama na ngulu ko bato ba koo bakahombe bobokatoa na ngulu. <verse eid="MAT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 11:13" />Tengasa ba mbaeli ba Ndjakomba basusu ko mobeko mo Mose badaka bobala tina e Bokumu bomina mbunoko ta ehole e Yoane. <verse eid="MAT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 11:14" />Ekadabo odimi soti mobalo mbi, Yoane, adi mbaeli o Ndjakomba Elia yona oboanaka bodua. <verse eid="MAT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 11:15" />Kina boo yona odi na matoi ma booka aoke!<verse eid="MAT 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 11:16" />«Nadi bokokanedja bato ba busa bu na nda? Bakokani mɛnɛ na bana bakɛkɛ i badi ta polo e bhuda, badaka bogama bamɔti na bakina: <verse eid="MAT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 11:17" />“Lohueyaka piololo, endolo obwitini! Loembeani ndjembo i ndjokwa, endolo oyeitini!” <verse eid="MAT 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 11:18" />Tengasa, ta ehole eduaka Yoane, aiyaka ko aimwaka, obalakani: “Adi na mwembo mobe!” <verse eid="MAT 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 11:19" />Endolo Mwana o Moto adoi, ayaaka ko amwaaka, obalini: “Endjani moto iyo alumi na ekpaka e boyaka ko bomwaka mana, mopalani o baputedji baputi, na bato ba gala ibe!” Endolo misala mi djebeli mikainedje boo djebeli e Ndjakomba edi soti.»<verse eid="MAT 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mabonga i maloni bodima</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="LUK 10:13-15">Luk 10, 13-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 11:20" />Na bea Yesu aimeka boosa mɛnɛ mabonga imia makɔkɔ yo midjɔ mi ngindola, tine boo bato ngando imina baipalaka bosɔmbɔtɔnɔ milema. Ko abalaka: <verse eid="MAT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 11:21" />«Ndjokwa e wɛ Koladji! Ndjokwa e wɛ Betesaida! Tengasa ekada boo bingengo bi ngindola ibikɔmɔkɔ ta tei e bino, bikɔmɔkɔ ta ibonga i Tula na ta Sidona; ka bato ba ibonga imina, bapalaka bosɔmbɔtɔnɔ milema ehele, na bolwa minyuku, na bosasuowa mihulu ta melo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11, 21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Koladji </char><char style="fp" closed="false">ko </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Betesaida: </char><char style="fp" closed="false">ngando i yelɛmɛni na Kapalanauma. </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Tula ko Sidona: </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Isa 23, 1-18; Edj 26; Yoe 4, 4-8; Amo 1, 9-10.</char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 11:22" />Na tina emina, nabalaka na nu, ta busa bo esambi, etumbo e mabonga ma bino ediabi epipo bonɔ etumbo e mabonga ma Tula ko Sidona. <verse eid="MAT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 11:23" />Ko wɛ, Kapalanauma, olɛdji boo osangɔdjɔbi mbunoko ta busa? Ngasa! Otitedjamabi mbunoko ta ngando i bago. Tengasa eseda boo bingengo bi ngindola ibikɔmɔkɔ adi no, bikɔmɔkɔ ta mabonga ma Sɔdɔmɔ ko Gomola; mabonga mamina makɔkɔdaa mbunoko busa bu. <verse eid="MAT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 11:24" />Na tina emina, nabalaka na nu, ta busa bo esambi etumbo e mabonga ma bino, edabi epipo bonɔ etumbo e Sɔdɔmɔ na Gomola.»<verse eid="MAT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dua adi mbi odie iheme</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="LUK 10:21-22">Luk 10, 21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 11:25" />Oko ta ehole emina, Yesu abalaka: «Oo! Sesa, Kumu o busa na kpɔtɔ, nokumedji! Tine boo obombi midjɔ mii adi bato badjebeli ko adi bato ba mawɛi, endolo ominedji adi bana bakɛkɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11, 25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta 1Bak 1, 17-29.</char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 11:26" />Ee, Tata, osepaka boo ekɔme oko bea.<verse eid="MAT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 11:27" />«Sange e mbi apani leka losusu ta mɔmɔ ma mbi. Pɛ moto odjebi Mwana dongedja oko Sesa; pɛ moto odjebi Sasa emitidaa oko Mwana ko bato bia bapalaka yo bobainedja Sesa.<verse eid="MAT 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 11:28" />«Duani adi mbi, ino basusu baembɛi na mandi ko nopakeni iheme. <verse eid="MAT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 11:29" />Tombani mosongo mo mbi ko kinani olehameni na mbi, tengasa nadi moto o bodhongo ko na bosatitedja, odiabini iheme ta milema mi bino. <verse eid="MAT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 11:30" />Mosongo mo mbi moditi na saya ko mandi mapalaka mbi bolwadjani madi mahahanu.»<verse eid="MAT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MAT 12" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu ko busa bo Sabata</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mlk 2, 23-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luk 6, 1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 12:1" />Oko ta ehole emina, Yesu anɔkɔ ta gbie e mbuma i bule ta busa bo Sabata. Batingami ba nde baokaka ndja; babangaka bobuka mingbɔndu mi mbuma i bule ko bayakaka. <verse eid="MAT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 12:2" />Ehole enɛkɛ bapalusai bea, babalaka na Yesu: «Endja, batingami ba wɛ bakɔkɔ modjɔ mosiama na mobeko mo biso bokɔ ta busa bo Sabata<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Boi 34, 21.</char></note>!» <verse eid="MAT 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 12:3" />Yesu abasɔmbedjaka: «Olangitini modjɔ mokɔkɔ Dapiti na bato ba nde ehole eokakabo ndja? <verse eid="MAT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 12:4" />Akweaka ta ndako e Ndjakomba yo na bato ba nde ko bayaaka mapa mabɔngedjama tina e bopa Ndjakomba. Enakobea bokimana mobeko, oko banganga ba Ndjakomba badaka na enɔi e bomayaka endolo te bato bakina. <verse eid="MAT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 12:5" />Na bea, oipaka langani ta mobeko mo Mose boo, ta isu i sabata, banganga ba Ndjakomba bia bakasale ta tepelo te babedjake mobeko mo sabata? Endolo bakɔiti bobe. <verse eid="MAT 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 12:6" />Na bea, nabalaka na nu, edi ya na moto omɔti odi monɛnɛ bonɔ tepelo! <verse eid="MAT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 12:7" />Ekadabo osipoini tingo e mibalo mi: “Nakasepe bonɔ na molema mo ndjokwa endolo te mbeka i tito<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Osea 6, 6.</char></note>”, oboanitini bosambedjani moto odɛi pɛ bokɔ bobe. <verse eid="MAT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 12:8" />Tengasa Mwana o Moto adi mokondji o sabata.»<verse eid="MAT 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledji moto o ebɔ eondɔke</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAL 3:1-6">Mal 3, 1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luk 6, 6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 12:9" />Ngɔngɔ Yesu adongaka ta polo emina, akɛkɛ ta sinagoga i bobo. <verse eid="MAT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 12:10" />Edaka ena na momi omɔti o ebɔ eondɔke. Bapalusai bahɔdjɔkɔ Yesu: «Mobeko mo biso mopaka enɔi eboheledja bato ta busa bo Sabata?» Edaka tina ebohomba ndjea e bomopunda. <verse eid="MAT 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 12:11" />Yesu abasɔmbedjaka: «Ekada na moto omɔti ta tei e bino, adi oko na bhata omɔti ko bhata omina akwi ta mombɔndɔ mombɛngɛ ta busa bo sabata, aboaniti bokɛ tine bomoimedja? <verse eid="MAT 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 12:12" />Enakobea moto anɔi bhata na motuya! Na bea, epami enɔi bokɔ bopele ta isu i sabata.» <verse eid="MAT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 12:13" />Na bea, abalaka na moto omina: «Ninodja ebɔ e wɛ.» Aeninodjaka ko eimeaka bopele elenge ekina. <verse eid="MAT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 12:14" />Bapalusai baimaka ko batombaka meko tina ebohomba ndjea e bowa Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu mosali ohɔmi na Ndjakomba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 12:15" />Ehole eokaka Yesu bea, adongaka ta polo emina ko emumu e bato bamokimaka. Aheledjaka bato babipeko basusu, <verse eid="MAT 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 12:16" />endolo abasiaka na bopipo boo badae pɛ bobala isolo idi ta tina e nde. <verse eid="MAT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 12:17" />Akɔkɔ bea tine bokokedja mibalo mi mbaeli o Ndjakomba Isaya:<verse eid="MAT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 12:18" />«Endjani mosali o mbi, yona ohɔ mbi, mopalani o mbi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:18">yona okapale mbi ko nakasepe na nde.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:18">Naisabi Mwembo mo mbi adi yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:18">ko aisakabi bodjo ta mabota.<verse eid="MAT 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 12:19" />Asingetebi moto ko agametebi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:19">ko moto aoketebi moholi mo nde ta ndjea inɛnɛnɛ.<verse eid="MAT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 12:20" />Abuketebi mososongo i moimbama ehele</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:20">ko adimetebi esendja e molinda yena eimei boimedja mididi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:20">Akɔkɔbi bea mbunoko bodjo bolonge.<verse eid="MAT 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 12:21" />Na bea bikomi bi bakɛndɛli bisusu biisabi ndingo ta kombe e nde.»<verse eid="MAT 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu asɔmbedji tina e pundi e nde</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 3:22-30">Mlk 3, 22-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luk 11, 14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 12:22" />Na bea baduaka na moto omɔti odaka na miso mago ko emimi tine adaka na mwembo mobe. Yesu aheledjaka momi omina, na bea moto odaka pɛ bobala aimeaka bobala ko boenɛ bohu mɛnɛ. <verse eid="MAT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 12:23" />Bato basusu bakamoaka ko babalaka: «Iyo te mwana o Dapiti?» <verse eid="MAT 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 12:24" />Ehole eokaka bapalusai bea, babalaka: «Moto yo abenganaka miembo mibe na bokondji bo Bɛlɛdjɛbulɛ mokondji o bobo amopaka suweya!» <verse eid="MAT 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 12:25" />Endolo Yesu adjebaka yo malɛno ma bobo; abalaka na bu: «Bokumu bosusu bokasanedje suka e bu, bosakabanaka. Ko makumu masusu kaoko ndako isusu djia ikadae bato pɛ bookana, iboaniti boyeyoa. <verse eid="MAT 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 12:26" />Ekada Satana abengani Satana, asanedjaka yo mɛnɛ; bokondji bo nde bodi boyeyoa? <verse eid="MAT 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 12:27" />Ekadabo mbi nakabengane miembo mibe na bokondji bo Bɛlɛdjɛbulɛ; okapɛ bana ba bino bokondji bo bobengana miembo mibe nda? Na tina emina, bo bɛnɛ badabi badjudji ba bino! <verse eid="MAT 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 12:28" />Ta bosoti mɛnɛ, ekada boo na ndjea e kpatsi e Ndjakomba nabenganaka miembo mibe, etingodji boo Bokumu bo Ndjakomba boimei adi no.»<verse eid="MAT 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 12:29" />«Moto aboaniti bokwea ta ndako e moto o ngulu ko bokatoa leka lo nde, amakini nanga boso moto o mina mbɔti; ngɔngɔ aboani bokatoa leka losusu lo nde lo ndako. <verse eid="MAT 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 12:30" />Moto odi pɛ boda engbanga na mbi adi moloni o mbi ko yona odi pɛ boputoana na mbi, akananganedje. <verse eid="MAT 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 12:31" />Na tina emina, nabalaka na nu: pekato isusu ko masingi masusu makasingebo Ndjakomba mayɛmɛbi, endolo okasinga Mwembo Mosɛnɔke, oyɛmetebi. <verse eid="MAT 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 12:32" />Moto obalakabi bobe tina e Mwana o Moto, ayɛmɛbi; endolo moto obalakabi bobe tina e Mwembo Mosɛnɔke, ayɛmetebi nongo ta ngondo ye, nongo ta ngondo yena eduake.»<verse eid="MAT 12:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mole na mbuma i mu</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="LUK 6:43-45">Luk 6, 43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 12:33" />«Bɛngi odae na mbuma ipele, etungi odae na mole mopele; okada na mole mobe, wadiake mbuma i be. Tengasa bakadjebe mole na mbuma i mu. <verse eid="MAT 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 12:34" />Pako e ndjɔ! Odini bato babe! Oboanini bobala meako mipele? Tengasa monɔkɔ bobalaka meako mikadonge ta molema. <verse eid="MAT 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 12:35" />Moto mopele bodiaka meako mipele ta molema mo nde mopele; moto mobe bodiaka meako mibe ta molema mo nde mobe. <verse eid="MAT 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 12:36" />Nabalaka na nu: ta isu i esambi, bato badiabi iputi ikɔpi isusu ipɛ tina ibalakabo. <verse eid="MAT 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 12:37" />Tengasa edi na mibalo mi wɛ mɛnɛ miolongedjabi ko edi na mibalo mi wɛ mɛnɛ miosambedjabi.»<verse eid="MAT 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ihɔdjɔ i embete e ngindola</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 8:11-12">Mlk 8, 11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29-32">Luk 11, 29-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 12:38" />Na bea ekenge e balehi ba mobeko ko na bapalusai babalaka na Yesu: «Molehi, lapalaka boenɛ okɔe embete e ngindola ta pamba e wɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 12:39" />Yesu abasɔmbedjaka: «Bato ba ehole ye badi bato babe ta miso ma Ndjakomba! Bahɔdjɔkɔ embete e ngindola? Endolo baenɛtebi embete ekina e ngindola oko yena e mbaeli o Ndjakomba Yona. <verse eid="MAT 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 12:40" />Enakobea, moda momɔti Yona ayeyoaka masu masato ma moi ko masu masato ma bulu ta sɔpɔ i moswi monɛnɛ, oko moda momɔti Mwana o Moto ayeyoabi masu masato ma moi ko masu masato ma bulu ta molema mo kpɔtɔ. <verse eid="MAT 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 12:41" />Bato ba ibonga i Niniwe basongɔdjɔbi ta busa bo esambi ko bapundabi bato ba ehole ye. Tengasa ibo baisɔmbɔtɔnɔ milema mi bobo elenge alehaka Yona. Enakobea edi iya na moto omɔti onɔi Yona! <verse eid="MAT 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 12:42" />Ta isu i esambi, kumu mwali o satina asangɔdjɔbi ta boso bo bato ba ehole ye ko abapundabi, tengasa adongaka bohali ta mabonga ma ngondo tine bodua ta booka djebeli e Salomo. Enakobea edi ya na moto omɔti onɔi Salomo!»<verse eid="MAT 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ihule i mwembo mobe</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="LUK 11:24-26">Luk 11, 24-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 12:43" />«Ehole eimi mwembo mobe adi moto, mokɛi ko mokada ta etengelenge tabohomba polo e boda. Ekadabo amitidia polo e boda, <verse eid="MAT 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 12:44" />na bea mosabalei: “Nadoi asɔmbɔ ta ndako e mbi, yena eimaka mbi.” Mohuli, motanei ndako bwase, eombɔmɔke ko ebɔngedjamake bopele. <verse eid="MAT 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 12:45" />Na bea asɔmbɔke botomba naikina miembo sambo iminɔi na bobe; masɔmbɔke ta ndako ko madikamake oho. Moda mo moto omina moimeake naikina bobe bonɔ moda modaka yo boso. Ko edabi moda momɔti tine bato ba ehole ye.»<verse eid="MAT 12:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pako epele e Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mlk 3, 31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luk 8, 19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 12:46" />Yana abalaka Yesu na emumu e bato, bange i nde ko na nange e nde baduaka. Baemaka sokolu ko bohombaka bosoola na nde. <verse eid="MAT 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 12:47" />Moto omɔti abalaka na Yesu: «Nange e wɛ ko bange i wɛ baemi sokolu ko badi na posa e bosoola na wɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 12:48" />Yesu amosɔmbedjaka: «Nange e mbi ko bange i mbi ba nda?» <verse eid="MAT 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 12:49" />Yesu ainedjaka ebɔ adi batingami ba nde ko abalaka: «Endjani, nange e mbi ko bange i mbi ibo bi. <verse eid="MAT 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 12:50" />Tengasa yona akɔkɔ bolulea bo Sange e mbi yona odi o diko adi mwange e mbi, ngɛnɛ e mbi kaoko nange e mbi.»<verse eid="MAT 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MAT 13" />
  <para style="s1">Isɛ i mooneli</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mlk 4, 1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luk 8, 4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 13:1" />Oko ta isu dia, Yesu aimaka ta ndako ko akɛkɛ boda ta yɔngɔ e duwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 13:2" />Emumu e bato ebolamaka mbuti na nde, na bea Yesu atiteaka ta bwato ko adaa. Bato basusu baemaka o ngondo. <verse eid="MAT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 13:3" />Abalaka na bu meako minɛnɛ na masɛ. Abalaka: «Mooneli omɔti akɛkɛ ta gbie e nde tine boona. <verse eid="MAT 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 13:4" />Yana adaka yo bomɛsɛ kona, ekenge emɔti ekona ekwaka ta yɔngɔ e ndjea: mbulu iduaka ko iikomakaka. <verse eid="MAT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 13:5" />Ekenge ekina ekona ekwaka ta mabanga yana edaka na mokpɔtɔ mokɛkɛ. Kona ikandoaka tine mokpɔtɔ moidaka monɛnɛ. <verse eid="MAT 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 13:6" />Endolo ehole eimana moyi ta busa, moangodjaka bisanga bikona: ikakanaka tine nginga idindaka ta kpɔtɔ. <verse eid="MAT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 13:7" />Ekenge ekina ekona ekwaka ta ndanda e ndjubɛ. Ndjubɛ ikandoaka ko imbambamedjaka kona bokandoa. <verse eid="MAT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 13:8" />Endolo ikina kona ikwaka ta mokpɔtɔ mopele ko ibotaka mingbɔndu: imɔti ibotaka mbuma mokama, ikina mbuma tuku isamano ko ikina tuku isato.» <verse eid="MAT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 13:9" />Ko Yesu abalaka: «Kina boo yona odi na matoi ma booka aoke!»<verse eid="MAT 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tina ndani Yesu bobalaka na masɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Mlk 4, 10-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luk 8, 9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 13:10" />Na bea batingami babatamaka mbuti na Yesu ko bamohɔdjɔkɔ: «Tina ndani wabalaka na bu na masɛ?» <verse eid="MAT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 13:11" />Yesu abasɔmbedjaka: «Ino odihini djebeli, tine bodjeba mbombi e bokumu bo diko, endolo te bo. <verse eid="MAT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 13:12" />Tengasa moto odi na moeka adiabi lonɛnɛ ko aimeabi na bodieli; endolo adi moto yona otaki bamokatoabi nongo moeka odaki na nde. <verse eid="MAT 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 13:13" />Endjani tina ekababalee mbi na masɛ: tine boo nongo bakaendja, bataenɛ ko nongo bakooka, batasipoa. <verse eid="MAT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 13:14" />Na bea ekokedjamaka tina e bobo mibalo mibalaka mbaeli o Ndjakomba Isaya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:14">“Okakabini soti, endolo osipoetebini;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:14">Oendjakabini soti, endolo oenɛketebini.<verse eid="MAT 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 13:15" />Tengasa bato bi baimei milema mipipo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">basadipi matoi ko miso ma bobo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">oko badae pɛ booka ko pɛ boenɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">esada boo basipoe, basɔmbɔtɔne milema ko nabaheledje,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">obali mbi Ndjakomba.”»<verse eid="MAT 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 13:16" />«Endolo sepi e miso ma bino, tine maenɛkɛ; sepi e matoi ma bino, tine maokaka! <verse eid="MAT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 13:17" />Soti nabalaka na nu: ba mbaeli ba Ndjakomba banɛnɛ ko bato ba bodjo adi Ndjakomba badaka na posa e boenɛ meako menɛkɛno, endolo baimienɛ; badaka na posa e booka, meako mokakano, endolo baimioka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta 1Piɛ 1, 10-12.</char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tingo e isɛ i moneli</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Mlk 4, 13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luk 8, 11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 13:18" />«Na bea okani tingo e isɛ i mooneli. <verse eid="MAT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 13:19" />Ekadabo moto aoki bobala tine Bokumu bo diko ko aisipoaka, adi elenge yɔngɔ e ndjea yena ekwaka kona: Satana adoi ko akatoi kona eonamaka ta molema mo nde. Edi kona yena ekwaka ta yɔngɔ e ndjea. <verse eid="MAT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 13:20" />Bakina badi elenge mokpɔtɔ mo mabanga yana akwaka kona: baokaka mobalo ko bamoasɔkɔ pɛpɛlɛ na mongandi. <verse eid="MAT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 13:21" />Endolo baditi na nginga adi bo bɛnɛ, badimaka mooehole mokɛkɛ. Ko na bea ehole aduake saya kaoko imeko ta tine mobalo mo Ndjakomba, basundoli pɛpɛlɛ edimeli. <verse eid="MAT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 13:22" />Bakina badi elenge kona, yena ekwaka ta ndanda i ndjubɛ: baoki mobalo, endolo makɛsɛdji ma ngondo ko pangolaki i madieli ma ngondo imbambamedji mobalo ko mobotiti eka. <verse eid="MAT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 13:23" />Ngɔngɔ bakina basɔi kona ta mokpɔtɔ mopele: baoki mobalo ko bamosipoi; baboti mbuma, bamɔti mokama, bakina tuku isamano ko bakina tuku isato.»<verse eid="MAT 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isɛ i mondjani mobe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 13:24" />Yesu abatueyaka ikina isɛ: «Bokumu bo diko boboani na moda mu: moto omɔti aonaka kona ipele ta gbie e nde. <verse eid="MAT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 13:25" />Ehole ehwɛkɛ bato, moloni o nde aduaka boona mondjani mobe ta ndanda e gbie e mbuma i bule ko akɛkɛ. <verse eid="MAT 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 13:26" />Ehole ekandoaka kona ko ibotaka mbuma, modjani mobe motɔkɔ pongono. <verse eid="MAT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 13:27" />Basali ba moswa gbie baduaka bamotɔndeaka: “Molehi, onaki kona epele ta e gbie e wɛ? Na bea mondjani mobe mu modongi djɔ?” <verse eid="MAT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 13:28" />Abasɔmbedjaka: “Edi moloni moto okɔi bea.” Na bea basali bamohɔdjɔkɔ naikina: “Opali boo lokɛ bopikoa mondjani mobe momina?” <verse eid="MAT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 13:29" />“Moswa gbie asɔmbedjaka: Ngasa! Tengasa okapikoani mondjani mobe, wapikoakeni pongono bule. <verse eid="MAT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 13:30" />Kinani ikandoeni isusu engbanga mbunoko ehole e bobuka mbuma ko ta ehole emina, nabalabi na babukeli: dongedjani boso modjani mobe ko monangani bibole tine bomotumba, ngɔngɔ obukeni bule oiseni ta ebombelo.”»<verse eid="MAT 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isɛ i mbuma e motade</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mlk 4, 30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luk 13, 18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 13:31" />Yesu abatueyaka ikina isɛ: «Bokumu bo diko boboani na mbuma e motade yena eoni moto ta gbie e nde. <verse eid="MAT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 13:32" />Edi kona ekɛkɛ ta tei e mbuma isusu; endolo ta ehole ekandoi yo, eimei kona enɛnɛ ta tei ekona isusu i gbie: eimei mole, na bea mbulu o diko itongake mopo ta tape i yu.»<verse eid="MAT 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isɛ i lepile</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="LUK 13:20-21">Luk 13, 20-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 13:33" />Yesu abatueyaka isɛ ikina: «Bokumu bo diko boboani na lepile yena etombi mwali ko bobongoanedja na ekenge enɛnɛ e palini mbunoko mobɔtu mosusu mogbaloi.»<verse eid="MAT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eleho na ndjea e masɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 4:33-34">Mlk 4, 33-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 13:34" />Yesu abalaka meako misusu na emumu e bato na ndjea e masɛ; aibabaleaka napɛ bobatueya masɛ. <verse eid="MAT 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 13:35" />Akɔkɔ bea tine bokokedja mobalo mo mbaeli o Ndjakomba:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:35">«Nabalakabi na masɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:35">notɔndeakabini meako mi mbombi donga boyoa bo ngondo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndj 78, 2.</char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu atingodji isɛ i mondjani mobe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 13:36" />Na bea Yesu akinaka emumu e bato ko akweaka ta ndako. Batingami ba nde baduaka adi yo ko bamohɔdjɔkɔ: «Lotingodja tina e isɛ i mondjani mobe ta gbie.» <verse eid="MAT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 13:37" />Yesu asɔmbedjaka: «Moto okone kona epele edi Mwana o Moto; <verse eid="MAT 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 13:38" />gbie edi ngondo, kona epele edi bato bakasume Bokumu bo diko; kona ebe edi bana ba satana; <verse eid="MAT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 13:39" />moloni okone mondjani mobe edi djabulu, bobuka edi suka e ngondo ko babukeli badi babwɛndji. <verse eid="MAT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 13:40" />Moda mokapikoebo mondjani mobe tine bomodumba ta mosa, oko bea edabi suka e ngondo. <verse eid="MAT 13:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 13:41" />Mwana o Moto alomabi babwɛndji ba nde, tine bodongedja donga ta Bokumu bo nde, bilambo bisusu bikataedje bato mabaku ko na bato babe. <verse eid="MAT 13:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 13:42" />Babadumbabi ta ipombe i mosa, oho banɛnɛ bayeakabi ko bakpɛkɛnɛkɛbi mino. <verse eid="MAT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 13:43" />Na bea, bato ba bodjo adi Ndjakomba bangɛsɛbi elenge moyi ta Bokumu bo Sange e bobo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Dan 12, 3.</char></note>. Yona odi na matoi ma booka aoke!»<verse eid="MAT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isɛ i kuma ebolama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 13:44" />«Bokumu bo diko boboani na kuma ebolamaka ta gbie. Moto oetɔngɔli aebombi ta tine sepi e nde. Alumake na sepi boo akɛ botɛkɛ losusu lodi na nde bɛngi asombe gbie emina.<verse eid="MAT 13:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 13:45" />«Bokumu bo diko boboani na moto okakɔe mombongu mobohomba mayaka ma motuya. <verse eid="MAT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 13:46" />Ekadabo adihi iyaka i motuya monɛnɛ, akɛke botɛkɛ leka lo nde losusu ko asombe oko iyaka imina.»<verse eid="MAT 13:46" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isɛ i modjanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 13:47" />«Bokumu bo diko boboani naikina elenge modjanga mua modumbi bo ta duwa ko motaedji swi mindumba na mindumba. <verse eid="MAT 13:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 13:48" />Ekadabo modjanga motaedji swi, baowoi bamotubake o ngondo, tine bohɔ swi: baisake swi bapele ta mitinga ko badumbake leka lobe. <verse eid="MAT 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 13:49" />Edabi bea ta suka e ngondo: babwɛndji baduabi bogbɔtodja bato babe na bato bapele <verse eid="MAT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 13:50" />tine bobadumba bato babe ta ipombe i mosa; edabi oho biyo ko na bokpɛkɛnɛ mino.»<verse eid="MAT 13:50" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bodieli boyanie ko boyou</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 13:51" />Yesu abahɔdjɔkɔ: «Osipoini meako mi mina?» Basɔmbedjaka: «Okobea!» <verse eid="MAT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 13:52" />Na bea Yesu abalaka na bu: «Edi oko bea, molehi o mobeko yona oimei motingami o Bokumu bo diko, aboani na moswa ndako yona oimedjaka ta ngbongolo e kuma e nde: leka loyanie ko na loyou.»<verse eid="MAT 13:52" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bato ba Nasaleta baloni bodima Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mlk 6, 1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luk 4, 16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 13:53" />Ngɔngɔ i Yesu bobala masɛ mia, adongaka ta polo yena <verse eid="MAT 13:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 13:54" />ko asɔmbɔkɔ ta ibonga ikandoaka yo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 54 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ibonga </char><char style="fp" closed="false">etingondji Nasaleta. Endja pongono ta 2, 32 ko ta Luk 4, 16.</char></note>. Abangaka boleha ta sinagoga ko bato basusu badaka ena bakamoaka. Babalaka: «Adihi yo djebeli ye djɔ? Moda ndani akɔkɔ bimbete bi bokamoa bea? <verse eid="MAT 13:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 13:55" />Iyo te mwana o sapate? Malia te nange e nde? Djake, Esepu, Simo ko Yuda baditi bange i nde? <verse eid="MAT 13:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 13:56" />Ko bangɛnɛ i nde loditi na bu iya?» <verse eid="MAT 13:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 13:57" />Na tina emina baimodimeaka. Na bea Yesu abalaka na bu: «Mbaeli bokumaka polo isusu, dongedja oko ta ibonga i nde ko ta pako e nde<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 57 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Luk 4, 24; Yoa 4, 44.</char></note>.» <verse eid="MAT 13:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 13:58" />Yesu akɔ oho baabimbete bi ngindola tina e taka e bodima bo bobo.<verse eid="MAT 13:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MAT 14" />
  <para style="s1">Bogwa bo Yoane Mobatisi</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Mlk 6, 14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luk 9, 7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 14:1" />Ta ehole emina, Elode adaka gupɛnɛlɛ o mokpɔtɔ mo Galilea, aokaka gala ta tina e Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 14:2" />Abalaka na basali ba nde: «Moto yo aboaniti boda Yoane Mobatisi yona opusoi ta tei e bago! Na tina emina adi na kpatsi ebokɔ bimbete bi ngindola.»<verse eid="MAT 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 14:3" />Tengasa Elode apaka simbisi bapee Yoane, bamonange mbɔti ko bamoise ta bɔlɔkɔ. Edaka tina e Elodiade, mwali o mwange e nde Pilipo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mal 6, 17 ko ta molɔngɔ.</char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 14:4" />Yoane abalaka na Elode: «Ebɔngiti Elodiade aimee mwali o wɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Lew 18, 16; 20, 21.</char></note>.» <verse eid="MAT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 14:5" />Elode apalaka bowa Yoane, endolo abangaka bayuda, tengasa bato batombaka Yoane elenge mbaeli o Ndjakomba. <verse eid="MAT 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 14:6" />Enakobea, ta tɛkɛ e bo bobotama bo Elode, mwana mwali o Elodiade abuwaka ta boso bo babeami ba tɛkɛ emina. Asepedjaka Elode mɛnɛ <verse eid="MAT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 14:7" />ko Elode abhɛlɛkɛ bhɛli ebomopa losusu lamohɔdjɔke yo. <verse eid="MAT 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 14:8" />Nabokimana eleho e nange e nde, abalaka na nde: «Pani iya ta saani molo mo Yoane Mobatisi!» <verse eid="MAT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 14:9" />Mokondji Elode aimeaka na ndjokwa, endole ta tine bhɛli e bhɛlɛkɛ yo ta miso ma bato babeaka yo ta tɛkɛ, apaka simbisi bamopɛ molo mo mina. <verse eid="MAT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 14:10" />Alomaka moto omɔti akɛ alena molo mo Yoane Mobatisi ta bɔlɔkɔ. <verse eid="MAT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 14:11" />Baduaka na molo mo Yoane Mobatisi ta saani ko bamopaka adi moseka mwali ko amopaka adi nange e nde. <verse eid="MAT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 14:12" />Batingami ba Yoane baduaka atomba mokuku mo nde ko bamopuseaka. Ngɔngɔ, bakɛkɛ atɔndea Yesu modjɔ i monɔkɔ.<verse eid="MAT 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ayakedji bami koto itano</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mlk 6, 30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luk 9, 10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yoa 6, 1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 14:13" />Ehole eokaka Yesu gala emina, adongaka ena atiteaka ta bwato bɛngi akɛ ta etengelenge. Endolo emumu e bato bamookaka, baimanaka ta ngando i mbuti ko bakimanaka Yesu na mako. <verse eid="MAT 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 14:14" />Ta ehole eduboaka Yesu ta bwato, aenɛkɛ emumu e bato, alumaka na ndjokwa tina e bato bamina ko abangaka bobaheledja na bipeko bi bobo.<verse eid="MAT 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 14:15" />Ehole eimeaka mɔmɔkɔ, batingami ba Yesu babatamaka mbuti na nde ko babalaka: «Ehole esi ko polo ye edi etengelenge. Yanedja bato bi bɛngi bakɛ asomba leka loboyaka ta ngando.» <verse eid="MAT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 14:16" />Endolo Yesu abasɔmbedjaka: «Editi bopele bayane, ino bɛnɛ bapani mia ma boyaka!» <verse eid="MAT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 14:17" />Endolo Batingami bamosɔmbedjaka: «Lodi iya oto na miɛmbɛ mitano ko na swi babae.» <verse eid="MAT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 14:18" />Yesu abalaka: «Duani na lu.» <verse eid="MAT 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 14:19" />Apaka simbisi adi bato badae ta ndjani; ngɔngɔ atombaka miɛmbɛ mitano ko na swi babae, aangɔdjɔkɔ miso o diko ko asɔmbedjaka misakoa adi Ndjakomba. Abukaka mwɛmbɛ ko amopaka adi batingami ko batingami bakabaneaka emumu e bato. <verse eid="MAT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 14:20" />Moto mosusu ayakaka ko agolaka. Batingami bandoaka mitinga domi na babae mi bikengakengi ibidikaka. <verse eid="MAT 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 14:21" />Bato i bayaaka badaka bami mbuti na koto itano, pɛ botukoa bali na bana.<verse eid="MAT 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu adali diko i madiba</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Mlk 6, 45-52</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Yoa 6, 15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 14:22" />Ngɔngɔ imina, Yesu alomaka batingami ba nde batitee ta bwato ko bakɛ boso bo nde ta dɔngɔ ikina i duwa, ehole eyanedjakayo emumu e bato. <verse eid="MAT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 14:23" />Yana ayanedjakayo emumu e bato, aihweaka ta ikoli tine bongɔnɔ. Ehole eimeaka mɔmɔkɔ, adaka oho oko yo mɛnɛ. <verse eid="MAT 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 14:24" />Ta ehole emina bwato boimeaka bohali bo bamɛtɛlɛ mokama na ngondo, tengasa lungu ekumbaka, edaka engaingondo na polo ekɛkɛ bwato. <verse eid="MAT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 14:25" />Yana aimeaka mbuti na busa boyɛ, Yesu akɛkɛ dɔngɔ idaka batingami adale ta diko i madiba. <verse eid="MAT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 14:26" />Ehole emoenɛkɛ batingami bodala diko i madiba, baimeaka na bɔɔ ko babalaka: «Iyo te elima!» Ko badaka bogama na bɔɔ. <verse eid="MAT 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 14:27" />Endolo na mbala emɔti Yesu abalaka na bu: «Sapingedjani edi mbi, pɛ bobangani!» <verse eid="MAT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 14:28" />Piɛlɛ abalaka na nde: «Kumu, ekada boo edi wɛ, bala na mbi nadue oho adi wɛ ta diko i madiba.» <verse eid="MAT 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 14:29" />Yesu amosɔmbedjaka: «Dua!»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 14:29">Piɛlɛ aimi ta bwato ko abangi bodala diko i madiba bɛngi akɛ adi Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 14:30" />Endolo ehole enɛkɛ yo lungu epipo, aimeaka na bɔɔ. Abangaka bodinda ta madiba ko agamaka: «Kumu, heledjani!» <verse eid="MAT 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 14:31" />Na mbala emɔti, Yesu aninodjaka ebɔ, amopeaka ko abalaka na nde: «Moto o bodima bokɛkɛ, okakoani tina nda?» <verse eid="MAT 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 14:32" />Batiteaka bo babae ta bwato ko lungu egɔlɔkɔ. <verse eid="MAT 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 14:33" />Na bea batingami ibadaka ta bwato bakwaka magbundɔ ta boso bo Yesu ko babalaka: «Odi mɛnɛ Mwana o Ndjakomba!»<verse eid="MAT 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledji bato ba bipeko ba ibonga i Gelesa</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 6:53-56">Mlk 6, 53-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 14:34" />Ngɔngɔ i bobo bomela ibeke, baimeaka ta ngando e Gelesa. <verse eid="MAT 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 14:35" />Ehole edjebaka bato ba ngando yena boo edi Yesu, bananganedjaka gala e boimea bo nde ta mabonga ma mbuti ko bamolwɛkɛ bato ba bobo basusu ba bipeko. <verse eid="MAT 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 14:36" />Bamongɔnɔkɔ boo abapɛ ndjea e bopea nongo molenda mo esendja e nde; ko bato basusu ibaepeaka bahelaka.<verse eid="MAT 14:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MAT 15" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu ko bokɔkɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 7:1-13">Mlk 7, 1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 15:1" />Na bea bapalusai na balehi ba mobeko baduaka bodonga ta Yelusalɛmɛ tine bosaka na Yesu. Bamohɔdjɔkɔ: <verse eid="MAT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 15:2" />«Tina ndani batingami ba wɛ tebasumake mobeko mopaka bakɔkɔ ba biso? Tengasa tebasosake mɔmɔ boso bo boyaka bokimana bokɔkɔ bo biso<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Luk 11, 38.</char></note>.» <verse eid="MAT 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 15:3" />Yesu abasɔmbedjaka: «Ko ino, tina ndani tosumeni mobeko mo Ndjakomba tine bokimana mobeko mo bokɔkɔ bo bino? <verse eid="MAT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 15:4" />Tengasa Ndjakomba abalaka: “Suma sange e wɛ ko na nange e wɛ.” Ko pongono: “Yona alakedjake sange e nde kaoko nange e nde bobe, aboani na bogwa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boi 20, 12; Dut 5, 16.</char></note>.” <verse eid="MAT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 15:5" />Endolo ino, okaleheni: “Yona okabale na sange e nde kaoko na nange e nde: ‘Ekamoeli yena epalaki mbi bopa, naepi elenge ikabo isɛnɔke adi Ndjakomba.’” <verse eid="MAT 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 15:6" />Na ndjea emina, olomakani moto omina adae pɛ bopa ekumu adi sange e nde kaoko nange e nde. Na bea okatitedjeni Mobalo mo Ndjakomba tine bolongedja bokɔkɔ bo bino! <verse eid="MAT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 15:7" />Ndjɔ ba melo mibae! Isaya atɔndɔkɔ bopele ta tina e bino na mibalo mi:<verse eid="MAT 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 15:8" />“Bato bi bakakumedjeni oko na mibalo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 15:8">enakobea milema mi bobo midi bohali na mbi.<verse eid="MAT 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 15:9" />Edi oko ngasa bakaongɔneni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 15:9">tengasa bakalehe oko makɔkɔ ma bobo, imadi mibeko mi bato.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isa 15, 9, elangama bokimana makomi mayou ma gɛlɛki.</char></note>”»<verse eid="MAT 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Midjɔ mikimedje moto pita</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 7:14-23">Mlk 7, 14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 15:10" />Ngɔngɔ Yesu abeaka emumu e bato ko abalaka na bu: «Hokamedjani ko sipoani meako mi: <verse eid="MAT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 15:11" />Pɛ eka emɔti ekakwee ta monɔkɔ mo moto ekamoimedje pita. Enakobea edi eka yena ekimane ta monɔkɔ mo moto, ekamoimedje pita.»<verse eid="MAT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 15:12" />Na bea batingami babatamaka mbuti na Yesu ko babalaka na nde: «Odjebi boo bapalusai bataedjami mabaku na mibalo misokabo?» <verse eid="MAT 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 15:13" />Yesu asɔmbedjaka: «Kona esusu edi Sange e mbi yona odi o Diko pɛ boona, ebikoamabi. <verse eid="MAT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 15:14" />Bakinani, badi bato bagwa miso bia badaledjaka na bato bakina ibagwa miso! Ko ekada boo moto omɔti ogwa miso adaledji okina moto ogwa miso, bo basusu babae bakwabi ta mombɔndɔ.» <verse eid="MAT 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 15:15" />Piɛlɛ abalaka na nde: «Lotingodjea tina e isɛ idi.» <verse eid="MAT 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 15:16" />Yesu asɔmbedjaka: «Ino pongono, odini bato bataka e bowɛi? <verse eid="MAT 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 15:17" />Otasipoakani boo eka esusu ekakwee ta monɔko mo moto ekakɛɛ ta sɔpɔ i nde ko ekaime bokɛ ta ndima? <verse eid="MAT 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 15:18" />Endolo yena ekime ta monɔkɔ mo moto bodongaka ta molema ko edi yena ekamoimedje pita. <verse eid="MAT 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 15:19" />Tengasa ta tei e molema mo nde malɛi mabe makaimane makalome bowa, bɔɔli, ndukeli, iba, bobala bolowa ko bosinga Ndjakomba. <verse eid="MAT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 15:20" />Endja eka ekimedje moto pita! Endolo boyaka pɛ bososa mɔmɔ bokimana mobeko, teimedjake moto pita.»<verse eid="MAT 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwali o ekomi e bakɛndɛli adimi Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 7:24-30">Mlk 7, 24-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 15:21" />Yesu adongaka ena ko akɛkɛ ta mokpɔtɔ mo Tula ko mo Sidona. <verse eid="MAT 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 15:22" />Mwali omɔti o ngando e Kanana adaka ta mokpɔtɔ momina. Aduaka adi Yesu ko abangaka bogama: «Kumu, Mwana o Dapiti, okeani ndjokwa! Mwana o mbi mwali atungeamaka mɛnɛ na mwembo mobe!» <verse eid="MAT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 15:23" />Endolo Yesu aimosɔmbedjaka kɔpi. Batingami ba nde babatamaka mbuti na nde ko bamohɔdjɔkɔ: «Kumu, mobengana, tengasa aloyekeaka na dhaka!» <verse eid="MAT 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 15:24" />Yesu asɔmbedjaka: «Nalomama oko adi bhata ibunga i bato ba Isalɛlɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 15:25" />Endolo mwali aduaka bokwa magbundɔ ta boso bo Yesu ko abalaka: «Kumu, kamoani!» <verse eid="MAT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 15:26" />Yesu amosɔmbedjaka: «Editi bopele botomba mwɛmbɛ mo bana ba bato ko bosabea mbwa.» <verse eid="MAT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 15:27" />Mwali omina abalaka: «Kumu, edi okobea, nongokobea mbwa ekayake oko mbumbu ikakwɛ ta mesa i baswa bu.» <verse eid="MAT 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 15:28" />Na bea Yesu amosɔmbedjaka: «Oo! Bodima bo wɛ bodi bonɛnɛ! Ndjakomba aopake yena edi na wɛ posa.» Oko ta ehole emina mwana o nde mwali ahelaka.<verse eid="MAT 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledji bato banɛnɛ ba bipeko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 15:29" />Yesu adongaka ena ko akɛkɛ ta yɔngɔ e ibeke i Galilea. Aihweaka ta ikoli ko asadedjaka. <verse eid="MAT 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 15:30" />Emumu e bato baduaka adi yo, bamolwɛkɛ bato bamitɛngu, bato bagwa miso, bimimi, bitumbɛ, na bato bakina ba bipeko tungu na tungu. Babasambeaka ta mako ma Yesu ko abaheledjaka. <verse eid="MAT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 15:31" />Na bea emumu e bato bakamoaka boenɛ boo bimimi bobala, bitumbɛ bohela, bato ba mitɛngu bodala ko bato i bagwa miso boenɛ; baimeaka bokumedja Ndjakomba o Isalɛlɛ.<verse eid="MAT 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ayakedji bato koto inɛi</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 8:1-10">Mlk 8, 1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 15:32" />Yesu abeaka batingami ba nde ko abalaka: «Nadi na ndjokwa na bato bi, tengasa bakɔi masu masato engbanga na mbi ko baditi na eka e boyaka. Naloni bobayanedja sopɔ bwase; basakaembɛ na ndjea.» <verse eid="MAT 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 15:33" />Batingami bamohɔdjɔkɔ: «Aboaniso bodia eka e boyakedja emumu ye e bato djɔ? Tengasa polo ye ediso edi etengelenge.» <verse eid="MAT 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 15:34" />Yesu abahɔdjɔkɔ: «Odini na miɛmbɛ meka?» Ko batingami bamosɔmbedjaka: «Lodi na miɛmbɛ sambo ko na baaswi bakɛkɛkɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 15:35" />Na bea Yesu abalaka na emumu e bato badae ta kpɔtɔ. <verse eid="MAT 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 15:36" />Na bea atombaka miɛmbɛ mimina sambo ko na swi, asakoaka Ndjakomba, amibukaka ko amipaka adi batingami ba nde ko batingami bamikabanaka adi emumu e bato basusu. <verse eid="MAT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 15:37" />Bato basusu bayaka, bagolaka ko batingami bandoaka mitinga sambo mi bikengakengi ibidikaka. <verse eid="MAT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 15:38" />Bato ibayaka badaka koto inɛi, pɛ bolanga bali na bana. <verse eid="MAT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 15:39" />Ngɔngɔ iboyanedja emumu e bato, Yesu atiteaka ta bwato ko akɛkɛ ta mokpɔtɔ mo Magadani.<verse eid="MAT 15:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MAT 16" />
  <para style="s1">Bapalusai ko na Basadokai bahɔdji embete e ngindola</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 8:11-13">Mlk 8, 11-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:54-56">Luk 12, 54-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 16:1" />Bapalusai ko na basadokai baduaka adi Yesu tine bomopikea elambo. Bamohɔdjɔkɔ bɛngi abainedje embete e ngindola emɔti bodonga ta busa. <verse eid="MAT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 16:2" />Endolo Yesu abasɔmbedjaka: «Mɔmɔkɔ, okabaleni: “Puma adake bopele, tengasa matute madi mapu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16, 2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ta esika e bali Bibilia boo matute makpeti; Epalaka ebale boo matute madi mapu.</char></note>.” <verse eid="MAT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 16:3" />Ko ehuma, okabaleni: “Mbua ekwake busa bu, tengasa matute mahindi kwii<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16, 3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ta esika e bali Bibilia boo matute makpeti elenge mosa; Epalaka ebale boo matute mahindi yɔɔ.</char></note>.” Okadjebeni botikoanedja bimbete bi busa, endolo todjebeni botikoanedja bimbete bi bihole! <verse eid="MAT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 16:4" />Bato ba ehole ye, ibadi bato babe ko bataki isuma adi Ndjakomba, bahɔdjɔkɔ embete e ngindola? Embete emɔti oko yena epamabi: embete e Yona<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16, 4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta 12, 39-40.</char></note>.» Na bea abakinaka ko akɛkɛ.<verse eid="MAT 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lepile e bapalusai ko na e basadukai</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 8:14-21">Mlk 8, 14-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 16:5" />Ehole emeleka batingami pamba ekina e ibeke, babosaka botomba mwɛmbɛ. <verse eid="MAT 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 16:6" />Yesu abalaka na bu: «Omadani na edinga na lepile e bapalusai ko na e basadokai.» <verse eid="MAT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 16:7" />Na bea batingami baimeaka bosabaleana: «Abali bea tine lobosi botomba mwɛmbɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 16:8" />Elenge Yesu adjebaka yo malɛi ma bobo, abalaka: «Tina ndani wasabaleanakani boo obosini botomba mwɛmbɛ? Bato ba bodima bokɛkɛ! <verse eid="MAT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 16:9" />Osipoakinini oko? Obosini miɛmbɛ mitano imikabanakano na bami koto itano ko na motuya mo mitinga mo bikengakengi bidikaka na nu? <verse eid="MAT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 16:10" />Obosini pongono miɛmbɛ sambo imikabanaka no na bami koto inɛi ko na motuya mo mitinga mo bikengakengi bidikaka na nu? <verse eid="MAT 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 16:11" />Mbunoko edɛdi osipoakeni boo nabaliti na nu tine mwɛmbɛ, ehole eotɔndeakini mbi: omadani na edinga na lepile e bapalusai ko na e basadokai?»<verse eid="MAT 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 16:12" />Na bea, batingami basipoaka boo aibalaka na bu, badea na edinga tine lepile e mwɛmbɛ, endolo badea na edinga tine bileho bi bapalusai ko na basadokai.<verse eid="MAT 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Piɛlɛ adimi boo Yesu adi Kumu</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 8:27-30">Mlk 8, 27-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luk 9, 18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 16:13" />Yesu aimeaka ta ekenge e mokpɔtɔ mo Sedjale e Pilipo. Ahɔdjɔkɔ batingami ba nde: «Ekabale bato ta tina e Mwana o Moto nde?» <verse eid="MAT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 16:14" />Basɔmbedjaka: «Bamɔti bakabale boo odi Yoane Mobatisi; bakina, Elia; bakina pongono, Yilimeya kaoko omɔti ta tei e ba mbaeli ba Ndjakomba.» <verse eid="MAT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 16:15" />Yesu abahɔdjɔkɔ: «Ko ta tina e bino, okabaleni mbi nadi nda?» <verse eid="MAT 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 16:16" />Simo Piɛlɛ asɔmbedjaka: «Odi Kilito, Mwana o Ndjakomba o bomɔ.» <verse eid="MAT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 16:17" />Na bea Yesu abalaka na nde: «Sepi adi wɛ, Simo mwana o Yona; tengasa editi bomoto bodjebedji wɛ soti e midjɔ mi, endolo edi Sange e mbi yona odi o diko. <verse eid="MAT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 16:18" />Na bea mbi, nabali na wɛ, odi Piɛlɛ ko ta diko i ibanga dii, natongake Ekelesa e mbi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16, 18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Epe 2, 20.</char></note>. Edae sueya e bogwa idaetebi na bokondji ta diko i Ekelesa emina. <verse eid="MAT 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 16:19" />Nopabi pongola i Bokumu bo diko: losusu lonangakabi wɛ iya ta kpɔtɔ, lonangamakabi pongono o diko; losusu lolodjakabi wɛ ta kpɔtɔ, lolodjamakabi pongono o diko<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16, 19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta 18, 18; Yoa 20, 23.</char></note>.» <verse eid="MAT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 16:20" />Na bea Yesu asiaka batingami ba nde na bopipo badae pɛ botɔndea moto boo adi Kilito.<verse eid="MAT 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu atɔndi tine bogwa ko bopusoa bo nde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 16:21" />Donga ta ehole emina, Yesu aimeaka bobala bohu na batingami ba nde: «Etungi nakɛ ta Yelusalɛmɛ oho naenɛke saya enɛnɛ ta mɔmɔ ma basuku, bakondji ba banganga ba Ndjakomba ko na balehi ba mobeko. Nagwake ko napusoake ngɔngɔ isu i basato.» <verse eid="MAT 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 16:22" />Piɛlɛ asasuaka na Yesu mootɔtɔkɔ ko amogameaka: «Ngasa, ta kombe e Ndjakomba, eka etokɔke!» <verse eid="MAT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 16:23" />Endolo Yesu ahombanaka ko abalaka na Piɛlɛ: «Sɔmbɔ ngɔngɔ i mbi, Satana! Odi ibaku tina e mbi, tengasa malɛi ma wɛ maditi malɛi ma Ndjakomba, endolo malɛi ma bato.»<verse eid="MAT 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 16:24" />Ngɔngɔ Yesu abalaka na batingami ba nde: «Ekadabo moto apali bokimanani, atungi bosalona yo mɛnɛ, atombe ekulusu e nde ko akimaneni. <verse eid="MAT 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 16:25" />Tengasa moto mosusu opali boheledja mohelo mo nde, amobungedjake, endolo moto mosusu abungedjake mohelo mo nde tine e mbi, amobolodjake. <verse eid="MAT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 16:26" />Tɛtɔ ndaa adiake moto, akatomba ngondo esusu ko abungedji mohelo mo nde? <verse eid="MAT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 16:27" />Tengasa Mwana o Moto aduabi ta ekumu e Sange e nde, engbanga na babwɛndji ba nde ko aputabi moto na moto bokokana na misala mi nde<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16, 27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Ndj 62, 13; Bal 2, 6.</char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 16:28" />Edi soti, nabalaka na nu: ekenge e bato ibadiya bagwɛtɛbi, boso bo boenɛ bodua bo Mwana o Moto elenge Kumu.»<verse eid="MAT 16:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="MAT 17" />
  <para style="s1">Mokuku mo Yesu mosendji</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 9:2-13">Mlk 9, 2-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luk 9, 28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 17:1" />Ngɔngɔ i masu masamano, Yesu atombaka Piɛlɛ, Djake, Yoane, mwange e Djake; asasuaka na bu mootɔtɔkɔ, ta diko i ikoli. <verse eid="MAT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 17:2" />Yesu asendjaka ta miso ma bobo; boso bo nde boimeaka bongɛsɛ elenge moyi ko bisendja bi nde bimeaka bogbolibana ipɛɛ. <verse eid="MAT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 17:3" />Mbala emɔti, batingami basato baenɛkɛ Mose na Elia bosoola na Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 17:4" />Na bea Piɛlɛ abalaka na Yesu: «Kumu, enɔi na bopele tina e biso lodae iya. Okadima, lopike bitondo bisato: emɔti tina e wɛ, emɔti tina e Mose ko emɔti tina e Elia.» <verse eid="MAT 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 17:5" />Yana adaka bo babala, itute imɔti idaka bongɛsɛ ibadipaka ko kɔpi emɔti eokamaka donga ta itute: «Iyo adi Mwana o mbi oepaeli, nasepi na nde mɛnɛ. Mokeani!» <verse eid="MAT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 17:6" />Ehole eokaka batingami kɔpi emina, baimeaka na bɔɔ ko bakwaka maso ta kpɔtɔ. <verse eid="MAT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 17:7" />Endolo Yesu abatamaka mbuti na bu, abapeaka ko abalaka: «Angɔni! Pɛ bobangani.» <verse eid="MAT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 17:8" />Baongɔdjɔkɔ miso ko baienɛ moto oko Yesu yo mɛnɛ. <verse eid="MAT 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 17:9" />Ehole edakabo botita ta ikoli, Yesu abapaka simbisi ye: «Meako misenɛno, pɛ botɔndeani moto omɔti ndjɛnɛ ye, mbunoko Mwana o Moto akapusoa ta tei e bago.»<verse eid="MAT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 17:10" />Ngɔngɔ batingami bahɔdjɔkɔ Yesu: «Tina ndani balehi ba mobeko bakabale boo Elia aboani bodua o boso<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17, 10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mal 3, 23.</char></note>?» <verse eid="MAT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 17:11" />Yesu abasɔmbedjaka: «Edi soti boo, Elia aboani bodua tine bosɔmbedja midjɔ misusu ta molɔngɔ. <verse eid="MAT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 17:12" />Mbi nabalaka na nu boo Elia adua ehele, enakobea bato baimosipoaka, bakɔkɔ na nde moda mopalakabo. Edi oko moda mua banɔngedjake Mwana o Moto.» <verse eid="MAT 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 17:13" />Batingami basipoaka boo adaka bobala tina e Yoane Mobatisi.<verse eid="MAT 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledji mwana o isiesie</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 9:14-29">Mlk 9, 14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luk 9, 37-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 17:14" />Ehole eimeaka bo mbuti na polo edaka emumu e bato, moto omɔti abatamaka mbuti na Yesu, akwaka magbundɔ ta boso nde <verse eid="MAT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 17:15" />ko abalaka: «Kumu okea mwana o mbi ndjokwa! Adi na yogo e isiesie ko aenɛkɛ saya, emodumbaka mandɛli mandɛli ta mosa kaoko ta madiba. <verse eid="MAT 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 17:16" />Nakɛki na nde adi batingami ba wɛ, endolo bahɔniti bomoheledja.» <verse eid="MAT 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 17:17" />Yesu abalaka: «Bato ba kitɛ, bato ba taka e edimeli! Bihole beka badake mbi na nu naikina? Mbunoko ehole nda eboani na mbi bohɔnɔni? Duani na mwana omina.» <verse eid="MAT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 17:18" />Yesu agameaka mwembo mobe momina, moimaka ta tei e mwana omina ko ahelaka oko ta ehole emina. <verse eid="MAT 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 17:19" />Na bea batingami bakɛkɛ na Yesu mootɔtɔkɔ ko bamohɔdjɔkɔ: «Tina ndani, iso lohɔniti bobengana mwembo momina mobe?» <verse eid="MAT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 17:20" />Yesu abasɔmbedjaka: «Edi tine boo odini na bodima bokɛkɛ. Edi soti, nabalaka na nu: okadani na bodima elenge mbuma e motade, oboanini bobala na ikoli di: “Donga ya, kɛ oho” ko lakɛke. Pɛ modjɔ moonɔbini na bopipo. [ <verse eid="MAT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 17:21" />Endolo edi na ndjea e miongɔnɔ ko na bokia oboani bobenganani mondumba mo mwembo moda mua<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17, 21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Molɔngɔ mu moditi ta makomi manɛnɛ mayou.</char></note>.]»<verse eid="MAT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu atɔndi naikina bogwa ko na bopusoa bo nde</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mlk 9, 30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43b-45">Luk 9, 43b-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 17:22" />Busa bomɔti, batingami baputoanaka bo basusu ta mokpɔtɔ mo Galilea, Yesu abalaka na bu: «Mwana o Moto akabamake ta mɔmɔ ma bato babe, <verse eid="MAT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 17:23" />bamowabi; endolo ta isu i basato apusoabi.» Na bea batingami balumaka na ndjokwa enɛnɛ.<verse eid="MAT 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ko Piɛlɛ baputi puti e tepelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 17:24" />Ehole eimeaka Yesu na batingami ta ibonga i Kapalanauma, baputedji ba puti e tepelo baduaka adi Piɛlɛ ko bamohɔdjɔkɔ: «Molehi o bino taputake puti e tepelo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17, 24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boi 30, 11-16.</char></note>?» <verse eid="MAT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 17:25" />Piɛlɛ abasɔmbedjaka: «Okobea, akapute!» Ehole ekweaka Piɛlɛ ta ndako, Yesu adaka moto o boso o bomohɔdjɔ: «Simo, elɛdji wɛ nde? Okapute puti adi bakondji ba ngondo ye nda? Bana ba bobo kaoko bakɛndɛli?» <verse eid="MAT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 17:26" />«Piɛlɛ asɔmbedjaka: Bakɛndɛli.» Yesu abalaka na nde: «Bana tebaputake puti. <verse eid="MAT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 17:27" />Enakobea, lotapala boisa bato bamina djenge ta malɛi ma bobo. Kɛɛ ta ibeke, maa ilɔpi ta madiba ko moswi o boso otaedjake wɛ, dipoa monɔkɔ mo moswi omina: wataneake palanga e ebende emɔti eboani boputa puti e mbi ko na wɛ; etomba ko oloputee puti.»<verse eid="MAT 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="MAT 18" />
  <para style="s1">Moto onɔi monɛnɛ ta Bokumu bo diko</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mlk 9, 33-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luk 9, 46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 18:1" />Oko ta ehole yena, batingami babatamaka mbuti na Yesu ko bamohɔdjɔkɔ: «Moto onɔi monɛnɛ ta Bokumu bo diko nda?» <verse eid="MAT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 18:2" />Yesu abeaka mwana omɔti mokɛkɛ, amoemeaka ta ndanda e bobo <verse eid="MAT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 18:3" />ko abalaka: «Edi soti, nabalaka na nu: omitisɔmbɔtɔnɔni milema bɛngi oimeeni elenge bana bakɛkɛ, okwetebini ta Bokumu bo diko. <verse eid="MAT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 18:4" />Na tina emina, moto mosusu odi bosatitedja elenge mwana iyo, adabi monɛnɛ ta Bokumu bo diko. <verse eid="MAT 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 18:5" />Ko moto mosusu yona oasɔi mwana ta kombe e mbi, asɔi mbi mɛnɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Edinga ta tine mabaku</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 9:42-48">Mlk 9, 42-48</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luk 17, 1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 18:6" />«Endolo moto yona okataedje ibaku adi omɔti o bana bakɛkɛbi ibadimeakani, enɔi na bopele tina e nde bomonanga ibanga inɛnɛ ta dɔli ko bomodumba ta duwa enɛnɛ. <verse eid="MAT 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 18:7" />Ndjokwa e ngondo tine mabaku! Soti edake oko na mabaku manɛnɛ makadumbe bato ta bobe! Endolo ndjokwa adi moto yona okamimedje! <verse eid="MAT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 18:8" />Ekada ebɔ kaoko eko e wɛ eimei ibaku iolindaka ta bobe, elena ko edumba bohali na wɛ. Enɔi bopele tina e wɛ bokwea ta mohele mopele na ebɔ kaoko na eko emɔti, ta esika e bobanea mɔmɔ kaoko mako mabea ko bodumbama ta ipombe i mosa mo seko. <verse eid="MAT 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 18:9" />Ko ekada diso i wɛ iimei ibaku iodumbaka ta bobe, iongodja ko idumba bohali na wɛ. Enɔi bopele tina e wɛ bokwea ta mohelo mopele na diso imɔti, ta esika e bobabanea miso mabae ko bodumbama ta geena e ipelu.»<verse eid="MAT 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isɛ i bhata ebunga ko eboloi</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="LUK 15:3-7">Luk 15, 3-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 18:10" />«Daani na edinga, pɛ boenɛni ngasa omɔti o bana bi bakɛkɛ! Na bea notɔndeakani, babwɛndji ba bobo bakaemae seko ta boso bo Sange e mbi yona odi o diko. [ <verse eid="MAT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 18:11" />Tengasa Mwana o Moto adua tine boheledja bato i babunga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18, 11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Molɔngɔ mu moditi ta makomi manɛnɛ mayou. Endja pongono ta Luk 19, 10.</char></note>.]<verse eid="MAT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 18:12" />«Olɛdjini bo? Ekada moto omɔti adi na bhata mokama ko omɔti ebungi, aboaniti bokina bhata tuku ibua na ibua ta ikoli tine bokɛ bohomba yena ebungi? <verse eid="MAT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 18:13" />Ta soti nabalaka na nu, akaebolodja, alumake na sepi bonɔ bhata tuku ibua na ibua i badaa pɛ bobunga. <verse eid="MAT 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 18:14" />Oko moda momina, Sange e bino yona odi o diko aboaniti bodima bobungedja omɔti o bana bi.»<verse eid="MAT 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ehole ekɔi mwange e wɛ bobe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 18:15" />«Ekada mwange e wɛ aokɔmei bobe, kɛɛ wɛ mɛnɛ bomotanea ko bomoinedja bobe bo nde. Akaokea, osɔmbedji mwange e wɛ ta ndjea. <verse eid="MAT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 18:16" />Endolo akalona bokea, bea moto omɔti kaoko bato babae engbanga na wɛ, bɛngi lokokedje moda mabalaka ikomi, “tengasa modjɔ mosusu mokabɔngedjame na tati e bato babae kaoko basato.” <verse eid="MAT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 18:17" />Endolo akalona bookea, tɔndea basuku ba Ekelesa; ekadabo aloni bookea basuku ba Ekelesa, motombani elenge mokɛndɛli kaoko elenge moputedji o puti. <verse eid="MAT 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 18:18" />Okobea, edi soti, nabalaka na nu: misusu minangakabino ta ngondo minangamabi o diko; ko misusu milodjakabino ta ngondo milodjamakabi o diko. <verse eid="MAT 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 18:19" />Okobea nabalaka na nu pongono, ekada bato babae badimeani iya ta kpɔtɔ tine bosɛngɛ eka emɔti bea, Sange e mbi yona odi o diko abapakabi yu. <verse eid="MAT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 18:20" />Tengasa polo eputoani bato babae kaoko basato ta kombe e mbi, mbi nadi ta ndanda e bobo.»<verse eid="MAT 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isɛ i mosali olona boyɛmɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 18:21" />Na bea Piɛlɛ abatamaka mbuti na Yesu ko amohɔdjɔkɔ: «Kumu, mbala djeka iboani na mbi boyɛ mwange e mbi ehole ekɔini yo bobe? Mbunoko mbala sambo?» <verse eid="MAT 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 18:22" />Yesu asɔmbedjaka: «Ngasa, nabaliti mbunoko mbala sambo, endolo mbunoko mbala tuku sambo na sambo mitomba sambo. <verse eid="MAT 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 18:23" />Na tina emina, endja moda moboani na Bokondji bo diko: mokondji omɔti atombaka meko ebobɔngedja midjɔ miendji palanga engbanga na basali ba nde. <verse eid="MAT 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 18:24" />Ehole ebangaka yo bokɔ, bamoinedjaka mosali omɔti yona odaka na nyongo e nde enɛnɛ e palanga i bibende koto domi. <verse eid="MAT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 18:25" />Moto omina aidaka na mwɛngi e bosɔmbedja nyongo emina. Na bea mokondji o nde apaka simbisi e boengɛdjɛ yo, mwali o nde ko bana ba nde elenge babuli engbanga na leka lo nde losusu, bɛngi apute nyongo. <verse eid="MAT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 18:26" />Mosali omina akwaka magbundɔ ta boso bo mokondji ko asayeanaka: “Okapala okeani ndjokwa, naputake nyongo e wɛ esusu!” <verse eid="MAT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 18:27" />Mokondji aokeaka mosali omina ndjokwa: amokineaka nyongo emina ko amokinaka bokɛ. <verse eid="MAT 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 18:28" />Ehole eimanaka mosali, asonganaka na omɔti o minande mosali yona odaka pongono na nyongo e nde: aboanaka bomosɔmbedja palanga mokama momɔti mo bibende. Amosuweaka gɔbɔli ta moholi ko abalaka: “Puta nyongo e mbi!” <verse eid="MAT 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 18:29" />Minande mosali asadumbaka ta mako ma nde ko asayeanaka ta boso bo nde: “Okapala okeani ndjokwa, naputake nyongo e wɛ esusu!” <verse eid="MAT 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 18:30" />Endolo minande alonaka: akɛkɛ bomopunda ko bamoisaka ta ndjango, mbunoko ehole aputakeyo nyongo e nde. <verse eid="MAT 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 18:31" />Ehole enɛkɛ bakina ba binande basali bea, baimeaka na ndjokwa enɛnɛ ko bakɛkɛ botɔndɔ midjɔ mimina adi mokondji o bobo. <verse eid="MAT 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 18:32" />Na bea mokondji abeaka mosali omina ko abalaka na nde: “Mosali obobila! Nayɛki nyongo e wɛ esusu tine osayeanaki. <verse eid="MAT 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 18:33" />Eboanakiti na wɛ pongono bookea minawɛ ndjokwa elenge aokei mbi wɛ ndjokwa.” <verse eid="MAT 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 18:34" />Mokondji aimeaka na kɛlɛ enɛnɛ ko amolomaka ta mɔmɔ ma basali ba misala mipipo mbunoko apute nyongo e nde esusu.»<verse eid="MAT 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 18:35" />Yesu abakeaka: «Edi oko moda mua Sange e mbi yona odi o diko akɔbi na moto mosusu ta tei e bino yona odabi pɛ boyɛ minande, na molema mo nde mosusu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18, 35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kokanedja ta 6, 15.</char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 18:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="MAT 19" />
  <para style="s1">Eleho e Yesu tine bowa moki</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 10:1-12">Mlk 10, 1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 19:1" />Ehole esidjaka Yesu bopa bileho bimina, akinaka Galilea ko akɛkɛ ta mokpɔtɔ mo Yuda, ta dɔngɔ ikina i Yolodane. <verse eid="MAT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 19:2" />Emumu e bato emokimanaka ko abaheledjaka na bipeko bi bobo. <verse eid="MAT 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 19:3" />Bapalusai babatamaka mbuti na nde tine bomopikea elambo. Bamohɔdjɔkɔ: «Mobeko mo biso mapaka ndjea na momi adongedje mwali o nde ta moki na tina emɔti?» <verse eid="MAT 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 19:4" />Yesu asɔmbedjaka: «Oilangani eka abalaka ikomi boo ta mbangi, Moyoi ayoaka momi na mwali<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19, 4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mba 1, 27; 5.2.</char></note>? <verse eid="MAT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 19:5" />Ngɔngɔ abalaka: “Na tina emina momi akinakabi sango ko nango tine boputoana na mwali o nde ko bo babae baimeabi moto omɔti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19, 5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mba 2, 24.</char></note>.” <verse eid="MAT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 19:6" />Na bea, baditi naikina bato babae, endolo moto omɔti. Kina boo moto adae pɛ bogbɔtodja bato baputoanedji Ndjakomba.» <verse eid="MAT 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 19:7" />Bapalusai bamohɔdjɔkɔ: «Na bea tina ndani Mose apaka mobeko adi momi boo apɛ mwali o nde mokanda mo bowa moki ekadabo agbɔti na nde<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19, 7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Dit 24, 1; Mat 5, 31.</char></note>?» <verse eid="MAT 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 19:8" />Yesu asɔmbedjaka: «Mose aopani mobeko mo bodongedja bali ba bino ta moki tine boo odini na milema mipipo. Endolo ta mbangi, eidaka bea. <verse eid="MAT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 19:9" />Nabalaka na nu: ekadabo momi adongedji mwali o nde ta moki, na bea akasɔ okina mwali, akɔi bɔɔli; dongedja oko mwali omina akɔi bɔɔli.»<verse eid="MAT 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 19:10" />Batingami ba nde babalaka: «Ekadabo meako mimina miboani boda bea ta tei e momi na mwali, tina e boasɔni editi.» <verse eid="MAT 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 19:11" />Yesu abasɔmbedjaka: «Bami basusu baboaniti bodima eleho ye, endolo oko ibia ibapa Ndjakomba ndjea. <verse eid="MAT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 19:12" />Edi na midjɔ mikakɔe boo bami bakina badae pɛ boasɔ bali: tine bamɔti, babotama bea; tine bakina, baimedjama mikube na bato; edi pongono na bakina balona boasɔ bali tine Bokumu bo diko. Kina boo yona oboani bodima eleho ye adime!»<verse eid="MAT 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu adjongoi bana bakɛkɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mlk 10, 13-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luk 18, 15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 19:13" />Na bea bato baduaka na bana adi Yesu bɛngi abababakee mɔmɔ ko aongɔne tine bobo, endolo batingami bagameaka bato. <verse eid="MAT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 19:14" />Na bea Yesu abalaka: «Kinani bana badue adi mbi, pɛ bobasiani, tengasa Bokumu bo diko bodi tine bia badi elenge bo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19, 14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kokanedja ta 18, 3-5</char></note>.» <verse eid="MAT 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 19:15" />Ababakeaka mɔmɔ ko adongaka ena.<verse eid="MAT 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ko mwenga modieli</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mlk 10, 17-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luk 18, 18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 19:16" />Na bea moto omɔti abatamaka mbuti na Yesu ko amohɔdjɔkɔ: «Molehi eka epele eboani mbi bokɔ nda, bɛngi nadie mohelo mo seko?» <verse eid="MAT 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 19:17" />Yesu amosɔmbedjaka: «Tina ndani ohɔdjini tine eka eendji bopele? Eka emɔti oko edi bopele. Okapala bokwea ta mohelo, suma mibeko.» <verse eid="MAT 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 19:18" />Ahɔdjɔkɔ: «Mibeko mimina mi doo?» Yesu amosɔmbedjaka: «Pɛ bowa moto; pɛ bokɔ bɔɔli; pɛ boiba; pɛ bobala tati e boloa ta tina e mina wɛ; <verse eid="MAT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 19:19" />suma sange e wɛ ko na nange e wɛ; pala mwange e wɛ elenge akasapale wɛ mɛnɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 19:20" />Mwenga amosɔmbedjaka: «Nakasume mibeko mimina misusu. Nakɔe naikaina ye?» <verse eid="MAT 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 19:21" />Yesu abalaka na nde: «Okapala odae moto moboanake, kɛɛ botɛkɛ losusu lodi na wɛ ko pa palanga adi batakeli, na bea wadiake bodieli bodi ta busa; ngɔngɔ dua ko kimanani.» <verse eid="MAT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 19:22" />Endolo ehole eoka mwenga bea, akɛkɛ na ndjokwa enɛnɛ, tine boo adaka na bodieli bonɛnɛ.<verse eid="MAT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 19:23" />Yesu abalaka na batingami ba nde: «Okobea, nabalaka na nu: edi bopipo na modieli bokwea ta Bokumu bo diko. <verse eid="MAT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 19:24" />Ko nabalaka na nu naikina: edi bopipo na tito okabeebo kamela bonɔ ta ipose i sinani; endolo enɔi naikina bopipo bonɔ modieli bokwea ta Bokumu bo diko.» <verse eid="MAT 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 19:25" />Ehole eokaka batingami bea, bakamoaka ko babalaka: «Ekada mɛnɛ bea ohelabi nda?» <verse eid="MAT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 19:26" />Yesu abaendjaka ko abalaka na bu: «Modjɔ modi bato pɛ bohɔnɔ bokɔ, Ndjakomba adi bomokɔ.» <verse eid="MAT 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 19:27" />Piɛlɛ abalaka na nde: «Iso lokini losusu tine bokimana wɛ. Ediabiso nde?» <verse eid="MAT 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 19:28" />Yesu abalaka na bu: «Edi soti nabalaka na nu: ehole edakabi Mwana o Moto ta ngbɛndɛ e ekumu e nde ta ngondo eyanie, ino ba domi na babae ibakimanani, odakabini pongono ta mingbɛlɛngɔ tine bosambedja mabota domi na babae ma Isalɛlɛ. <verse eid="MAT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 19:29" />Ko bato ibakinaka tina e mbi ndako i bobo, bange i bobo, ngɛnɛ i bobo, sange i bobo, nange i bobo, bana ba bobo, gbie i bobo badiakabi mbala mokama bonɔ ko badiakabi ibondo ta mohelo mo seko. <verse eid="MAT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 19:30" />Endolo bato banɛnɛ i badi boso, badakabi bato ba ngɔngɔ ko bato banɛnɛ i badi edɛdi bato ba ngɔngɔ, badakabi bato ba boso.»<verse eid="MAT 19:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="MAT 20" />
  <para style="s1">Basali ba ehole e suka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 20:1" />«Na bea, endja moda moboani na Bokumu bo diko: moswa ndako omɔti aimaka ehuma mɛnɛ bɛngi atombe basali tine bosala ta gbie e nde e vino. <verse eid="MAT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 20:2" />Adimanaka na bu bobaputa na iputi iboani na palanga e ebende emɔti tine busa bomɔti. Ngɔngɔ abalomaka bosala ta gbie e nde e vino. <verse eid="MAT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 20:3" />Aimaka mbala ekina ta ehole e basato e ehuma, aenɛkɛ bato bakina baemi ta polo e bhuda pɛ bokɔ eka momɔti. <verse eid="MAT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 20:4" />Abalaka na bu: “Ino pongono kɛni, bosala ta gbie e mbi e vino ko noputakeni iputi iboanake.” <verse eid="MAT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 20:5" />Ko bakɛkɛ. Moswa gbie aimaka naikina ta ehole e midi, na bea akɔkɔ oko moda momɔti ta ehole e basato ngɔngɔ i midi. <verse eid="MAT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 20:6" />Na bea, bokimana ehole e batano e mɔmɔkɔ, aimaka ko ataneaka bami bakina ibaemaka ta polo emina. Abahɔdjɔkɔ: “Tina ndani oemini iya isu itombo pɛ bokɔ eka emɔti?” <verse eid="MAT 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 20:7" />Bamosɔmbedjaka “Loemi bea, tine pɛ moto obolotomba ta mosala.” Na bea abalaka na bu: “Ino pongono, kɛni, bosala ta gbie e mbi e vino.”<verse eid="MAT 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 20:8" />«Ta ehole e mɔmɔkɔ, moswa gbie e vino abalaka na kapita o misala mi nde: “Bea basali ko puta moto na moto iputi i nde. Banga boputa basali ba ngɔngɔ ko osukedje na bia ba boso.” <verse eid="MAT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 20:9" />Bato i babangaka mosala ta ehole e batano e mɔmɔkɔ, baduaka ko moto na moto boputama na iputi iboani motuya mo palanga emɔti e ebende. <verse eid="MAT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 20:10" />Ehole eimeaka mbala e boputa basali ba boso, balɛdjɛkɛ boo baboani bodia bonɔ; endolo bapaka pongono moto na moto boputa na itputi iboani na motuya mo palanga emɔti e ebende. <verse eid="MAT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 20:11" />Ehole eputamaka bo bea, bakotoaka moswa gbie <verse eid="MAT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 20:12" />ko babalaka: “Basali ibapi wɛ mosala basali oko ehole emɔti, obaputi moda momɔti na su i banɔngi na mosala mopipo busa itombo ko na moi mopipo!” <verse eid="MAT 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 20:13" />Endolo moswa gbie asɔmbedjaka na omɔti ta tei e bobo: “Mwange e mba, nokɔmeiti modjɔ mobe. Nadimanaka nasawɛ bosala tina e boputa palanga emɔti e ebende na isu, editi bea? <verse eid="MAT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 20:14" />Tomba iputi i wɛ ko kɛ. Nasepi bopa adi mosali o ngɔngɔ oko moda momɔti na wɛ. <verse eid="MAT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 20:15" />Eboaniti na mbi bokɔ na palanga i mbi eka apalaka mbi? Kaoko odi na ikuwa tine bo nadi mopele?” <verse eid="MAT 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 20:16" />Na bea, Yesu abakeaka, bato i badi bato ba ngɔngɔ badakabi bato ba boso ko bato ba boso badakabi bato ba ngɔngɔ.»<verse eid="MAT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu atɔndi naikina bogwa ko na bopusoa bo nde</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mlk 10, 32-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luk 18, 31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 20:17" />Yana adaka Yesu akɛ ta ibonga Yelusalɛmɛ. Asasuaka na batingami domi na babae ko abalaka na bu ndjea ndjea, yana adaka bo badale: <verse eid="MAT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 20:18" />«Hokamedjani! Lakɛkɛ ta ibonga i Yelusalɛmɛ, oho Mwana o Moto akabamake ta mɔmɔ ma bakondji ba Banganga ba Ndjakomba ko na balehi ba mobeko. Bamoleneake etumbu e bogwa <verse eid="MAT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 20:19" />ko bamokabake ta mɔmɔ ma bato ba bikomi bi bakɛndɛli, bamosɛkɛke, bamokɛsɛkɛke mbalake ko bamobakake ta ekulusu. Ko ngɔngɔ isu i basato apusoake.»<verse eid="MAT 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ihɔdjɔ i nange e bana ba Djebede</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 10:35-45">Mlk 10, 35-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 20:20" />Na bea mwali o Djebede abatamaka mbuti na Yesu engbanga na bana ba nde bami babae. Angundamaka ta boso bo nde tine bomohɔdjɔ ekamoi. <verse eid="MAT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 20:21" />Yesu amohɔdjɔkɔ: «Apalaka wɛ nde?» Amosɔmbedjaka: «Dikanani boo bana ba mbi bami bi, badae omɔti ta ebɔ e wɛ e bami ko okina ta ebɔ e wɛ e bali, ehole adake wɛ ta Bokumu bo wɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 20:22" />Yesu asɔmbedjaka: «Otadjebakani modjɔ masɛngɛkɛ no! Bahɔnɔke bomwaka kɔbɔ e saya yena amwake mbi?» Bamosɔmbedjaka: «Ee, lahɔnɔke.» <verse eid="MAT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 20:23" />Yesu abalaka na bu: «Na bea soti wamwakeni kɔbɔ mbi. Endolo boda ta ebɔ e mbi e bami kaoko ta ebɔ e mbi e bali; editi modjɔ mo mbi: polo imina idi tine bato bia i babɔngedjama na Sange e mbi.»<verse eid="MAT 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 20:24" />Ehole eokaka batingami bakina domi bea, balemoaka na bana ba Djebede. <verse eid="MAT 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 20:25" />Yesu ababeaka bo basusu ko abalaka na bu: «Odjebini meako mikanɔe ta bikomi bi ngondo? Bakondji ba bikomi bonɔngedjaka bato ba bobo; bato ba gala bokedjaka basali ba bobo saya. <verse eid="MAT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 20:26" />Endolo eboaniti enɔme bea ta tei e bino: ekadabo ta tei e bino omɔti apalaka adae moto monɛnɛ, atungi adae mosali o bino; <verse eid="MAT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 20:27" />ekadabo omɔti o bino apalaka boda moto o boso, atungi adae mobuli o bino: <verse eid="MAT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 20:28" />Edi okobea Mwana o Moto aiduaka tine bosasalea, endolo aduaka tine bosalea bato ko bopa mohelo mo nde elenge ikabo tine bosikoa bato banɛnɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20, 28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta 26, 28; 1Tim 2, 6.</char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledji bato i bagwa miso babae ta Yeliko</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mlk 10, 46-52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luk 18, 35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 20:29" />Ehole eimaka Yesu ta Yeliko, emumu e bato emokimanaka. <verse eid="MAT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 20:30" />Bato bagwa miso babae badaka ta yɔngɔ e ndjea; baokaka boo Yesu adaka anɔe. Na bea bagamaka: «Kumu, Mwana o Dapiti, okeaso ndjokwa!» <verse eid="MAT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 20:31" />Emumu e bato babagameaka tine boo bakine dhaka, endolo bo bagamaka naikina na ngulu bonɔ: «Kumu, Mwana o Dapiti, okeaso ndjokwa!» <verse eid="MAT 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 20:32" />Yesu aemaka, ababeaka ko abahɔdjɔkɔ: «Apalakano nakɔe na nu nde?» <verse eid="MAT 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 20:33" />Bamosɔmbedjaka: «Kumu, kɔɔ boo loenɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 20:34" />Yesu abokeaka ndjokwa ko apeaka miso ma bobo. Mbala emɔti, baimeaka boenɛ ko bamokimanaka.<verse eid="MAT 20:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="MAT 21" />
  <para style="s1">Bokwea bo Yesu ta Yelusalɛmɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mlk 11, 1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luk 19, 28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yoa 12, 12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 21:1" />Ta ehole ebatamaka bo na Yelusalɛmɛ, baimeaka mbuti na ngando e Betepasa, ta ikoli i olipa, Yesu alomaka boso batingami babae. <verse eid="MAT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 21:2" />Abalaka na bu: «Kɛni ta ngando yena edi boso bo bino.Wataneakeni ena mwana o tito okabeebo ane, atingi ko na nange e nde. Tingoani ko duani na bu adi mbi. <verse eid="MAT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 21:3" />Ekadabo babali na nu modjɔ momɔti, sɔmbedjani: “Kumu adi na posa na yu.” Na mbala emɔti baekinake bokɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 21:4" />Meako mimina mikɔmɔkɔ tine bokokedja mibalo mi mbaeli o Ndjakomba:<verse eid="MAT 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 21:5" />«Balani na moseka o Siona:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:5">Endja, mokondji o wɛ adoi adi wɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:5">alumi na bomwii diko i tito,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:5">tito okabeebo ane<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21, 5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndj 9.9.</char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 21:6" />Batingami bakɛkɛ ko bakɔkɔ oko moda mobalaka Yesu na bu. <verse eid="MAT 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 21:7" />Bamolwɛkɛ mwana o tito okabeebo ane ko na nange e yu, bandaka bisendja diko i yu ko Yesu abakamaka diko i yu. <verse eid="MAT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 21:8" />Ta tei e emumu e bato, bamɔti baandaka bisendja bi bobo na ndjea, bakina babukaka bitape bi mele ko babiandaka ta ndjea.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21, 8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kokanedja ta 2 Bak 9, 13.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 21:9" />Bato ibadalaka boso bo Yesu ko na bia ibamokimanaka, badaka bogama:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:9">«Ekumu adi Mwana o Dapiti!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:9">Kina boo Ndjakomba adjongwoe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:9">Yona odoi na kombe e Kumu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:9">Ekumu adi Ndjakomba yona odi diko i losusu!»<verse eid="MAT 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 21:10" />Ehole ekweaka Yesu ta Yelusalɛmɛ, bato basusu bakamoaka ko baimeaka bohɔdjɔ: «Moto iyo adi nda?» <verse eid="MAT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 21:11" />Emumu e bato basɔmbedjaka: «Edi mbaeli Yesu, moto o Nasaleta e Galilea!»<verse eid="MAT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ta ndako e Ndjakomba</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Mlk 11, 15-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luk 19, 45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yoa 2, 13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 21:12" />Yesu akweaka ta tepelo ko abenganaka bato basusu ibatɛkɛkɛ kaoko ibasombaka leka ta polo emina; adumbakaka mesa i bato bia badaka bosɔmbɔtɔnɔ palanga i mombongu ko bidie bi batɛki ba bimbenga. <verse eid="MAT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 21:13" />Na bea abalaka na bu: «Ekomama: “Ndako e mbi ebeamabi ndako e miongɔnɔ.” Endolo ino oimedjini ndako e baibi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21, 13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Isa 56, 7; Yil 7, 11.</char></note>!» <verse eid="MAT 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 21:14" />Bato bagwa miso ko bato ba mitɛngu babatamaka mbuti na Yesu ta bopango bo tepelo ko abaheledjaka. <verse eid="MAT 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 21:15" />Bakondji ba banganga ba Ndjakomba ko balehi ba mobeko baokaka kɛlɛ, ta ehole enɛkɛbo misala mibokamoa imikɔkɔ yo ko na bana ibagamaka ta tepelo: «Ekumu adi Mwana o Dapiti!» <verse eid="MAT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 21:16" />Na bea babalaka na Yesu: «Wokaka midjɔ mabalakabo?» Yesu abasɔmbedjaka: «Okobea, oipakalangani ikomi di ikomama ta mokanda: “Donga ta minɔkɔ mi bana, edae ibanungeakabo mabɛ, okɔi bea bɛngi okumedjame!”» <verse eid="MAT 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 21:17" />Na bea abakinaka ko aimanaka ta ibonga tine bokɛ ta Betania oho ahwɛkɛ yo.<verse eid="MAT 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu alakedji mole mo pigi</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 11:12-14">Mlk 11, 12-14</ref>.<ref loc="MRK 11:20-24">20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 21:18" />Aya busa, ehole esɔmbɔkɔbo ta ibonga, Yesu aokaka ndja. <verse eid="MAT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 21:19" />Aenɛkɛ mole mo pigi ta yɔngɔ e ndjea ko abatamaka mbuti na yu, endolo ataneaka oto kasa. Na bea abalaka na mole: «Obotetebi naikina mbuma!» Na mbala emɔti, mole mokakanaka. <verse eid="MAT 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 21:20" />Aenɛkɛ batingami bea, balumaka nabokamoa mɛnɛ. Bahɔdjɔkɔ Yesu: «Moda ndani mole mu mokakani na mbala emɔti?» <verse eid="MAT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 21:21" />Yesu abasɔmbedjaka: «Nabalaka na nu, edi soti: okadani na bodima ko omiti daa na kitɛ ta milema mi bino, oboanani bokɔ meako misakɔ mbi ta mole mu mo pigi. Endolo oboanini bobala nongo na ikoli dii: “Donga ya ko sadumba ta duwa”, ko ekɔmɔbi oko bea. <verse eid="MAT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 21:22" />Okadimani, oboanini bodia losusu lohɔdjɔkɔbino ta miongɔnɔ.»<verse eid="MAT 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bokondji bo Yesu bodongi ndjɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mlk 11, 27-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luk 20, 1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 21:23" />Yesu akweaka ta bopango bo tepelo ko abangaka boleha. Bakondji ba banganga ba Ndjakomba ko basuku ba bayuda babatamaka ko bahɔdjɔkɔ Yesu: «Na bokondji bo nda bakɔkɔ na wɛ meako mi? Opi enɔi emina nda?»<verse eid="MAT 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bokondji bo Yesu bodonga djɔ?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 21:24" />Yesu abasɔmbedjaka: «Mbi pongono napalaka nohɔdjɔkɔni ihɔdjɔ imɔti. Ekadabo osɔmbedjinini kɔpi, mbi pongono notɔndeakeni na bokondji ndani bakɔkɔ na mbi meako mi. <verse eid="MAT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 21:25" />Olomaka Yoane aine nda? Edi Ndjakomba kaoko bato?» Endolo baimeaka bosabaleana ko babalaka: «Ekadabo losɔmbedji: “Edi Ndjakomba moto omoloma,” alohɔdjɔke: “Tina ndani oidimeani Yoane?” <verse eid="MAT 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 21:26" />Endolo lokabala: “Edi bato bamoloma,” loboani bobanga bato, tengasa bato basusu balɛnɛkɛ boo Yoane adaka mbaeli o Ndjakomba.» <verse eid="MAT 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 21:27" />Na bea, basɔmbedjaka Yesu: «Lotadjebaka.» Ko Yesu asɔmbedjaka pongono: «Mbi pongono nitotɔndeakeni na bokumu bo ndani bakɔkɔ na mbi meako mi.»<verse eid="MAT 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isɛ i bana bami babae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 21:28" />Yesu abalaka: «Olɛdjinibo na modjɔ mu? Tata omɔti adaka na bana babae bami. Abeaka o boso ko abalaka na nde: “Mwana o mbi, kɛ busa bu bosala ta gbie e vino.” <verse eid="MAT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 21:29" />Mwana omina asɔmbedjaka: “Ngasa, natabɔngɔ bokɛ.” Endolo ngɔngɔ asɔmbɔtɔnɔkɔ malɛi, akɛkɛ ta gbie e vino. <verse eid="MAT 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 21:30" />Tata abalaka oko mondumba momɔti adi mwana okina. Mwana omina o babae amosɔmbedjaka: “Okobea, tata, nakɛke.” Endolo aikɛ. <verse eid="MAT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 21:31" />Ta ndanda e bobo babae okɔ bolulea bo sange e moto nda?» Bamosɔmbedjaka: «Mwana o boso.» Yesu abalaka na bu: «Okobea, nabalaka na nu edi soti: Baputedji baputi ko bali ba ndukeli bakweake ta Bokumu bo diko. <verse eid="MAT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 21:32" />Tengasa Yoane Mobatisi aduaka adino boinedjani ndjea e bodjo endolo ino oimodimeani; enakobea baputedji ba puti na bali ba ndukeli bamodimaka. Nongo aenɛno meako mimina misusu, endolo oisɔmbɔtɔnɔni milema mi bino ko oimodimeani.»<verse eid="MAT 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isɛ i basali babe ba gbie e vino</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mlk 12, 1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luk 20, 9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 21:33" />«Okani isɛ ikina: Edaka na moswa ndako omɔti aonaka gbie e vino, aehikaka na ihiko, akɔkɔ ekamoelo e mbuma i vino e ibanga ta gbie e nde, apikaka egbili oho, aekineaka basali baeputele ko akɛkɛ ta mwɛngɔ. <verse eid="MAT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 21:34" />Ehole e bobuka mbuma eimeaka, alomaka basali ba nde adi basali ibaputelaka gbie e vino e nde, bɛngi adie i nde ibondo. <verse eid="MAT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 21:35" />Endolo basali ba gbie e vino bapeaka basali ba nde, babomaka omɔti, baowaka okina ko baowaka o basato na mabanga. <verse eid="MAT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 21:36" />Na bea moswa gbie alomaka basali bakina, bonɔ motuya mo basali ba mbala e boso. Endolo basali ibaputelaka gbie e vino e nde babanɔngedjaka oko mondumba momɔti. <verse eid="MAT 21:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 21:37" />Suka suka abalomeaka mwana o nde omɔti na ilɛi boo: “Baboani boda na isuma tine mwana o nde!” <verse eid="MAT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 21:38" />Endolo ehole enɛkɛ basali ibaputelaka gbie e vino mwana, basabaleanaka: “Endjani mosangoi! Lokɛni, lomowoe ko loimeake baswa gbie!” <verse eid="MAT 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 21:39" />Na bea bamopeaka, bamodumbaka sokolu e gbie e vino ko bamowaka. <verse eid="MAT 21:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 21:40" />Okani bopele: ehole ehulabi moswa gbie e vino, ekɔbi yo na baputeli bia ba gbie nde?»<verse eid="MAT 21:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 21:41" />Bamosɔmbedjaka: «Aowabi napɛ ndjokwa basali babe bamina ko apabi gbie e vino adi basali bakina, ibamopabi ibondo i mbuma ta ehole eboani.»<verse eid="MAT 21:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 21:42" />Na bea Yesu abalaka na bu: «Oipakalangani eka ekomama?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">“Ibanga idumbaka batongi ba ndako</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">Imei ikwee ipeli ndako.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">Kumu akɔɔ bea,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">Edi modjɔ mo bokamoa tina e biso<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21, 42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndj 118, 22-23.</char></note>!”»<verse eid="MAT 21:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 21:43" />Na tina emina,Yesu abalaka: «Ndjakomba adongedjake Bokumu bo nde adino ko abopabi adi ekomi yena ebotakabi mbuma. [ <verse eid="MAT 21:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 21:44" />Moto yona okwakabi diko i ibanga dii, abukeanakabi; ko moto yona ibanga ikwabi diko i nde, amineanabi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21, 44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Molɔngɔ mu moditi ta makomi mayou. Endja pongono ta Isa 8, 14.</char></note>.]»<verse eid="MAT 21:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 21:45" />Ngɔngɔ iboka masɛ mamina, bakondji ba banganga ba Ndjakomba ko na bapalusai basipoaka boo Yesu abalaka na bu. <verse eid="MAT 21:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 21:46" />Na bea bahombaka ndjea e bopea Yesu, endolo babangaka bato; tengasa bato banɛnɛ badaka badimaka boo Yesu adi mbaeli o Ndjakomba.<verse eid="MAT 21:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="MAT 22" />
  <para style="s1">Isɛ i tɛkɛ e moki</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="LUK 14:15-24">Luk 14, 15-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 22:1" />Yesu abalaka naikina na bu na masɛ. <verse eid="MAT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 22:2" />«Bokumu bo diko boboani na mokondji yona okɔkɔ tɛkɛ e moki tine mwana o nde momi. <verse eid="MAT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 22:3" />Alomaka basali ba nde bobea babeami ba tɛkɛ tine mia ma tɛkɛ, endolo babeami balonaka bodua. <verse eid="MAT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 22:4" />Alomaka basali bakina ko babalaka na bu: “Balani na babeami: Mia ma mbi makaleami edɛdi, ngɔmbɛ bami ba mbi ko na tito ba mita bowami, losusu lobɔngedjami ehele. Duani ta tɛkɛ e moki!” <verse eid="MAT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 22:5" />Endolo babeami ba tɛkɛ baenɛkɛ mbea emina ngasa ko bakɛkɛ moto na moto ta misala mi nde: omɔti akɛkɛ ta gbie e nde, okina ta mombongu mo nde; <verse eid="MAT 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 22:6" />bakina pongono bapeaka basali, babanɔngedjaka ko babowaka. <verse eid="MAT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 22:7" />Mokondji aimeaka na kɛlɛ: alomaka basoda ba nde bowa baoweli bamina ko botumba ibonga i bobo. <verse eid="MAT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 22:8" />Ngɔngɔ abalaka na basali ba nde: “Mia ma tɛkɛ madi mbuti, endolo babeami ba tɛkɛ basabɔngedjiti. <verse eid="MAT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 22:9" />Kɛni ta ndjea i bhuda ko beani ta tɛkɛ e moki bato basusu bataneakeno oho.” <verse eid="MAT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 22:10" />Basali bakɛkɛ ta ndjea ko babongoanedjaka bato basusu bataneakabo, edae bato bapele kaoko bato babe. Na bea, ndako e tɛkɛ elumaka na bato. <verse eid="MAT 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 22:11" />Mokondji akweaka tine boendja bato ibabeamaka ta tɛkɛ ko aenɛkɛ moto omɔti ailwaka kasaka e tɛkɛ. <verse eid="MAT 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 22:12" />Amohɔdjɔkɔ: “Maninga, okwei iya pɛ bolwa kasaka e tɛkɛ tina nda?” Endolo moto omina aimosɔmbedja kɔpi. <verse eid="MAT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 22:13" />Na bea mokondji abalaka na basali: “Monangani mɔmɔ na mako ko modumbani sokolu, ta polo e modidi. Edi oho biyo ko bokpɛkɛnɛ mino.” <verse eid="MAT 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 22:14" />Tengasa babeami badi banɛnɛ, endolo i bahɔmɔ badi bakɛkɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Puti e mokondji</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mlk 12, 13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luk 20, 20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 22:15" />Na bea bapalusai bakɛkɛ ibolea tine bodia meko eboanaka na bu bopikea Yesu elambo na ndjea e ihɔdjɔ imɔti. <verse eid="MAT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 22:16" />Balomaka batingami ba bobo ko na ekenge e bato ba iputo i Elode bobala na Yesu: «Molehi, ladjebaka boo okabale soti: okalehe ndjea i Ndjakomba na bosoti bosusu; oditi na bɔɔ na moda mokalɛdje bato bakina ko toendjake mbanda i bato. <verse eid="MAT 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 22:17" />Lotɔndea malɛno ma wɛ ta tina e modjɔ mu: etungi na su boputa kaoko boda pɛ boputa puti e mokondji Sedjale?» <verse eid="MAT 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 22:18" />Endolo Yesu adjebaka malɛi mabe ma bobo; abalaka na bu: «Ndjɔ ba melo mibae, tina ndani wapikeakanini elambo? <verse eid="MAT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 22:19" />Inedjanini palanga ikapute na bu puti.» Bamoinedjaka ebende e palanga, <verse eid="MAT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 22:20" />ko Yesu abahɔdjɔkɔ: «Epweya ye ko makomi mi madi iya ma nda?» <verse eid="MAT 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 22:21" />Basɔmbedjaka: «Madi ma kumu Sedjale.» Na bea Yesu abalaka na bu: «Pani adi Sedjale, lo Sedjale, ko pani adi Ndjakomba, lo Ndjakomba.» <verse eid="MAT 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 22:22" />Ehole eokaka bo mosɔmbedja mua, balumaka na bokamoa. Bamokinaka ko bakɛkɛ.<verse eid="MAT 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ihɔdjɔ ta modjɔ moendji bopusoa bo bago</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mlk 12, 18-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luk 20, 27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 22:23" />Oko ta isu imina, ekenge e basadokai baduaka adi Yesu, ibobakabale boo bopusoa boditi. <verse eid="MAT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 22:24" />Molehi, endja meako mibalaka Mose: «Ekadabo momi omɔti agwi pɛ bokina mwana, mwange e nde momi adi boasɔ mwali omina tine bosɔmbedja mbota e yona ogwi. <verse eid="MAT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 22:25" />Enakobea, edaka ta tei e biso, edaka na bana bami sambo. O boso aasɔkɔ mwali ko agwaka pɛ bobota bana, akinaka mwali omina na mwange e nde momi. <verse eid="MAT 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 22:26" />Ekɔmɔkɔ oko bea na yona o babae, pongono na yona o basato ko mbunoko yona o sambo. <verse eid="MAT 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 22:27" />Ngɔngɔ i bogwa bo ibo basusu, mwali omina agwaka pongono. <verse eid="MAT 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 22:28" />Ta isu ipusoakabi bago, mwali omina adabi o nda? Tengasa bo basusu bamoasɔkɔ.» <verse eid="MAT 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 22:29" />Yesu abasɔmbedjaka: «Odini ta ibunga, tine boo otasipoakani makomi, nongo sueya e Ndjakomba. <verse eid="MAT 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 22:30" />Na bea, ehole epusoakabi bago, bamina abali basɔnetebi, endolo badabi elenge babwɛndji ta busa. <verse eid="MAT 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 22:31" />Ko ta modjɔ moendji bopusoa bo bago, oipakalangani meako motɔndeakani Ndjakomba? <verse eid="MAT 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 22:32" />“Nadi Ndjakomba o Abalayama, Ndjakomba o Isaka ko Ndjakomba o Djakobo.” Ndjakomba aditi Ndjakomba o bato ba bogo, endolo adi Ndjakomba o bato ba bomɔ.» <verse eid="MAT 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 22:33" />Emumu e bato yena emohokamedjaka, bakamoaka mɛnɛ eleho e nde.<verse eid="MAT 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mobeko i monɔi na bonɛnɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 12:28-34">Mlk 12, 28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luk 10, 25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 22:34" />Ehole eokaka bapalusai boo Yesu asukedji bowɛi bo basadokai, baputoanaka. <verse eid="MAT 22:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 22:35" />Ko omɔti o bobo, molehi o mobeko, ahombaka bopikea Yesu elambo; ko amohɔdjɔkɔ: <verse eid="MAT 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 22:36" />«Molehi, mobeko monɔi na bonɛnɛ ta mibeko misusu nda?»<verse eid="MAT 22:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 22:37" />Yesu amosɔmbedjaka: «“Otungi bopala Kumu Ndjakomba o wɛ, na molema mo wɛ mosusu, na dongi i wɛ isusu ko na bowɛi bo wɛ bosusu.” <verse eid="MAT 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 22:38" />Yena edi mobeko mo boso monɔi na bonɛnɛ. <verse eid="MAT 22:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 22:39" />Endja mobeko mo babae modi elenge mo boso: “Otungi bopala mwange e wɛ elenge akasapale wɛ mɛnɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22, 39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lew 19, 18.</char></note>.” <verse eid="MAT 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 22:40" />Mobeko mosusu mo Mose ko eleho esusu e ba mbaeli ba Ndjakomba midi ta mibeko imi mibae.»<verse eid="MAT 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kilito ko Dapiti</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mlk 12, 35-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luk 20, 41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 22:41" />Yana aputoanaka bapalusai, Yesu abahɔdjɔkɔ ihɔdjɔ di: <verse eid="MAT 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 22:42" />«Alɛdjɛkɛno ta tina e Kilito nde? Adi motitani o nda?» Bamosɔmbedjaka: «Adi motitani o Dapiti.» <verse eid="MAT 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 22:43" />Yesu abasɔmbedjaka: «Moda ndani Dapiti, na bolindedjama bo Mwembo mo Ndjakomba, amobeaka “Kumu,” ehole ebalaka yo:<verse eid="MAT 22:43" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 22:44" />“Kumu abalaka na Kumu o mbi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 22:44">Daa ta ebɔ e mbi e bami,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 22:44">Mbunoko naise baloni ba wɛ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 22:44">Ta na se i bigbota bi wɛ?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22, 44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndj 110, 1.</char></note>”<verse eid="MAT 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 22:45" />Ekadabo Dapiti amobeaka “Kumu”, moda ndani Kumu aboani boda naikina mwana o nde?» <verse eid="MAT 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 22:46" />Pɛ moto oboanaka bomosɔmbedja kɔpi emɔti. Donga busa bua, pɛ moto omohɔdjɔkɔ naikina ihɔdjɔ.<verse eid="MAT 22:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="MAT 23" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu akebedji balehi ba mobeko ko na bapalusai</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 12:38-39">Mlk 12, 38-39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:43-46">Luk 11, 43-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-46">20, 45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 23:1" />Na bea Yesu abalaka na emumu e bato ko na batingami ba nde: <verse eid="MAT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 23:2" />«Bidie bi boleha mobeko mo Mose bipama na balehi ba mobeko ko na bapalusai. <verse eid="MAT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 23:3" />Otungini bosuma misusu mikolehenibo ko mida mi bino mikuane na bileho bikolehenibo. Endolo pɛ bokwanani mida mi bobo, tengasa ibo tebakokedjake meako mikolehebo. <verse eid="MAT 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 23:4" />Bakabɔngedje migumba mi mandi mɛnɛ tine bolwadjaka bato bakina. Endolo bo bɛnɛ tebabɛndjɛke nongo mandi mamina na mosapi mo bobo tine bosunga bato bamina. <verse eid="MAT 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 23:5" />Misala mikakɔebo misusu, bomikɔkɔ bɛngi bato babaenɛ. Na bea, baabigbɔkɔsɔ bi makomi bidakabo bolwa ta ehole e miongɔnɔ bidaka binɛnɛnɛ bonɔ bato basusu ko milenda mi matoka ma bisendja bi bobo bidaka biyai bonɔ bato basusu. <verse eid="MAT 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 23:6" />Bakapale boda ta polo i gala ta tɛkɛ ko ta polo i boso ta tei i sinagoga; <verse eid="MAT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 23:7" />bakapale bato babapake ndese ta polo i bhuda ko bababeake “Molehi.” <verse eid="MAT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 23:8" />Endolo ino, pɛ bopalakani bato bobeakeni “molehi,” tengasa odini no basusu bange i bato ko odini oko na Molehi omɔti. <verse eid="MAT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 23:9" />Pɛ bobeani moto omɔti “tata” ta ngondo, tengasa odini oko na tata o bino omɔti, yona odi o diko. <verse eid="MAT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 23:10" />Pɛ bopalani bato bobeeni “mokondji,” tengasa odini oko na mokondji o bino omɔti, Kilito. <verse eid="MAT 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 23:11" />Moto yona onɔi bonɛnɛ ta tei e bino aboani boda mosali o bino. <verse eid="MAT 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 23:12" />Moto okasangɔkɔbi, bamotitedjabi, endolo moto yona okasatitedjakabi, bamoangɔdjɔbi.»<verse eid="MAT 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu abali tine pokotoi e balehi ba mobeko ko na bapalusai</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 12:40">Mlk 12, 40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:39-52">Luk 11, 39-52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">20, 45-47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 23:13" />Yesu abalaka naikina: «Ndjokwa tina e bino balehi ba mobeko ko na bapalusai, ndjɔ ba melo mibae! Okadipeni bato ndjea e Bokumu bo diko tine basakakwea; ino bɛnɛ oikweani ko oipani ndjea adi bato badi ibapalaka bokwea.<verse eid="MAT 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 23:14" />Ndjokwa e bino, balehi ba mobeko ko na bapalusai, ndjɔ ba melo mibae! Okaibeni leka lo bali bagwa na bami ko okakɔeni miongɔnɔ miyai miyai tine bokosa bato. Ta tina emina, odiabini etumbo enɔi na bopipo!<verse eid="MAT 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 23:15" />Ndjokwa e bino, balehi ba mobeko ko na bapalusai, ndjɔ ba melo mibae! Okadaleni pamba na pamba i ngondo ko ta duwa inɛnɛnɛ, tine boduedja mokɛndɛli oko omɔti ta edimeli e bobo ko akakwea, okamoimedjeni moto o ipelu mbala ibae bonɔ no bɛnɛ.<verse eid="MAT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 23:16" />Ndjokwa e bino, badaledji ba bato i bagwa miso! Okabaleni: “Ekadabo moto abhɛli bhɛli na kombe e tepelo, yena editi modjɔ; endolo ekadabo abhɛli bhɛli na kombe e wolo e tepelo, ena atungi bokokedja bhɛli e nde.” <verse eid="MAT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 23:17" />Bigegele, bato bagwa miso! Eka mɛnɛ enɔi na motuya nde: palanga kaoko tepelo yena ekimedje wolo esɛnodjamake? <verse eid="MAT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 23:18" />Okabaleni pongono: “Ekadabo moto abhɛli bhɛli na kombe e polo ekatumbebo mbeka, yena editi modjɔ; endolo ekadabo abhɛli bhɛli na ndjea e ikabo dia idi diko i polo ekatumbe bo mbeka, atungi bokokedje bhɛli e nde.” <verse eid="MAT 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 23:19" />Bato bagwa miso! Eka mɛnɛ enɔi na motuya nde: ikabo kaoko polo ekatumbebo mbeka ekaimedje ikabo isɛnodjamake? <verse eid="MAT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 23:20" />Endolo moto obhɛli bhɛli na kombe e polo ekatumbebo mbeka, akabhɛlɛ ambuku na kombe e polo ekatumbebo mbeka ko na leka losusu lobaki diko i yu. <verse eid="MAT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 23:21" />Moto yona obhɛli bhɛli na kombe e tepelo, abhɛli ambuku na kombe e tepelo ko na kombe Ndjakomba yona okadae ta tei eyu. <verse eid="MAT 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 23:22" />Moto yona obhɛli bhɛli na kombe e busa, abhɛli ambuku na kombe e ngbɛndɛ e Ndjakomba ko yona okaedae<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23, 22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Isa 66, 1; Mat 5, 34.</char></note>.<verse eid="MAT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 23:23" />Ndjokwa e bino, balehi ba Mobeko ko bapalusai, ndjɔ ba melo mibae! Okadimeni boputa ekenge emɔti na domi e matungulu, e bamusikadi ko e leka lokɛkɛkɛ lo so e itindi, endolo okaenɛni ngasa midjɔ i minɔi na motuya ta tei e mobeko elenge: bodjo, molema mo ndjokwa, bosɛnɔ. Edi eka eboani na nu bokɔ, napɛ bobedja lua lodiki. <verse eid="MAT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 23:24" />Ino badaledji ba miso mago! Okakɔngeni ingenangena idi ta mana ma bino, endolo okameeni kamela mosusu!<verse eid="MAT 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 23:25" />Ndjokwa e bino, balehi ba mobeko ko bapalusai, ndjɔ ba melo mibae! Okasɛnodjeni bopele sokolu i kɔbɔ ko saani, endolo otei i yu ilumi na leka loiba ko na ekpaka. <verse eid="MAT 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 23:26" />Mopalusai miso mago! Banga boso bosɛnodja otei e kɔbɔ ko na saani, na bea sokolu enɛmɛke pongono esɛnɔke.<verse eid="MAT 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 23:27" />Ndjokwa e bino balehi ba mobeko ko bapalusai, ndjɔ ba melo mibae! Odini elenge makila masuowabo pɛmbɛ epu makenɛme bopele sokolu, endolo otei i yu iluma na kuwa i bato bago ko na moda mosusu mo djɛti. <verse eid="MAT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 23:28" />Ino pongono, sokolu wenɛmɛkɛ bodjo ta miso ma bato, endolo otei e bino odini ndjɔ ba melo mibae ko olumini na bobe.<verse eid="MAT 23:28" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 23:29" />Ndjokwa e bino, balehi ba mobeko ko bapalusai, ndjɔ ba melo mibae! Okatongeni makila tine ba mbaeli ba Ndjakomba ko okalɛmoleni makila ma bato ba bodjo, <verse eid="MAT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 23:30" />ko okabaleni: “Esedabo iso lodaka ta ehole e bakɔkɔ ba biso, loikɔkɔ putoana na bu, tine bosopa makia ma ba mbaeli ba Ndjakomba.” <verse eid="MAT 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 23:31" />Na bea, okapɛni tati ino bɛnɛ boo odini batitani ba bato bia bowaka ba mbaeli ba Ndjakomba. <verse eid="MAT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 23:32" />Kɔɔni ko sidjani mosala mua mobangaka ba kɔkɔ ba bino bokɔ! <verse eid="MAT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 23:33" />Ibota i ndjɔ! Walɛdjɛkɛni boo na ndjea yena oboanini botia etumbo e mosa mo ipelu? <verse eid="MAT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 23:34" />Na tina emina, mbi nabalaka na nu: nolomeakeni ba mbaeli ba Ndjakomba, bato ba badjebi ko na balehi ba mobeko. Owakabini ko obakakabini bamɔti ta ekulusu, obomakabini bakina na mbalake ta basinagoga i bino ko obakimanakabini ta ibonga na ibonga. <verse eid="MAT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 23:35" />Na bea, bitumbo bisusu bikwakabi ta diko i bino tine makia ma bato ba bodjo mia masopano ta kpɔtɔ: bodonga makia ma Abɛlɛ, moto o bodjo, mbunoko makia ma Djakalia, mwana o Balaki, yona owano ta pakaso e polo esɛnɔke ko polo ekatumbebo mbeka. <verse eid="MAT 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 23:36" />Okobea, nabalaka na nu edi soti: misusu mikwakabi diko i bato ba busa bu!»<verse eid="MAT 23:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ayei tine Yelusalɛmɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="LUK 13:34-35">Luk 13, 34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 23:37" />«Yelusalɛmɛ, Yelusalɛmɛ, wɛ yona okowoe ba mbaeli ba Ndjakomba ko okabowoe na mabanga bato ibolomeaka Ndjakomba! Mbala djeka ipalaka mbi boputoanedja bana ba wɛ, moda mokabongoanedje bana ba kɔkɔ ta na se i mangbangu ma yu, endolo oipalakani! <verse eid="MAT 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 23:38" />Na bea, ndako i bino idikabi mipɔtu mɛnɛ. <verse eid="MAT 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 23:39" />Tengasa, nabalaka na nu: donga edɛdi otenɛkenini naikina mbunoko obalebini: “Adjongoame yona odoi na kombe e Kumu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23, 39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndj 118, 26.</char></note>!”»<verse eid="MAT 23:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="MAT 24" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu atɔndi bobedjama bo tepelo</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Mlk 13, 1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luk 21, 5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 24:1" />Yana aimaka Yesu ta bopango bo petelo, batingami ba nde baduaka mbuti na nde tine bomoinedja moda ndani motongabo tepelo. <verse eid="MAT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 24:2" />Endolo Yesu abalaka na bu: «Oenini tepelo ye? Nabalaka na nu edi soti: pɛ ibanga imɔti idikabi diko i ibanga ikina, masusu mabukeanabi.»<verse eid="MAT 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bimbete binedjaka suka e ngondo</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Mlk 13, 3-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luk 21, 7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 24:3" />Yana adaka Yesu adi ta makoli ma olipa, batingami babatamaka mbuti ba nde basasuaka mootɔtɔkɔ ko bamohɔdjɔkɔ: «Lotɔndea ehole ndani ekɔmɔke midjɔ mimina ko embete ndani einedjaka boo bodua bo wɛ ko na suka e ngondo.» <verse eid="MAT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 24:4" />Yesu abasɔmbedjaka: «Daani engelɛ boo moto adae pɛ bokoseani. <verse eid="MAT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 24:5" />Tengasa bato banɛnɛ baduake na kombe e mbi ko babalakabi: “Edi mbi Kilito!” Ko bapangoakabi bato banɛnɛ. <verse eid="MAT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 24:6" />Okakeni ngilimo ko gala e bitumba mbuti kaoko bohali; pɛ bobangani: etungi na midjɔ mimina boimea, endolo edaetebi nongo suka e ngondo. <verse eid="MAT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 24:7" />Ekomi emɔti eanedjakabi ekomi ekina, bokumu bomɔti boanedjakabi bokumu bokina; edabi na ndja ipipo ko na bokumana bo kpɔtɔ ta ngondo dɔngɔ na dɔngɔ. <verse eid="MAT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 24:8" />Midjɔ mimina misusu midabi elenge mbangi e epeko e mwali yona abotaka. <verse eid="MAT 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 24:9" />Na bea, bokedjakabini saya ko bowakabini. Bato ba bikomi bisusu bolonakabini tine mbi. <verse eid="MAT 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 24:10" />Ta ehole emina, bato banɛnɛ badumbakabi edimeli; basakababi ko basalonakabi. <verse eid="MAT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 24:11" />Ba mbaeli ba boloa bapangoakabi bato banɛnɛ. <verse eid="MAT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 24:12" />Elenge bobe bohɛkɛbi mɛnɛ, epaeli e bato banɛnɛ etitakabi. <verse eid="MAT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 24:13" />Endolo moto yona osagbindeakabi mbunoko suka ahelakabi. <verse eid="MAT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 24:14" />Bwɛndi Bopele bu bo Bokumu bo Ndjakomba botɔndɔmɔkɔbi ta bikomi bisusu bi ngondo, tine boo edae tati ta tine bikomi bisusu. Ko na bea suka eduake.»<verse eid="MAT 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Enɔngi enɛnɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 13:14-23">Mlk 13, 14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luk 21, 20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 24:15" />«Na tina emina, wenɛkeni yona okabeebo “mobedji onɔi na bobe,” yona Danyɛlɛ, mbaeli o Ndjakomba, otɔndɔkɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24, 15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dan 9, 27; 11, 31; 12, 11.</char></note>; boemeama ta polo esɛnɔke. Kinabo molangi asipoe midjɔ mimina! <verse eid="MAT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 24:16" />Na bea, bia badakabi ta Yuda batie ta dɔngɔ i makoli, <verse eid="MAT 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 24:17" />yona odakabi ta mbalasani e diko i ndako e nde adae pɛ botita, tine botomba leka lo nde ta tei e ndako; <verse eid="MAT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 24:18" />ko yona odakabi ta gbie atasɔmbɔ tine botomba esendja e nde. <verse eid="MAT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 24:19" />Ndjokwa edakabi ta masu mia, tina e bali bamemi ko bia badakabi bonungea bana! <verse eid="MAT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 24:20" />Ongɔnɔni Ndjakomba tine boo meako mimina midae pɛ bokɔmɔ ta ehole e piyɔ kaoko ta isu i sabata! <verse eid="MAT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 24:21" />Tengasa ta ehole emina, enɔngi edakabi epipo, na bea enɔngi emina eipakaenɛmɛ donga ta mbangi e ngondo mbunoko edɛdi: eenɛmetebi naikina. <verse eid="MAT 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 24:22" />Esedabo Ndjakomba aikuedja ehole emina, pɛ moto okɔkɔ helama. Endolo aekuedjaka ta tina e bato i bahɔ yo. <verse eid="MAT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 24:23" />Ekada moto abali na nu boo: “Endjani Kilito adi iya!” Kaoko: “Adi bo,” pɛ bomodimeani. <verse eid="MAT 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 24:24" />Tengasa bakilito ba boloa ko ba mbaeli ba boloa baenɛmɛkɛbi. Bakɔkɔbi bingengo bi ngindola binɛnɛ tine bopangoa, nongo bato i bahɔmɔkɔ na Ndjakomba. <verse eid="MAT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 24:25" />Hokamedjani! Nabalaka na nu donga ehele.<verse eid="MAT 24:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 24:26" />«Ekada babali na nu: “Endjani, adi ta etengelenge!” Pɛ bokɛni. Kaoko bakabala na nu: “Endjani, abolami iya!” Pɛ bomodimeani. <verse eid="MAT 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 24:27" />Tengasa oko moda mokangɛsɛ mokaikai ta pamba e satina na sadiko, edi oko moda moduabi Mwana o Moto. <verse eid="MAT 24:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 24:28" />Polo esusu esambi ebembe, bingbondo ikaputoane ena.»<verse eid="MAT 24:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bodua bo Mwana o Moto</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mlk 13, 24-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luk 21, 25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 24:29" />«Oko ngɔngɔ i ehole emina e enɔngi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 24:29">Modakabusa mohindakabi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 24:29">Songe apɛtebi bongɛsɛ bo yu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 24:29">Ndjɔtɔ bakwakabi donga ta busa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 24:29">Ko ngulu i diko ikumanakabi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24, 29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Isa 13, 10; 34, 4; Edj 32.7; Yoe 2, 10; 3, 4.</char></note>.<verse eid="MAT 24:29" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 24:30" />Na bea embete e Mwana o Moto eenɛmɛbi ta busa. Bato basusu ba bikomi bi ngondo basayeanabi, baenɛbi Mwana o Moto boimea ta matute ma busa na sueya esusu ko na ekumu enɛnɛ. <verse eid="MAT 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 24:31" />Na ngilimo enɛnɛ e panda, alomakabi babwɛndji ba nde ba busa boputoanedja bahɔmi ba nde donga ta makono masusu manɛi ma ngondo, donga ta suka emɔti mbunoko ta suka ekina.»<verse eid="MAT 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isɛ i mole mo pigi</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Mlk 13, 28-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luk 21, 29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 24:32" />«Kinani olehameni na isɛ i mole mo pigi: yana abangi mosua bodala ta tape ko kasa ibangi botɔ, okadjebeni boo yanga e moi mopipo eimei mbuti. <verse eid="MAT 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 24:33" />Oko moda momɔti na nu, ehole eenɛbino bea, djebani boo Mwana o Moto aimei mbuti, aimei ta bikukɛ bi bino. <verse eid="MAT 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 24:34" />Edi soti, nabalaka na nu: bato ba ehole ye badimoetebi boso bo baenɛ midjɔ mi boimea. <verse eid="MAT 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 24:35" />Busa na kpɔtɔ bonɔbi, endolo mobalo mo mbi monɔetebi.»<verse eid="MAT 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pɛ moto adjebaka isu kaoko ehole</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 13:32-37">Mlk 13, 32-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:26-30">Luk 17, 26-30-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 24:36" />«Ta modjɔ moindji isu kaoko ehole, pɛ moto omɔti odjebaka, edae babwɛndji ba busa kaoko Mwana o Moto; endolo oko Sesa yo mɛnɛ. <verse eid="MAT 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 24:37" />Moda mokɔmɔkɔ ta masu ma Nowa, ekɔmɔbi oko moda momɔti ta bodua bo Mwana o Moto. <verse eid="MAT 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 24:38" />Tengasa, ta ehole emina, boso boo pela enɛnɛ edue, bato badaka boya, bomwa, boasɔnɔ kaoko boasɔedja bana ba bobo, mbunoko ta busa bokweaka Nowa ta masua. <verse eid="MAT 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 24:39" />Baidjebaka nongo eka emɔti yena ekɔkɔ kɔmɔ, mbunoko pela eduaka ko ebowaka bo basusu. Edabi pongono bea ehole eduabi Mwana o Moto. <verse eid="MAT 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 24:40" />Na bea, bami babae badabi ta gbie: omɔti atombamabi ko okina adikabi. <verse eid="MAT 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 24:41" />Bali babae basianakabi mbuma ta igbata: omɔti atombamabi ko okina adikabi. <verse eid="MAT 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 24:42" />Pɛ bohwɛɛni, tengasa otadjebakeni isu iduabi Kumu o bino. <verse eid="MAT 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 24:43" />Sipoani bopele modjɔ mu: esedabo moswa ndako adjebe ehole eboanaka moibi bodua na bulu, akɔkɔ dikama mɔsu ko aikɔkɔ kwea ta ndako e nde. <verse eid="MAT 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 24:44" />Na tina emina, ino pongono daani mbuti, tengasa Mwana o Moto aduake ta ehole edakabino pɛ bolɛdjɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isɛ i mosali mopele ko mosali mobe</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="LUK 12:41-48">Luk 12, 41-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 24:45" />«Odi mɛnɛ mosali o bodjo ko o bowɛi nda? Mosala yona kumu o nde amopaka botomba basali ta tei e ndako e nde, tine boo abayedjake mia ta ehole eboani? <verse eid="MAT 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 24:46" />Sepi adi mosali yona, ekadabo kumu o nde ahuli, amotaneake asala mosala! <verse eid="MAT 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 24:47" />Edi soti nabalaka na nu: kumu o nde amopabi mosala mo bobanea bodieli bo nde bosusu. <verse eid="MAT 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 24:48" />Endolo akalɛdjɛ boo adi mosali mobe, asabaleabi: “mokondji o mbi ayeyoi ta bohula,” <verse eid="MAT 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 24:49" />na bea abangabi boboma binande ba mosala, boyaka ko bomwaka engbanga na balangoi ba mana. <verse eid="MAT 24:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 24:50" />Kumu o nde ahulabi isu imɔti idabi mosali pɛ boamba ko na ehole edabiyo pɛ bodjeba; <verse eid="MAT 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 24:51" />amobenganabi ko amopabi iputi ta polo emɔti na bato bapokotoi, ta polo yena edabi biyo ko bokpɛkɛnɛ mino.»<verse eid="MAT 24:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="MAT 25" />
  <para style="s1">Isɛ i baseka bali domi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 25:1" />«Na bea Bokumu bo diko bodabi elenge baseka bali domi bia batombaka milinda ko boimana tine bokɛ ta bosakana na momi o moki. <verse eid="MAT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 25:2" />Batano ta tei e bobo badaka pɛ bosaboanedja ko batano bakina badaka ba bowɛi. <verse eid="MAT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 25:3" />Bia ibadaka pɛ bosaboanedja batombaka milinda mi bobo endolo bailɛdjɛ botomba moomunɛ. <verse eid="MAT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 25:4" />Endolo bia ibadaka na bowɛi batombaka milinda mi bobo ko na milangi mi minɛ tine milinda mi bobo. <verse eid="MAT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 25:5" />Elenge momi o moki ayeyoakayo, baseka bamina basusu miso ma bobo maimeaka mandi na hiyɔ ko bahwɛkɛ. <verse eid="MAT 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 25:6" />Ta ndanda e bulu, kilingo eokamaka: “Endjani momi o moki! Imani tine bosakana na nde!” <verse eid="MAT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 25:7" />Na bea baseka bali basusu basisoaka ko babɔngedjeka milinda mi bobo. <verse eid="MAT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 25:8" />Baseka batano ibadaka pɛ bosaboanedja bahɔdjɔkɔ bia ba bowɛi: “Lopani moomunɛ o bino, tengasa milinda mi biso midoi adimei!” <verse eid="MAT 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 25:9" />Baseka bali ba bowɛi basɔmbedjaka: “Ngasa, motakoka tine biso ko na nu. Enɔi na bopele okeni ta djando bosomba tine bino.” <verse eid="MAT 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 25:10" />Yana adaka bo bakɛ bosomba munɛ, endolo oko ta ehole emina, momi aimeka. Baseka bali batano ba bowɛi bakweaka na momi o moki ta ndako e tɛkɛ ebɔngedjabo tine moki ko badipaka ekukɛ na pongola. <verse eid="MAT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 25:11" />Ngɔngɔ i moehole, baseka bali ibadaka pɛ bosaboanedja bahulaka ko babalaka: “Kumu, kumu, lodipoa!” <verse eid="MAT 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 25:12" />Endolo momi o moki abasɔmbedjaka: “Edi soti, nabalaka na nu: natodjebakani.” <verse eid="MAT 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 25:13" />Yesu abakeaka, pɛ bohwɛni, tengasa otadjebakani isu, kaoko ehole.»<verse eid="MAT 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isɛ i basali basato</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="LUK 19:11-27">Luk 19, 11-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 25:14" />«Bokondji bo diko bodabi pongono elenge momi omɔti yona, opalaka bokɛ ta mwɛngɔ: abeaka basali ba nde ko abapaka misala mi bobanea bodieli bo nde. <verse eid="MAT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 25:15" />Apaka adi omɔti taleta mikama mitano, adi okina mikama mibae, adi obasato mokama: bokokana na ngulu e moto na moto. Ngɔngɔ akɛkɛ. <verse eid="MAT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 25:16" />Mosali yona odiaka taleta mikama mitano akɛkɛ mbala emɔti bokɔ mombongu na bodieli bomina ko abakeaka mbuka e mikama mitano mi taleta mikina. <verse eid="MAT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 25:17" />Mosali yona odiaka taleta mikama mibae akɔkɔ oko moda momɔti ko abakeaka mikama mibae mi taleta mikina. <verse eid="MAT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 25:18" />Endolo yona odiaka taleta mokama akɛkɛ bolongea mombɔndɔ ta kpɔtɔ ko abombaka taleta e kumu o nde.<verse eid="MAT 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 25:19" />«Ngɔngɔ i masu mayai, kumu o basali ahulaka ko bamopɛ gala e bodieli bo nde. <verse eid="MAT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 25:20" />Mosali yona odiaka taleta mikama mitano abatamaka ko aimedjaka mikama mitano mi taleta imibolodjakayo ko abalaka: “Kumu, opakani taleta mikama mitano, endja nabakei naikina mikama mitano mi mbuka: djodji.” <verse eid="MAT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 25:21" />Kumu o nde abalaka: “Bopele, odi mosali mopele ko o bodjo. Elenge adi wɛ mosali o bodjo ta leka lokɛkɛ, nopake lokina lonɔi na bonɛnɛ. Dua asepe na mbi.” <verse eid="MAT 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 25:22" />Mosali yona odiaka taleta mikama mibae abatamaka ko abalaka: “Kumu, opakani taleta mikama mibae. Endja nabakei, naikina mikama mibae mi mbuka: djodji.” <verse eid="MAT 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 25:23" />Kumu o nde abalaka na nde: “Bopele! Mosali mopele ko o bodjo. Elenge adaki wɛ bodjo ta leka lokɛkɛ, nopakedea mosala mo bobanea leka lonɛnɛ. Dua asepe na mbi.” <verse eid="MAT 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 25:24" />Ta suka, mosali yona odiaka taleta mokama abatamaka ko abalaka: “Kumu, noodjebaka elenge moto o bobila: okabuke ta polo edaa wɛ pɛ boona, okandoe ta polo edaa wɛ pɛ bomɛsɛ kona. <verse eid="MAT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 25:25" />Nadaka na bɔɔ ko nakɛkɛ bombomba taleta e wɛ ta kpɔtɔ. Endja yo iye, tomba taleta e wɛ!” <verse eid="MAT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 25:26" />Kumu o nde abalaka na nde: “Mosali mobe, emɛli! Odjebaka boo nakabuke ta polo edaa mbi pɛ bona, nakandoe ta polo edaa mbi pɛ bomɛsɛ kona; <verse eid="MAT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 25:27" />na bea tina ndani okɛiti boisa palanga e mbi adi bato bakabombe palanga ko ta ihule i mbi, nakɔki tomba palanga imina na mbuka. <verse eid="MAT 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 25:28" />Mokatoani taleta emina ko epani adi yona odi na koto. <verse eid="MAT 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 25:29" />Tengasa moto odi na eka bamobakeabi na bonɔ ko aimeakabi na leka lonɛnɛ; endolo adi yona odi pɛ eka, bamokatoabi nongo yena edi na nde. <verse eid="MAT 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 25:30" />Ta tina e mosali mobe yo, modumbani sokolu, ta modidi, oho ta polo e biyo ko bokpɛkɛnɛ mino.”»<verse eid="MAT 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Esambi e suka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 25:31" />«Ehole eduabi Mwana o Moto ta ekumu e nde engbanga na babwɛndji ba basusu, adabi ta ngbɛndɛ e nde e ekumu. <verse eid="MAT 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 25:32" />Bato ba bikomi bi ngondo baputoanabi ta boso bo nde ko abakabanabi na bikenge bibae moda mokakabane mobanei bhata na kambeli. <verse eid="MAT 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 25:33" />Aemeabi bhata ta ebɔ e nde e bami ko kambeli ta ebɔ e nde e bali. <verse eid="MAT 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 25:34" />Na bea mokondji abalabi na bato ibadabi ta ebɔ e nde e bami: “Duani, ino bato badjongoama na Sange e mbi, asɔni bodieli bo bino bua bodi Bokumu bobɔngedjama na Ndjakomba tina e bino, donga ta mbangi e ngondo. <verse eid="MAT 25:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 25:35" />Tengasa nokaka ndja ko opakanini boyaka; nokaka posa e madiba ko opakanini madiba; nadaka mokɛndɛli ko oasɔkɔnini adi no; <verse eid="MAT 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 25:36" />nadaka mbundu ko olwadjakanini bisendja; nadaka nepeko ko osaowakanini; nadaka ta ndjango ko oduakani ta boendjani.” <verse eid="MAT 25:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 25:37" />Na bea bato ba bodjo ibakɔkɔ bopala bo Ndjakomba basɔmbedjaka: “Kumu, ehole ndani loenɛkɛ na ndja ko lopaka miya kaoko na posa e bomwaka madiba ko lopaka madiba? <verse eid="MAT 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 25:38" />Ehole ndani loenɛkɛ mokɛndɛli ko loasɔkɔ adi so kaoko odaka mbundu ko lolwadjaka bisendja? <verse eid="MAT 25:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 25:39" />Ehole ndani loenɛkɛ bopeka kaoko ta ndjango ko loduaka ta bokɔmedja?” <verse eid="MAT 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 25:40" />Ko mokondji abasɔmbedjaka: “Edi soti nabalaka na nu: mbala isusu djikɔkɔno na omɔti yona onɔi na bokɛkɛ ta tei e denga i mbi, ibia badi bato ngasa, djebani bopele boo okɔkɔni bea tina e mbi.”<verse eid="MAT 25:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 25:41" />«Ngɔngɔ Kumu abalaka na bia ibadaka ta ebɔ e nde e bali: “Kɛni bohali na mbi, ino bato i balakedjama! Kɛni ta ipombe i mosa mo seko mokadae pɛ bodimea, imua mobɔngedjama tina e djabulu ko na babwɛndji ba nde! <verse eid="MAT 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 25:42" />Tengasa nadaka ndja ko oipanini boyaka; nadaka na posa e bomwaka madiba ko oipanini madiba; <verse eid="MAT 25:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 25:43" />nadaka mokɛndɛli ko oiasɔnini; nadaka mbundu ko oilwadjanini bisendja; nadaka na epeko ko ta ndjango, endolo oiduani ta bokɔmedjani.” <verse eid="MAT 25:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 25:44" />Na bea basɔmbedjaka: “Kumu, ehole ndani loenɛkɛ ndja, kaoko na posa e bomwaka madiba kaoko mokɛndɛli kaoko mbundu kaoko na epeko kaoko ta ndjango, bea loiokɔmedjaka?” <verse eid="MAT 25:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 25:45" />Kumu asɔmbedjaka: “Edi soti, nabalaka nu: mbala isusu idaka no pɛ bokɔ adi bia banɔi na bokɛkɛ, djebani bopele boo otakakani bokɔ bea adi mbi” <verse eid="MAT 25:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 25:46" />Ko bakɛbi aenɛ saya e seko, enakobea bato ba bodjo bakɛbi ta mohelo mo seko<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25, 46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Dan 12, 2.</char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 25:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="MAT 26" />
  <para style="s1">Inginda ta tina e Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mlk 14, 1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luk 22, 1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yoa 11, 45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 26:1" />Ehole esidjaka Yesu bopa simbisi imina isusu, abalaka na batingami ba nde: <verse eid="MAT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 26:2" />«Djebani boo tɛkɛ e pasika ediki masu mabae bɛngi e bange: Mwana o Moto akabamake ta mɔmɔ ma bato babe bɛngi abakame ta ekulusu.»<verse eid="MAT 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 26:3" />Na bea, bakondji ba banganga ba Ndjakomba ko basuku ba denga baputoanaka ta ndako e Kaipa, mokondji monɛnɛ o banganga ba Ndjakomba. <verse eid="MAT 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 26:4" />Batombaka meko bo basusu tine bopea Yesu bɛngi bamowoe ta mbombi. <verse eid="MAT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 26:5" />Babalaka: «Lodae pɛ bomopea ta ehole ye tɛkɛ, esakada boo bato balemoe.»<verse eid="MAT 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwali omɔti ta Betania asopei Yesu malasi</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Mlk 14, 3-9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yoa 12, 1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 26:6" />Yana adaka Yesu ta Betania, ta ndako e Simo moto o mabha, <verse eid="MAT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 26:7" />mwali omɔti abatamaka mbuti Yesu, apeli molangi mo abatele molumake na malasi ma motuya monɛnɛ. Ehole edaka Yesu ta mesa, mwali omina asopeaka Yesu malasi ta molo. <verse eid="MAT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 26:8" />Ehole enɛkɛ batingami bea, baokaka kɛlɛ ko babalaka: «Tine bobedja malasi boo nda? <verse eid="MAT 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 26:9" />Eboanaki botɛkɛ malasi ma mina na motuya monɛnɛ ko bopa palanga adi batakeli!»<verse eid="MAT 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 26:10" />Ehole enɛkɛ Yesu bea, abalaka na bu: «Tina atungeaka na nu mwali yo nda? Akɔmeini modjɔ mopele. <verse eid="MAT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 26:11" />Tengasa odakabini na batakeli bihole bisusu; Endolo mbi, odaetebini na mbi bihole bisusu. <verse eid="MAT 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 26:12" />Yana asopi yo malasi ta mokuku mo mbi, akɔi bea tine bobɔngedja bosambeama bo mokuku mo mbi ta ikila. <verse eid="MAT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 26:13" />Okobea nabali na nu, edi soti: polo isusu ilehakabibo Bwɛndi Bopele bu ta ngondo isusu, batɔndɔkɔbi gala esakɔ mwali yo tine bomolɛdjɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yudasi akabi Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Mlk 14, 10-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 2:3-6">Luk 2, 3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 26:14" />Na bea omɔti ta tei e batingami domi na babae, obeakabo Yudasi Isikaliota, akɛkɛ botanea bakondji ba banganga ba Ndjakomba <verse eid="MAT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 26:15" />ko abalaka na bu: «Epalakano bopani nde bɛngi notɛkeeni Yesu?» Bamopaka palanga i bibende tuku isato. <verse eid="MAT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 26:16" />Donga ta ehole yena, Yudasi aimeaka bohomba enɔli epele tine bokaba Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu alomi babɔngedje miya ma pasika</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Mlk 14, 12-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-14">Luk 22, 7-14-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yoa 13, 21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 26:17" />Ta isu i boso bo tɛkɛ e mapa mapɛ lepile, batingami baduaka bohɔdjɔ Yesu: «Molehi, apalaka wɛ lobɔngedje mia ma pasika djɔ?» <verse eid="MAT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 26:18" />Yesu abasɔmbedjaka: «Kɛni ta ibonga adi moto omɔti ko balani na nde: “Molehi abali: Ehole e mbi eimei, nayake mia ma pasika engbanga na batingami ba mbi adi wɛ.”» <verse eid="MAT 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 26:19" />Batingami bakɔkɔ oko moda mopalaka Yesu ko babɔngedjaka mia ma pasika.<verse eid="MAT 26:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 26:20" />Ehole eimeaka mɔmɔkɔ, Yesu adaka ta mesa engbanga na bapɔsɔlu ba nde domi na babae. <verse eid="MAT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 26:21" />Ehole edakabo bayaka, Yesu abalaka: «Edi soti okobea, nabalaka na nu: omɔti o bino akabakeni.» <verse eid="MAT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 26:22" />Batingami baimeaka na ndjokwa enɛnɛ ko babangaka bohɔdjɔ Yesu, omɔti ngɔngɔ i okina: «Kumu edi mbi?» <verse eid="MAT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 26:23" />Yesu asɔmbedjaka: «Moto adubeake engbanga na mbi lipa ta saani, edi yo moto akabakeni. <verse eid="MAT 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 26:24" />Mwana o Moto akɛke oko elenge ekomama ta tina e nde, endolo ndjokwa na mokabi o Mwana o Moto! Ekɔkida bopele boo moto omina adae pɛ bobotama!» <verse eid="MAT 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 26:25" />Yudasi, yona opalaka bomotɛkɛ, abalaka: «Molehi, editi mbi, edi bea?» Yesu amosɔmbedjaka: «Obali wɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mesa e Kumu</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Mlk 14, 22-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luk 22, 14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1Ko 11, 23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 26:26" />Yana ayakabo, Yesu atombaka mwɛmbɛ ko ngɔngɔ i bosakoa Ndjakomba, abuki ko api na batingami. Abalaka na bu: «Iye edi mokuku mo mbi, tombani ko yakani.» <verse eid="MAT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 26:27" />Atombaka pongono kɔbɔ e vino, ngɔngɔ i bosakoa Ndjakomba, abapaka ko abalaka: «Mwakani no basusu; <verse eid="MAT 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 26:28" />tengasa iye edi makia ma mbi, makia ma edimaneli, imasopeake tina e bato banɛnɛ, tine boyɛmɛ bo pekato i bobo. <verse eid="MAT 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 26:29" />Nabalaka na nu: donga edɛdi, namwɛtebi naikina vino iye mbunoko busa bo mwakabi mbi engbanga na nu vino iye eyanie, ta Bokumu bo Sange e mbi.» <verse eid="MAT 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 26:30" />Ngɔngɔ baembaka ndjembo i tɛkɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26, 30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndj 113-118.</char></note>, bea bakɛkɛ ta makoli ma Olipa.<verse eid="MAT 26:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu adjebedji boo piɛlɛ amoinganeake</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mlk 14, 27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luk 22, 31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yoa 13, 36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 26:31" />Na bea Yesu abalaka na bapɔsɔlu ba nde: «Oko ta bulu bu, watiakenini no basusu, tengasa ekomama ta makomi: “Nabomake mobanei ko bwela bo bhata inanganake pamba isusu.” <verse eid="MAT 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 26:32" />Endolo ngɔngɔ ibopusoa bo mbi, nakɛke aambani ta Galilea.» <verse eid="MAT 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 26:33" />Piɛlɛ abalaka na nde: «Molehi nongo bato basusu bakotia, mbi natotiake.» <verse eid="MAT 26:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 26:34" />Yesu amosɔmbedjaka: «Edi soti nabalaka na wɛ: oko ta bulu bu, boso bo kɔkɔ akɔkɔle, wainganeakeni mbala isato.» <verse eid="MAT 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 26:35" />Piɛlɛ abalaka na nde: «Nongo ekada bogwa, nagwake engbanga na wɛ!» Endolo natoinganeake. Bapɔsɔlu basusu babalaka oko moda momɔti.<verse eid="MAT 26:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aongɔni ta Getesemane</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mlk 14, 32-42</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luk 22, 39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 26:36" />Na bea Yesu aimeaka na bapɔsɔlu ba nde ta polo ebeaka bo Getesemane ko abalaka na bu: «Daani iya, yana akɛi mbi mootɔtɔkɔ tine bongɔnɔ.» <verse eid="MAT 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 26:37" />Atombaka Piɛlɛ ko bana bami babae ba Djebede. Aimeaka booka ndjokwa ko asatungeaka mɛnɛ ta molema. <verse eid="MAT 26:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 26:38" />Abalaka na bu: «Molema mo mbi molumi na ndjokwa elenge nadoi agwa, dikani iya ko ongɔnɔni engbanga na mbi!» <verse eid="MAT 26:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 26:39" />Akɛkɛ moohali na bu, atitedjaka boso mbunoko ta kpɔtɔ ko aongɔnɔkɔ boo: «Sange e mbi, ekabɔngɔ, dongedja bohali na mbi kɔbɔ ye e saya! Enakobea, edae tebopala bo mbi, endolo bopala bo wɛ!» <verse eid="MAT 26:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 26:40" />Asɔmbɔkɔ naikina ta polo edaka bapɔsɔlu basato ko abataneaka bahwɛli. Abalaka na piɛlɛ: «Ohɔnɔkitini boda mosu engbanga na mbi nongo ehole emɔti? <verse eid="MAT 26:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 26:41" />Daani mosu ko ongɔnɔni asakwani ta bomekama. Mwembo modi na ngulu, endolo mokuku modi na bwɛmbu.»<verse eid="MAT 26:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 26:42" />Mbala e babae, asasuaka naikina mootɔtɔkɔ ko aongɔnɔkɔ boo: «Sange e mbi, oboaniti okɔe boo nadae pɛ mwaka kɔbɔ ye! Endolo kina bolulea bo wɛ bokɔme!» <verse eid="MAT 26:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 26:43" />Asombɔkɔ naikina adi bapɔsɔlu ko abataneaka bahwɛli; tengasa miso maimeaka mandi na hiyɔ. <verse eid="MAT 26:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 26:44" />Yesu abakinaka naikina, asasuaka mootɔtɔkɔ ko aongɔnɔkɔ mbala e basato oko na mibalo mibalaka yo boso. <verse eid="MAT 26:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 26:45" />Ngɔngɔ asɔmbɔkɔ adi bapɔsɔlu ko abalaka na bu: «Ohwɛlini oko, odini oko ta bohema? Edɛdi ehole eimei ko Mwana o Moto adoi akabama ta mɔmɔ ma bato babe. <verse eid="MAT 26:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 26:46" />Angɔni, lokɛni! Tengasa moto akabakeni aimei mbuti!»<verse eid="MAT 26:46" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bapei Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mlk 14, 43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luk 22, 47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Yoa 18, 3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 26:47" />Yana adaka Yesu bobala Yudasi, omɔti o batinagami domi na babae aimeaka. Bato banɛnɛ bapeli mipata ko na mihukuku badaka bomokimana. Bakondji ba banganga ba Ndjakomba ko basuku ba ngando ba bayuda babalomaka. <verse eid="MAT 26:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 26:48" />Yudasi yona opalaka botɛkɛ Yesu, abainedjaka embete ye: «Moto wabhimbake mbi, edi yo. Mopeani.» <verse eid="MAT 26:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 26:49" />Mbala emɔti, Yudasi asabateaka mbuti na Yesu ko abalaka na nde: «Ndese, Molehi!» Ko amobhimbaka. <verse eid="MAT 26:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 26:50" />Yesu amosɔmbedjaka: «Mwange e mbi, modjɔ modoi wɛ akɔ, mokɔɔ.» Na bea bato bamina babatamaka mbuti na Yesu, bakwaka diko i nde ko bamopeaka. <verse eid="MAT 26:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 26:51" />Omɔti ta bia badaka na Yesu aninodjaka ebɔ e nde, aihwaka mopata ta igbogbo ko abomaka mosali o mokondji o banganga ba Ndjakomba ko itoi i mosali omina ileneaka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26, 51 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Yoa 18, 26.</char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 26:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 26:52" />Endolo Yesu abalaka na nde: «Sɔmbedja mopata mo wɛ ta igbogbo i yu, tengasa bato basusu bakowoe na mopata bagwakabi na mopata. <verse eid="MAT 26:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 26:53" />Walɛdjɛkɛ boo naboanakiti bobea Sange e mbi adue bokamoani ko mbala emɔti alomeeni koto domi na babae i babwɛndji bonɔ? <verse eid="MAT 26:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 26:54" />Na bea, Makomi maboani bokokedjama moda nda?»<verse eid="MAT 26:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 26:55" />Oko ta ehole emina, Yesu abalaka na bato ibaduaka bomopea: «Mbi, etɔmbi mbi bɛngɛ odueni bopeanini na mipata ko na mihukuku? Masu masusu nadaki na nu ta tepelo tine boleha ko oipeakanini. <verse eid="MAT 26:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 26:56" />Endolo midjɔ misusu mii midi tine bokokedja mibalo mibalaka ba mbaeli ba Ndjakomba ta makomi.» Na bea batingami basusu bamokinaka ko batiaka.<verse eid="MAT 26:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ta boso bo ibolea inɛnɛ i bayuda</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 14:53-65">Mlk 14, 53-65</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-71">Luk 22, 54-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-24">Yoa 18, 13-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 26:57" />Bato ibapeaka Yesu bakɛkɛ na nde adi Kaipa, mokondji o banganga ba Ndjakomba, oho baputoanaka balehi ba mobeko ko na basuku ba ngando. <verse eid="MAT 26:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 26:58" />Piɛlɛ adaka amokimane moobohali mbunoko ta ikanga i ndako e mokondji o banganga ba Ndjakomba. Akweaka ta ikanga i bopango ko adaka engbanga na basindjili tine boendja moda masukeake modjɔ momina.<verse eid="MAT 26:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 26:59" />Bakondji ba banganga ba Ndjakomba ko bato basusu ba ibolea inɛnɛ i basuku ba bayuda, bahombaka enɔeli nongo bobe bomɔti tina e Yesu, bɛngi bamolenee etumbo e bogwa. <verse eid="MAT 26:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 26:60" />Endolo baiediaka, nongokobea bato banɛnɛ baduaka bopa pundi inɛnɛ ibe tina e nde<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26, 60 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Ndj 27, 12; 35, 11.</char></note>. Na bea bato babae baduaka <verse eid="MAT 26:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 26:61" />ko babalaka: «Moto iyo abalaki: “Nadi bobuka tepelo ye e Ndjakomba ko boetonga na masu masato.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26, 61 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Yoa 2, 19.</char></note>”» <verse eid="MAT 26:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 26:62" />Mokondji o banganga ba Ndjakomba aongɔkɔ ko abalaka na Yesu: «Otasɔmbedjaka nongo kɔpi ta midjɔ mabalaka bato ibi bobe tina e wɛ?» <verse eid="MAT 26:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 26:63" />Endolo Yesu adaka oko bogo. Na bea mokondji o banganga ba Ndjakomba abalaka na nde: «Ta kombe e Ndjakomba o bomɔ, nohɔdjɔkɔ olotɔndee: odi Kilito, Mwana o Ndjakomba?» <verse eid="MAT 26:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 26:64" />Yesu amosɔmbedjaka: «Wɛ moto obali. Endolo nabalaka na nu: donga edɛdi wenɛke Mwana o Moto bokadaa ta ebɔ e bami e Ndjakomba o sueya; odini boenɛ pongono bodua ta matute ta busa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26, 64 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndj 110, 1; Ban 7, 13. </char></note>.» <verse eid="MAT 26:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 26:65" />Na bea mokondji o banganga ba Ndjakomba alakaka bisendja bi nde ko abalaka: «Asingi Ndjakomba! Loditi naikina na posa e batemo! Okini no bɛnɛ bosinga bosasingayo Ndjakomba! <verse eid="MAT 26:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 26:66" />Alɛdjɛkɛno naikina nde?» Basɔmbedjaka: «Aboani na etumbo e bogwa.» <verse eid="MAT 26:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MAT 26:67" />Na bea bamotsueaka masɔi ta boso ko bamɔti bamoindaka mabɔtu, bakina bamobomaka bipapata. <verse eid="MAT 26:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MAT 26:68" />Bamotaaka: «Kilito, elɛ bonganga! Osoboma nda!»<verse eid="MAT 26:68" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Piɛlɛ aingani Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">Mlk 14, 66-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luk 22, 56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-27">Yoa 18, 15-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MAT 26:69" />Ta ehole emina piɛlɛ adaka sokolu ta ikanga i bopango. Mosali mwali omɔti abatamaka mbuti na nde ko abalaka: «Wɛ pongono, odaki engbanga na Yesu, moto yona o Galilea.» <verse eid="MAT 26:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MAT 26:70" />Endolo Piɛlɛ ainganaka ta boso bo bato basusu ko abalaka: «Natadjebaka meako mapalaka wɛ bobala na mbi.» <verse eid="MAT 26:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MAT 26:71" />Yana adaka Piɛlɛ bokɛ ta pamba e ekukɛ e i kanga i bopango. Mosali okina amoenɛkɛ ko abalaka na bato ibadaka ena: «Moto iyo adaki na Yesu moto o Nasaleta.» <verse eid="MAT 26:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="MAT 26:72" />Piɛlɛ ainganaka naikina na bobhɛlɛ bhɛli: «Nabalaka soti, natadjebaka moto omina!»<verse eid="MAT 26:72" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="MAT 26:73" />Ngɔngɔ i moehole, bato ibadaka ena babatamaka mbuti na Piɛlɛ ko babalaka: «Edi soti, odi omɔti o bobo: moda mabalaka wɛ, moinedjaka pamba edongi wɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 26:73" /><verse number="74" style="v" sid="MAT 26:74" />Na bea Piɛlɛ asabhɛleaka bhɛli: «Kina boo Ndjakomba apɛni etumbo ekada boo nakosaka! Nasabhɛlei, natadjebaka moto yo!» Oko ta ehole emina, kɔkɔ akɔkɔlɔkɔ., <verse eid="MAT 26:74" /><verse number="75" style="v" sid="MAT 26:75" />Na bea Piɛlɛ alɛdjɛkɛ mibalo mimobaleaka Yesu: «Boso boo kɔkɔ akɔkɔle, winganeakeni mbala isato.» Aimanaka ko ayeaka mɛnɛ.<verse eid="MAT 26:75" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="MAT 27" />
  <para style="s1">Bakɛi na Yesu adi Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 15:1">Mlk 15, 1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-2">Luk 23, 1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-32">Yoa 18, 28-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 27:1" />Ehole eya busa, ta modjukakeli, bakondji basusu ba banganga ba Ndjakomba ko na basuku ba ngando batombaka meko e boowa Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 27:2" />Bamonangaka mbɔti ko bakɛkɛ na nde adi gupɛnɛlɛ Pilato.<verse eid="MAT 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bogwa bo Yudasi</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="ACT 1:18-19">Bik 1, 18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 27:3" />Yudasi mokabi, aokaka boo Yesu bamoleneaka etumbo e bogwa. Aokaka bokɛsɛdji bonɛnɛ ta molema ko akɛkɛ bosɔmbedja palanga djia i bibende tuku isato adi bakondji ba banganga ba Ndjakomba ko na basuku ba ngando. <verse eid="MAT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 27:4" />Abalaka na bu: «Nakɔi pekato, nakabi moto odi pɛ bokɔ bobe ta bogwa!» Endolo bamosɔmbedjaka: «Mo biso nda! Endji wɛ mɛnɛ!» <verse eid="MAT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 27:5" />Yudasi adumbaka palanga imina ta tepelo ngɔngɔ akɛkɛ, bosakoma. <verse eid="MAT 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 27:6" />Bakondji ba banganga ba Ndjakomba baandoaka palanga ko babalaka: «Mobeko mo biso motapaka enɔeli e boisa palanga dji ta nguku e tepelo, tengasa idi palanga i makia.» <verse eid="MAT 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 27:7" />Ngɔngɔ baputoanaka ikita ko badimanaka boo basombe na palanga imina, gbie adi moyoi o poke, tine boimedja gbie emina ikila i bakɛndɛli. <verse eid="MAT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 27:8" />Na tina emina, gbie emina ebeamaka «gbie e makia» mbunoko busa bu. <verse eid="MAT 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 27:9" />Na bea ekokedjamaka mibalo mi mbaeli o Ndjakomba Yilimeya: «Batombaka palanga i bibende tuku isato, motuya moemeaka bana ba Isalɛlɛ, <verse eid="MAT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 27:10" />ko basombaka na yu gbie e moyoi o poke, elenge moda mobaleakani Kumu.»<verse eid="MAT 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu asambi ta boso bo Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 15:2-5">Mlk 15, 2-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:3-5">Luk 23, 3-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:33-38">Yoa 18, 33-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 27:11" />Yesu asambaka ta boso bo gupɛnɛlɛ. Amohɔdjɔkɔ: «Odi mokondji o bayuda?» Yesu asɔmbedjaka: «Wɛ obali.» <verse eid="MAT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 27:12" />Ehole emopundaka bakondji ba banganga ba Ndjakomba ko basuku ba ngando, Yesu aisɔmbedjaka nongo eka. <verse eid="MAT 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 27:13" />Na bea, Pilato abalaka na nde: «Otokaka pundi isusu i balakabo tina e wɛ?» <verse eid="MAT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 27:14" />Endolo Yesu aisɔmbedjaka nongo kɔpi, na bea modjɔ momina mokamodjaka gupɛnɛlɛ mɛnɛ.<verse eid="MAT 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu adimami ta bogwa</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Mlk 15, 6-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luk 23, 13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39">Yoa 18, 39</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:16">19, 16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 27:15" />Ta engi tɛkɛ e pasika, gupɛnɛlɛ adaka na elama e boimedja mobɔlɔkɔ omɔti, yona opalaka bato banɛnɛ bohɔ. <verse eid="MAT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 27:16" />Enakobea, edaka ta ehole emina mobɔlɔkɔ omɔti odjebamaka na kombe e Balabase<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27, 16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yesu Balabase </char><char style="fp" closed="false">ta makomi makina bakamobee Bala Yesu.</char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 27:17" />Na bea Pilato ahɔdjɔkɔ emumu eputoanaka: «Wapalakano notungoeni nda: Balabase kaoko Yesu okabeebo Kilito?» <verse eid="MAT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 27:18" />Tengasa Pilato adjebaka bopele boo bakabaka Yesu na ndjea e ikuwa. <verse eid="MAT 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 27:19" />Ehole edaka Pilato ta ndako e esambi, mwali o nde amolomeaka bwɛndi bu: «Pɛ bokwea ta modjɔ mo moto yona o bodjo, tengasa bulu bu, nayekeami mɛnɛ na ndjɔti ta tina e nde.»<verse eid="MAT 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 27:20" />Bakondji ba banganga ba Ndjakomba ko basuku ba ngando bapangoaka bato banɛnɛ bosɛngɛ botingoa bo Balabase ko bowa Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 27:21" />Gupɛnɛlɛ asɔmbɔkɔ naikina bobahɔdjɔ: «Ta ndanda e bato ibi babae wapalakano notingoeni nda?» Basɔmbedjaka na bogama: «Balabase!» <verse eid="MAT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 27:22" />Pilato abahɔdjɔkɔ: «Nakɔe na Yesu okabee bo Kilito bo?» Bato basusu basɔmbedjaka: «Mobaka ta ekulusu!» <verse eid="MAT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 27:23" />Pilato abahɔdjɔkɔ: «Bobe bokɔi yo nda?» Endolo bagamaka naikina na ngulu: «Mobaka ta ekulusu!» <verse eid="MAT 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 27:24" />Ehole enɛkɛ Pilato boo aidaka na eka ekina e bokɔ, endolo djenge ehɛkɛ oko bohɛ, atombaka madiba, asosaka mɔmɔ ta boso bo emumu e bato ko abalaka: «Makia ma moto iyo matabakamake ta molo mo mbi! Edi modjɔ mo bino bɛnɛ!» <verse eid="MAT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 27:25" />Bato basusu basɔmbedjaka: «Kinabo makia ma nde madae ta diko i biso ko ta diko i bana ba biso!» <verse eid="MAT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 27:26" />Na bea Pilato atingoaka Balabase; akɛsedjaka Yesu mbalake ko abapaka tine bamobake ta ekulusu.<verse eid="MAT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Basoda basɛki Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 15:16-20">Mlk 15, 16-20</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Yoa 19, 2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 27:27" />Basoda ba Pilato batombaka Yesu ta ndako e mokondji ko basoda banɛnɛ baputoanaka mbuti na nde. <verse eid="MAT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 27:28" />Baihwaka bisendja bi nde ko bamolwadjaka mokoto mokpɛtu. <verse eid="MAT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 27:29" />Bayoaka egbala e ndjubɛ ko baebakeaka ta molo mo nde ko bamopedjaka mososongo ta ebɔ e nde e bami. Bakwaka magbundɔ ta boso bo nde ko bamosɛkɛkɛ na bobala: «Mokondji o bayuda bwandae!» <verse eid="MAT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 27:30" />Bamotueyaka masɔi, batombaka mososongo ko baimeaka bomoboma ta molo. <verse eid="MAT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 27:31" />Ngɔngɔ i bomosɛkɛ, bamoiwaka mokoto, bamolwadjaka naikina bisendja bi nde ko bakɛkɛ na nde tine bomobaka ta ekulusu.<verse eid="MAT 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu abakami ta ekulusu</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mlk 15, 21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luk 23, 26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yoa 19, 17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 27:32" />Ta boima bo ibonga, basakanaka na momi omɔti o ngando Kulɛnɛ, obeakabo Simo; basoda bamotombedjaka na ngulu ekulusu e Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 27:33" />Baimeaka ta polo ebeakabo Gologota, etingodjaka «Polo e egɔgɔlɔ e molo.» <verse eid="MAT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 27:34" />Oho bapaka Yesu mana ma vino mabongoanedjakabo na kasa i boyo; ngɔngɔ i bomameka, alonaka bomamwaka. <verse eid="MAT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 27:35" />Na bea bamobakaka ta ekulusu. Ngɔngɔ, babomaka djonga tine bakabana bisendja bi nde. <verse eid="MAT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 27:36" />Na bea badaka ena tine bomobanea. <verse eid="MAT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 27:37" />Ta diko i molo mo nde, babakaka ikomi iinedjaka tina e etumbo e nde: «Moto iyo adi Yesu, mokondji o bayuda.» <verse eid="MAT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 27:38" />Batɔmbi babae bia ibabakamaka ta ekulusu engbanga na Yesu, omɔti ta ebɔ e bami ko okina ta ebɔ e bali.<verse eid="MAT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 27:39" />Bato ibadaka banɔe na ndjea bamosingaka eni bagbɔkee melo. <verse eid="MAT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 27:40" />Babalaka: «Wɛ moto opalaki bobuka tepelo ko boetonga na masu masato, saheledja wɛ mɛnɛ! Okada Mwana o Ndjakomba tita ta ekulusu!» <verse eid="MAT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 27:41" />Bakondji ba banganga ba Ndjakomba, balehi ba mobeko ko na basuku ngando, ibo basusu badaka bataa Yesu ko babalaka: <verse eid="MAT 27:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 27:42" />«Aheledjeka bato bakina, endolo aboaniti bosaheledja yo mɛnɛ! Akadaa mokondji o Isalɛlɛ, atite ta ekulusu edɛdi bɛngi lomodimee! <verse eid="MAT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 27:43" />Aisaka malɛi ma nde adi Ndjakomba ko adaka bobala: “Mbi, nadi Mwana o Ndjakomba.” Ekadakobea, Ndjakomba amopalaka, amekemoheledja edɛdi!» <verse eid="MAT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 27:44" />Ko batɔmbi ibabakakabo ta ekulusu engbanga na nde ibo pongono bamosingaka oko moda mua.<verse eid="MAT 27:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bogwa bo Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mlk 15, 33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luk 23, 44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yoa 19, 28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 27:45" />Bobanga midi, modidi modaka ta ngondo esusu ko mbunoko bokimana ehole e basato ngɔngɔ i midi. <verse eid="MAT 27:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 27:46" />Bokimana mbuti na ehole e basato, Yesu agamaka na ngulu: «Eloi, Eloi, lema sakabatani?» Etingodji «Ndjakomba o mbi, Ndjakomba o mbi, tina ndani okinini?» <verse eid="MAT 27:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 27:47" />Ta tei e bato ibaemaka ena, bamokaka ko baimeaka bobala: «Abeaka Elia!» <verse eid="MAT 27:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 27:48" />Mbala emɔti, omɔti apotaka botomba imbusu, aidubeaka ta vino engayi ko aenangaka ta sɔngɔ e mososongo, ngɔngɔ aepaka Yesu bɛngi aemwake. <verse eid="MAT 27:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 27:49" />Endolo bakina babalaka: «Amba, loendjeni kaoko Elia aduake bomoheledja!»<verse eid="MAT 27:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 27:50" />Yesu agamaka naikina na ngulu ko ayanedjaka mwembo. <verse eid="MAT 27:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 27:51" />Oko ta ehole emina, esendja esɛpeakabo ta tepelo ealeaka bodonga odiko mbunoko na se. Kpɔtɔ ikumanaka, mabanga maaleanaka, <verse eid="MAT 27:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 27:52" />makila madipoamaka ko basɛnɔke banɛnɛ ibagwaka basɔmbɔkɔ ta bomɔ. <verse eid="MAT 27:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 27:53" />Baimaka ta makila ko ngɔngɔ i bopusoa bo Yesu, bakweaka ta Yelusalɛmɛ, ibonga isɛnɔke ko basenɛmedjaka na bato banɛnɛ. <verse eid="MAT 27:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 27:54" />Kapitɛne o basoda ba Loma engbanga na basoda ibadaka bobanea Yesu, yana baenɛkɛ bokumana bo kpɔtɔ ko midjɔ misusu iminɔmɔkɔ, baimeaka na bɔɔ bonɛnɛ ko babalaka: «Adaki mɛnɛ Mwana o Ndjakomba!» <verse eid="MAT 27:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 27:55" />Bali banɛnɛ daka oho ko baendjaka bohali: ibakimanaka Yesu donga ta Galilea tine bomokɔmedja. <verse eid="MAT 27:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 27:56" />Ta ndanda e bali bamina, edaka na Malia, moto o ngando e Magadala, Malia, nange e Djake ko Esepu, ko nange e bana bami ba Djebede.<verse eid="MAT 27:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bopuseama bo Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mlk 15, 42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luk 23, 50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yoa 19, 38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 27:57" />Ehole eimeaka mɔmɔkɔ, moto omɔti modieli o ngando e Alimatayo, aimeaka. Abeamaka na kombe e Esepu ko adaka pongono motingami o Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 27:58" />Akɛkɛ botaneana na Pilato ko amohɔdjɔkɔ mokuku mo Yesu. Na bea Pilato apaka ndjea e bopa mokuku mo Yesu adi Esepu. <verse eid="MAT 27:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 27:59" />Esepu atombaka mokuku mo Yesu, amodingaka na mbendja esɛnɔke e motuya monɛnɛ <verse eid="MAT 27:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 27:60" />ko amosambeaka ta ikila i nde yo mɛnɛ itɔkɔbo ta ibanga. Ahilingodjaka ibanga igbɔgbɔ tine bodipa ekweeli e ikila. Ngɔngɔ akɛkɛ. <verse eid="MAT 27:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 27:61" />Malia Magadala ko Malia ekina badaka ena, bayɛli ikila.<verse eid="MAT 27:61" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Basoda tine bobanea ikila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 27:62" />Aya busa, edaka busa ibokimanaka busa bo bobɔngedjama bo sabata, bakondji ba banganga ba Ndjakomba ko na bapalusai bakɛkɛ adi Pilato. <verse eid="MAT 27:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 27:63" />Babalaka na nde: «Tata mokondji, losɔmbedji malɛi adi moto iyo oboloa, ehole edaka yo adi mɔ, abalaka: “Nasɔmbɔke ta bomɔ, ngɔngɔ i masu masato.” <verse eid="MAT 27:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 27:64" />Na bea pa ndjea boo babanee bopele ikila imina mbunoko ta isu i basato. Esakada boo batingami ba nde, badue, boiba mokuku mo nde ko bobala naikina adi bato: “Apusoi ta tei e bago.” Boloabu, bosakanɔ bo boso.» <verse eid="MAT 27:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 27:65" />Pilato abalaka na bu: «Basoda bo bia, batombani ko kɛɛni bobanea ikila moda mapalakano.» <verse eid="MAT 27:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 27:66" />Na bea bakɛkɛ boisa embete ta ibanga idaka ta ekweeli e ikila tine bobanea ikila bopele.<verse eid="MAT 27:66" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="MAT 28" />
  <para style="s1">Bopusoa bo Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 16:1-10">Mlk 16, 1-10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luk 24, 1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yoa 20, 1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 28:1" />Ngɔngɔ i isu i sabata, ehuma e busa bo eyenga, Malia o ngando e Magadala ko na Malia ekina bakɛkɛ boendja ikila. <verse eid="MAT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 28:2" />Mbala emɔti, kpɔtɔ ikumanaka na ngulu; obwɛndji o Kumu atitaka ta busa, ahilingodjaka ibanga ko adaka ta diko i du. <verse eid="MAT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 28:3" />Moda mo nde modaka elenge bongɛsɛ bo mokaikai ko bisendja bi nde bidaka bipu ipɛɛ elenge mamwɛ ma mbuwa. <verse eid="MAT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 28:4" />Basoda baimeaka na bɔɔ bonɛnɛ mbunoko boimea elenge bato bago. <verse eid="MAT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 28:5" />Endolo obwɛndji abalaka na bali: «Pɛ bobangani. Nadjebaka boo wahombakani Yesu, yona obakakabo ta ekulusu. <verse eid="MAT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 28:6" />Aditi naikina iya, apusoi oko elenge abalakayo. Duani, endjani polo emoisakabo. <verse eid="MAT 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 28:7" />Na bea kɛni pɛpɛlɛ botɔndea batingami ba nde boo apusoi ta tei e bago ko akɛi boambani ta Galilea, wamoenɛkeni oho. Endjani bwɛndi bopalaki mbi bobala na nu.»<verse eid="MAT 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 28:8" />Badongaka pɛpɛlɛ ta ikila, balumaka na bɔɔ ko na mongandi monɛnɛ, bapotaka tine bopa bwɛndi adi batingami ba nde. <verse eid="MAT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 28:9" />Mbala emɔti, Yesu aduaka tine bosakana na bu ko abalaka: «Ndese e bino yena e!» Babatamaka mbuti na nde, bapeaka mako ma nde ko bamokumedjaka. <verse eid="MAT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 28:10" />Yesu abalaka na bu: «Pɛ bobangani. Kɛni bobala adi bange i mbi bakɛ ta Galilea: edi oho baenɛkeni.»<verse eid="MAT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mibalo mi basoda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 28:11" />Yana adakabo na ndjea, ekenge ekina e basoda ibadaka tine bobanea ikila basɔmbɔkɔ ta ibonga ko batɔndeaka bakondji ba banganga ba Ndjakomba, midjɔ misusu imimeaka. <verse eid="MAT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 28:12" />Bakondji ba banganaga ba Ndjakomba baputoanaka engbanga na basuku ba ngando ta ikita: ngɔngɔ i bodimeana bopaka palanga inɛnɛ adi basoda <verse eid="MAT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 28:13" />ko babalaka na bu: «Balani na bato: batingami ba moto omina baduaki boiba mokuku mo nde na bulu ehole edakiso lohwɛli. <verse eid="MAT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 28:14" />Ko ekadabo gupɛnɛlɛ aoki modjɔ momina, iso bɛnɛ lamopangoake bɛngi odaeni pɛ bodiani lindo.» <verse eid="MAT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 28:15" />Basoda batombaka palanga ko badimaka simbisi ibapakabo. Nongokobea, gala emina enanganaka ta tei e bayuda mbunoko busa bu.<verse eid="MAT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu asinedji na batingami ba nde</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mlk 16, 14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luk 24, 36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yoa 20, 19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Bik 1, 6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 28:16" />Batingami domi na omɔti bakɛkɛ ta Galilea, ta ikoli ibatɔndeaka Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 28:17" />Ehole emoenɛkɛbo, bamokumedjaka; bakina ta tei e bobo, badaka na kitɛ. <verse eid="MAT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 28:18" />Yesu abatamaka mbuti na bu ko abalaka: «Bokondji bosusu bopami na mbi donga ta busa mbunoko ta ngondo. <verse eid="MAT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 28:19" />Na bea kɛɛni, adi bato basusu ba bikomi bi ngondo ko baimedjani batingami ba mbi; bainani ta kombe e Sango, na Mwana ko na Mwembo Mosɛnɔke. <verse eid="MAT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 28:20" />Balehani boo babanee simbisi isusu iopakani mbi. Ko djebani boo nadi na nu masu masusu mbunoko ta suka e ngondo.»<verse eid="MAT 28:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 28" />
</usx>